(54, 'Aliasgar Bagasrawala', 'alisteely@gmail.com', '7387117650', 'Mumbai', 'Dear PhotoWalks India,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Ali, and I am an aspiring photographer based in Mumbai, eager to enhance my skills and explore the vibrant city through the lens of a camera. I recently came across the Photowalk India Association and was immediately drawn to the idea of joining a community of fellow photography enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nI believe that participating in your photo walks would provide me with the perfect opportunity to learn, grow, and share my passion for photography with like-minded individuals. I am particularly excited about the chance to explore different locations, experiment with various photography techniques, and receive constructive feedback from experienced photographers in the group.\r\n\r\nI am eager to contribute to the group by bringing enthusiasm and dedication to every session. Additionally, my background in media sorting, visual data handling, and photo editing can add value to the community, making the learning journey more enjoyable and enriching for everyone.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if there are any specific steps or requirements to join the Photowalk India Association. I am looking forward to the possibility of being a part of this wonderful community and contributing to our collective passion for photography.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I am excited to learn from and collaborate with other talented photographers in Mumbai.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\n\r\nAliasgar Bagasrawala\r\n7387117650\r\nInstagram Handle: https://www.instagram.com/alibagasra/', '2024-08-14 16:50:02', '2024-08-14 16:50:02', NULL),
