(147, 'Jason Ferguson', 'jason@thefergs.net', '4046257232', 'Atlanta, Georgia USA', 'I am in Bangalore for this weekend (26-27 July 2025) and would like to hire a photographer to go with me to KR Flower Market very early in the AM and provide some advice/guidance to capture the early morning activity.  I would prefer a private guide vs. a group event.  Is this something you can do?  Thank you!  You can reach me via email or mobile / whatsapp.  # is +1 404 625 7232', '2025-07-23 15:21:21', '2025-07-23 15:21:21', NULL),
(148, 'Ashwanth', 'ashwanth7588@yahoo.com', '9952191954', 'Chennai', 'Hi ,\r\n\r\nI’m Ashwanth and I handle the Times of India Metro Supplements  brand for our South editions. I’ve been following this page, and I truly admire how you’ve been building the community and showcasing such powerful visuals.\r\n\r\nWe’re planning a special campaign for World Photography Day this year and I’d love to explore a possible collaboration with you and the photocommunity in India . Thought it’d be great to connect and discuss how we could work together on this.\r\n\r\nSo if you can share your contact will connect', '2025-08-16 11:37:58', '2025-08-16 11:37:58', NULL),
(149, 'Sanjeev Ranjan', 'sanjeev.ranjan63@gmail.com', '9910382637', 'Faridabad', 'Photography is the art of  painting with light,  turning fleeting moments into lasting memories.', '2025-08-19 16:58:25', '2025-08-19 16:58:25', NULL),
