(176, 'Krushna Vitthal Giram', '23070534@ycce.in', '9699746377', 'Nagpur', 'Hello Team Photo Walk India,\r\n\r\nGreetings!\r\n\r\nWe are from Drishti – The Photography & Media Club of YCCE. We would like to collaborate with Photo Walk India to organize a photo walk at a suitable outdoor location in or around Nagpur.\r\n\r\nThis collaboration is purely for community building and networking, with no monetary involvement—just bringing together photography enthusiasts from both communities to connect, learn, and create.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your response and hoping to collaborate soon.\r\n\r\nThank you', '2026-01-19 10:31:06', '2026-01-19 10:31:06', NULL),
