(22, 'Jamalpur Market', 'jamalpur-market', '2023122806365322fbd5932f3638e296c46026daebaa50.jpg', 'Saptarshi Moksha Dham', 8, '2024-01-20 07:30:00', 'Step into a world where petals paint the air with hues of vibrant stories, and the hustle of commerce dances in rhythm with the fragrance of blossoms. Photowalk India is delighted to announce its next visual odyssey through the corridors of Asia\'s only flower market - the Jamalpur Flower Market in Ahmedabad. Brace yourself for a journey where every click captures the essence of a 24-hour floral haven that stands as a unique masterpiece in the heart of Gujarat.', '20231228063653d3ebe9327ceb8cdeb210896a5712fa22.jpg', 'As you step into Jamalpur Flower Market, the first thing that overwhelms your senses is the vibrancy of colors. Thousands of flowers, each with its own tale to tell, create an atmosphere that is nothing short of magical', 'The air is thick with the heady perfume of roses, marigolds, and jasmine, weaving a story of scents that beckon photographers to capture the very soul of this vibrant marketplace.', '20231228063653697ce82768964f4ab971731862dbf784.jpg', 'Set in the heart of Ahmedabad, the history of Jamalpur Flower Market is as rich as the petals it houses.', 'Established decades ago, this market has blossomed into Asia\'s sole flower market, a testament to Ahmedabad\'s deep-rooted connection with horticulture. The formation of this floral haven speaks volumes about the cultural and economic significance that flowers hold in the region.', 'The marketplace itself is a labyrinth of fragrant wonders. From neatly arranged bouquets to heaps of loose petals waiting to be chosen, every corner tells a story of nature\'s bounty and human creativity.', 'The vendors, often with hands adorned in a palette of vibrant powders from their floral offerings, are the lifeblood of this market. Their camaraderie and enthusiasm create an infectious energy that permeates every inch of the marketplace.', '20231228063654bac34150c43cfa85c22ff744d0a82312.jpg', 'What sets Jamalpur Flower Market apart is not just its vibrant atmosphere but also the unique way in which business unfolds within its petals. The market operates round the clock, making it a 24-hour floral carnival where buyers and sellers engage in a symphony of transactions at all hours. The bustling activity is a spectacle that beckons photographers to freeze moments in time, from the predawn negotiations to the late-night haggles over the last of the day\'s blooms.\r\n\r\nThe vendors, with their deft hands and flower-strewn stalls, bring to life the economic importance of Jamalpur Flower Market. Beyond being a visual feast, the market plays a pivotal role in Ahmedabad\'s economy, serving as a hub for flower trade that extends far beyond the city limits. The economic bloom of this market extends its petals to touch the lives of farmers, traders, and enthusiasts alike, creating a floral ecosystem that thrives on the beauty of nature.', 'Surrounding the market, the ambiance is a symphony of contrasts. As the flower vendors go about their bustling business, the city around them awakens to another day. The juxtaposition of the serene beauty of the flowers and the urban humdrum creates a captivating backdrop for photographers seeking to capture the heartbeat of Ahmedabad.\r\nJoin Photowalk India in this visual escapade through the vibrant petals and pulsating energy of Jamalpur Flower Market. As we embark on this journey, let your lens be the storyteller, capturing the intricate dance of commerce and nature that unfolds in this unique floral haven. From the history that paved its way to the present-day hustle, every frame is an opportunity to freeze a moment in time in one of Asia\'s biggest flower market.', '202312280636545bbfeb4e5c909a352d6084bbb29708ba.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d1836.173949265644!2d72.57713876943113!3d23.010995072488136!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x395e85ae6f9cb1eb%3A0xf527103fb2731a68!2sSaptarshi%20Moksha%20Dham!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1703744400959!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600px\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023-12-28 13:36:54', '2024-01-18 11:36:36', NULL),
(23, 'Mumbai Heritage PhotoWalk', 'mumbai-heritage-photowalk', '2023122816505362fe3e3a4112b004607536aa6207b847.jpg', 'The Asiatic Society', 1, '2025-02-15 07:30:00', 'Welcome to the Mumbai Heritage Photowalk, a unique experience that takes you on a journey through the rich culture and history of South Mumbai. This photowalk covers various lanes and architectural monuments, allowing you to discover the city\'s hidden gems by foot. As you walk through the bustling streets of South Mumbai, you will be transported back in time to the colonial era, with its stunning architectures and fascinating stories. The photowalk will take you through narrow lanes, showcasing the vibrant street life and bustling markets of Mumbai.', '202312281650530bcf32112d8b61b62be68b828dd7769e.jpg', 'Welcome to the Mumbai Heritage Photowalk, a unique experience that takes you on a journey through the rich culture and history of South Mumbai. This photowalk covers various lanes and architectural monuments, allowing you to discover the city\'s hidden gems by foot. As you walk through the bustling streets of South Mumbai, you will be transported back in time to the colonial era, with its stunning architectures and fascinating stories. The photowalk will take you through narrow lanes, showcasing the vibrant street life and bustling markets of Mumbai.', 'The Asiatic Society of Mumbai, formerly known as the Asiatic Society of Bombay, is a renowned learned society in the field of Asian studies. Its roots can be traced back to the Literary Society of Bombay, which was established in Mumbai on 26 November 1804 by Sir James Mackintosh. As we gathered in the grand library, filled with centuries-old books and manuscripts, we took a group photo to commemorate our visit. It was a truly memorable experience to be surrounded by such rich history and knowledge, and I am grateful for the chance to have been a part of it.', '20231228182125151af147003a0069becfd29b9baf955a.png', 'Flora Fountain, a stunning piece of architectural heritage, is situated at the Hutatma Chowk in the bustling Fort business district of South Mumbai, India. This ornately sculpted fountain was built in 1864 and serves as a tribute to the Roman goddess Flora. Its intricate design and beautiful carvings make it a popular tourist destination and a beloved landmark for the locals', 'The fountain is a symbol of Mumbai\'s rich history and serves as a reminder of its colonial past. With its grandeur and elegance, Flora Fountain stands as a testament to the skilled craftsmanship and artistic vision of the past. It continues to be a source of beauty and inspiration for all who visit it.', 'As we walk through Flora Fountain, a prominent landmark in Mumbai, we are greeted with the bustling Maharana Gandhi Road. This road boasts a mix of old and new architecture, taking us on a journey through the city\'s history. On both sides of the road, we can see impressive buildings that showcase the rich heritage and culture of Mumbai.', 'The majestic Mumbai University stands tall with its iconic clock tower, while the grand Army Navy Building exudes an aura of strength and power. These architectural marvels are a reflection of the city\'s past and its evolution into a modern metropolis. As we continue our walk, we are greeted by the charming Kala Ghoda, a bustling art and cultural district that is home to numerous galleries, museums, and cafes. The entire walk along Maharana Gandhi Road is a feast for the eyes, as we marvel at the beautiful structures and soak in the vibrant atmosphere of Mumbai.', '20231228165057a3db41cea349f027b7a91c65e6c94c51.png', 'The last leg of our photowalk we reach the iconic Gateway of India and the majestic Taj hotel. The Gateway of India, a 20th-century monument built to commemorate the visit of King George V and Queen Mary to Mumbai, stood tall and proud, welcoming us with open arms', 'Adjacent to it was the magnificent Taj hotel, one of the oldest and most luxurious hotels in India. Its stunning architecture and intricate details left us mesmerized as we clicked away with our cameras, trying to capture every angle and aspect of these magnificent structure.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe complete our journey at the Swami Vivekanand Statue, where we bid farewell to one another.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo come and join us for an unforgettable photowalk experience as we explore the enchanting lanes and monuments of South Mumbai on foot.', '2023122816505724bebcafdc84a33cb3390560fcc74006.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3773.989733040739!2d72.83322467520175!3d18.93184858224326!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7d1db2d1680df%3A0x2ce4015ac112d3f9!2sThe%20Asiatic%20Society%2C%20Mumbai!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1703782052509!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Heritage Photowalk by Fujifjilm', 'Heritage Photowalk by Fujifjilm', '2023-12-28 23:51:01', '2025-02-11 00:42:29', NULL),
(24, 'Dumas Beach', 'dumas-beach', '20231230091941d036062193a329404d2e16fd8431160f.png', 'Dumas Hotel', 13, '2024-01-27 07:30:00', 'Dumas Beach is a picturesque rural beach situated along the Arabian Sea, just 21 kilometres southwest of the bustling city of Surat in the Indian state of Gujarat. The beach offers a serene escape from the chaos of city life, making it a perfect spot for relaxation and rejuvenation.', '20231230092439b29c150a1cfae3d76fdf7e56352a57cb.jpg', 'Dumas Beach is a picturesque rural beach situated along the Arabian Sea, just 21 kilometres southwest of the bustling city of Surat in the Indian state of Gujarat. The beach offers a serene escape from the chaos of city life, making it a perfect spot for relaxation and rejuvenation.', 'Visitors can enjoy a leisurely stroll along the shoreline, take a dip in the sea, or simply soak up the sun while admiring the stunning views. Dumas Beach also holds cultural significance as it is believed to be a haunted location due to its history as a burial ground for Hindus', '202312300919426c346fd4f6139afddd87e2df911709a2.jpg', 'This adds an element of mystery and intrigue to the beach, making it an alluring destination for tourists. Whether one is seeking a tranquil retreat or an adventure into the supernatural, Dumas Beach has something to offer for everyone.', 'As the day progresses on the beach, the atmosphere becomes lively and bustling with activity. The sound of waves crashing against the shore is accompanied by the delicious aroma of various food stalls that line the beach. People can be seen walking and exploring the different options, trying out local delicacies and international cuisines. The beach\'s long promenade is a popular spot for people to gather, sit, and relax for long hours, taking in the breathtaking view of the vast ocean. Groups of friends and families can be seen chatting, playing games, or simply enjoying each other\'s company while basking in the warm sun.', 'The beach truly comes to life as vendors walk around selling their goods, children run around playing, and music fills the air. It is a vibrant and bustling scene that adds to the charm and appeal of the beach as a popular destination for locals and tourists alike.', '. The food stalls and activities create a sense of community and bring people from all walks of life together to enjoy the beautiful surroundings and each other\'s company.', '2023123009194246a9a0790a1d764bba1f631f2121514e.png', 'The Dairya Ganesh Temple, located at the end of the beach, is not only a place of worship but also a source of awe and fascination for visitors. The temple attracts many worshippers who come to offer their prayers and seek blessings from the deity. However, what makes this temple even more special is the stunning sunset view that can be witnessed from its premises. As the sun sets over the horizon, the golden rays illuminate the temple and its surroundings, creating a breathtaking sight. Moreover, the area surrounding the temple is ecologically rich and diverse, adding to its charm and making it a perfect spot for nature lovers to explore. With its combination of religious significance, natural beauty, and serene atmosphere, the Dairya Ganesh Temple at the end of the beach is truly a must-visit destination.', 'It is not a common sight to see towering electrical lines stretching along the beach, making it a rare and unique spectacle. These lines, often seen in urban areas, are a stark contrast to the natural beauty of the beach. The tall metal structures stand out against the blue sky and white sands, almost appearing out of place in such a serene environment. However, these electrical lines serve an important purpose, providing electricity to nearby buildings and homes. Despite their functional purpose, they add an industrial touch to the beach, reminding us of the ever-advancing world we live in. As I walk along the shore and take in this unusual sight, I am reminded of the juxtaposition between modern technology and the simplicity of nature. It is a reminder that even in the most peaceful and tranquil places, signs of human impact can still be found.', '20231230091942b69d90ad8b93cf6723ceb440eaac5bff.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d930.6953178669432!2d72.71476921127889!3d21.081396510965!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be053d976bd9a67%3A0x467846ed763204fe!2sHotel%20Dumas!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1703927796582!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2023-12-30 16:19:42', '2024-01-21 18:27:53', NULL),
(25, 'Futala Lake', 'futala-lake', '202401070616334f812b59e7949bc424a09f591b812f28.jpg', 'Sharda Mandir', 12, '2024-01-26 08:00:00', 'In the western area of Nagpur, ancient Futala Lake has existed for 200 years. In the absence of maintenance, the use of this prehistoric lake was limited to cattle washing only. It was therefore decided in 2003 to beautify this lake from NIT funds with equal aid from the state government.\r\n\r\n\r\nTanga (carriage) at Futala Lake\r\nThe work was done in two stages. Desilting was done on large scale along with the removal of lotus plants and other waste from the lake', '20240107070708d85c267fb25e5f39bdc33bbf69ff3f02.jpg', 'The Futala Lake, located in Nagpur, is not only a famous lake in the city but is also known throughout the state of Maharashtra. This exquisitely beautiful lake is a popular tourist destination for its picturesque views and serene atmosphere. The lake is surrounded by lush greenery, making it a perfect spot for nature lovers to relax and unwind. Apart from its natural charm, the lake also offers various recreational activities like boating, Light Fountain , eateries making it a favorite spot for families and friends to spend quality time together.', 'The lake also hosts several cultural events, fairs, and food festivals throughout the year, attracting visitors from all over the state. Its popularity has earned it the title of \'the pride of Nagpur\' and has made it an important landmark of the city. From locals to tourists, the Futala Lake never fails to mesmerize everyone with its beauty and charm, making it a must-visit destination in Maharashtra.', '20240107061633f94496437ccf3f7d53f4344e050d2961.png', 'The serene and picturesque lake, surrounded by more than 60 acres of land and lush green trees, has become a popular tourist destination. Located in the heart of a bustling city, this tranquil oasis offers a much-needed escape from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. As the sun sets, the lake comes alive with an enchanting light fountain show that mesmerizes visitors and draws them in.', 'The sparkling water and dazzling lights create a magical ambiance that is truly breathtaking. People from all walks of life flock to this lake to witness the evening light fountain shows, making it a must-visit attraction for both locals and tourists alike.', 'It\'s no wonder that this hidden gem has become a favorite spot for relaxation and entertainment, providing a perfect blend of nature and technology. The beauty and charm of this lake, coupled with the spectacular fountain show, make it a must-see destination for anyone seeking a peaceful and enchanting experience.', 'The location of a place plays a crucial role in photography, and this particular location is an ideal spot for capturing stunning images. With its vast expanse of the lake, one can easily get a variety of wide-angle shots that showcase the beauty of nature. Moreover, the presence of vendors selling food adds an interesting element to the scene, making it perfect for portraits and street photography', '20240107061633a6843b82b11cc2523ef71f9bbc025ce2.jpg', 'Our photowalk in this area will not only allow one to capture beautiful images but also provide a different perspective on the subjects around. It will help one to see beyond the surface and capture unique and meaningful shots. The combination of nature, local vendors, and the opportunity to explore through our photowalk makes this location a paradise for photographers of all levels', 'Whether one is a beginner or an experienced professional, this place will surely offer endless opportunities to capture breathtaking photographs. So, if you want to enhance your photography skills or simply enjoy capturing stunning images, this location is definitely worth a visit.', '20240107071140353b8ed502dd22cd583270de06c9d2bf.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1860.521656188384!2d79.04331107947142!3d21.150674547796!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bd4c046fdbe2d39%3A0xd0ed33f63f1ca57c!2sSharda%20Mandir!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1704608112708!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Futala Lake Photowalk', 'The Futala Lake, located in Nagpur, is not only a famous lake in the city but is also known throughout the state of Maharashtra. This exquisitely beautiful lake is a popular tourist destination for its picturesque views and serene atmosphere\r\nThe location of a place plays a crucial role in photography, and this particular location is an ideal spot for capturing stunning images. With its vast expanse of the lake, one can easily get a variety of wide-angle shots that showcase the beauty of nature. Moreover, the presence of vendors selling food adds an interesting element to the scene, making it perfect for portraits and street photography', '2024-01-07 13:16:33', '2024-01-10 00:34:47', NULL),
(26, '\"Mullick ghat \" Flower Market', 'mullick-ghat-flower-market', '202401260703369ff2c297e5b8b514d037a592c7bb9b4d.jpg', 'Traditional Indian Wrestling School', 4, '2025-11-30 07:30:00', 'Located near the famous Howrah Bridge on the Hooghly River at the Mallik Ghat, the flower market is a bustling hub of activity, bursting with vibrant colors and a continuous flow of people. From the early hours of the morning, vendors and buyers alike gather to sell and purchase an array of flowers in different hues, shapes, and sizes.', '20240126074652ec60776e06a10b0a6d126d5f6db92647.png', 'Located near the famous Howrah Bridge on the Hooghly River at the Mallik Ghat, the flower market is a bustling hub of activity, bursting with vibrant colors and a continuous flow of people. From the early hours of the morning, vendors and buyers alike gather to sell and purchase an array of flowers in different hues, shapes, and sizes. The market is filled with the rich scent of flowers, from fiery orange marigolds to delicate jasmine-like togor phool.', 'The vendors, who also reside in makeshift shelters within the market, are constantly busy creating beautiful flower arrangements and bouquets that are in high demand during festivals and religious occasions. This market is not only a local attraction but also supplies flowers to neighboring states, making it a significant part of the region\'s economy. With its lively atmosphere and unique offerings, a visit to Kolkata\'s flower market is an experience that should not be missed.', '20240126070336dfc1da6a5f4d41fd8585d6af05c0ac55.png', 'When wandering the bustling streets of the city, one cannot miss the chaotic flower market that is excellent for street photography and portrait shots. The vibrant colors and fragrant scents of the flowers immediately catch your attention as you make your way through the bustling crowds. The market is a hub of activity, with vendors loudly haggling with customers and people hurrying to get their hands on the perfect bouquet. Amidst the chaos, there are endless opportunities for photographers to capture candid moments of locals bargaining for their favorite blooms or vendors proudly displaying their colorful arrangements.', 'The market\'s vibrant energy and diverse array of flowers make it the perfect backdrop for portrait shots as well, with blooming florals serving as a beautiful and natural prop. From close-up shots of delicate petals to wide-angle captures of the whole bustling scene, the chaotic flower market offers an endless array of possibilities for photographers looking to capture the essence of a bustling city and its people.', 'The Howrah Bridge in Kolkata, spanning over the Hooghly River, offers an excellent opportunity for photographers to capture the stunning morning glimpse of the city. With its picturesque landscape and the iconic bridge as the backdrop, this location is a favorite among photographers. The combination of the rising sun, the gentle rippling of the river, and the bustling activity on and around the bridge creates a beautiful and dynamic scene that is perfect for capturing in photographs.', 'The golden hour light adds a warm and magical touch to the images, making them truly breathtaking. From wide-angle shots to close-ups of the intricate details of the bridge, photographers can capture a variety of stunning landscape shots from this vantage point. Whether a professional or an amateur, anyone with a camera can showcase their skills and creativity in capturing the unique beauty of this spot. It is no wonder that the Howrah Bridge has become a must-visit location for photographers looking to capture the essence of Kolkata\'s morning charm.', '202401260703362f898617a12ddf0b90a16732db2c088f.png', 'Come join us for our photowalk and get ready for an unforgettable experience! Our photowalk is the perfect opportunity to explore your creative side while capturing stunning images. Whether you\'re a professional photographer or just someone who enjoys taking pictures, our photowalk is open to all. Our experienced guides will take you on a journey through the most picturesque spots in the city, providing insider tips and tricks along the way. You\'ll have the chance to meet like-minded individuals, share your passion for photography, and create lasting memories.', 'So grab your camera and join in for a day filled with fun, learning, and beautiful photographs. We guarantee that you\'ll leave with a new perspective and a great collection of photos that will make your friends jealous. Don\'t miss out on this amazing opportunity to join in for our photowalk and be sure to have a great experience !', '202401260746527413346831778d80643583f9c5586f86.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3683.903389397906!2d88.3484139!3d22.5827164!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a0277b94c880843%3A0x87478ea062da6883!2sTraditional%20Indian%20Wrestling!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1706258003562!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/following-the-trails-of-flowers/6916c498e7576e78b746aa7f', 'Mullik Ghat Flower Market', 'Mullik Flower Market photowalk, kolkata photowalk', '2024-01-26 14:03:38', '2025-11-22 10:23:56', NULL),
(27, 'Sassoon Docks', 'sassoon-docks', '20240127081727da4b94580041edbc8f66dfe92d7b0bab.jpg', 'Pizza Hut', 1, '2024-02-10 07:30:00', 'Sassoon Docks, located in Mumbai, India, is one of the oldest and busiest fishing ports in the country. It was built in the late 19th century by David Sassoon, a prominent businessman and philanthropist, to cater to the growing demand for fish in the city. The docks cover an area of over 12 acres and have a capacity to handle around 50,000 tonnes of fish annually. The complex is divided into four main sections - the wholesale market, retail market, auction hall, and fish processing units. The bustling wholesale market is where fishermen and traders come to sell their catch, while the retail market is a popular spot for locals to purchase fresh seafood.', '20240127081727b64057814621db05374e6a2ccf5f4fe4.png', 'Sassoon Docks, located in Mumbai, India, is one of the oldest and busiest fishing ports in the country. It was built in the late 19th century by David Sassoon, a prominent businessman and philanthropist, to cater to the growing demand for fish in the city. The docks cover an area of over 12 acres and have a capacity to handle around 50,000 tonnes of fish annually. The complex is divided into four main sections - the wholesale market, retail market, auction hall, and fish processing units. The bustling wholesale market is where fishermen and traders come to sell their catch, while the retail market is a popular spot for locals to purchase fresh seafood.', 'The auction hall is where buyers bid for the day\'s catch, making it a lively and competitive atmosphere. The fish processing units located in the docks are equipped with modern facilities to ensure quick preservation and export of seafood. Over the years, Sassoon Docks has become an important hub for not just fishing activities but also for trade and commerce. It is a reflection of the city\'s rich maritime history and continues to play a vital role in supporting the local economy.', '20240127081728812100ed64d4fb2392afe978c32b0199.png', 'The morning time at the fisheries is a perfect setting for capturing stunning photos. As the sun rises, the fishing boats come back to the shore with their bountiful catch, creating a picturesque scene against the serene waters. The fishermen, with their nets full of various types of fish, can be seen unloading and sorting out their catch', 'This is the moment when the true essence of the fishing industry can be captured, showcasing the hard work and dedication of these fishermen. The bustling activity of the market, where the fishes are transferred for selling and auction, adds an interesting element to the photos, giving a glimpse into the business side of the fisheries. The colors and textures of the different types of fishes create a vibrant and eye-catching display, making it an excellent place for photographers to capture unique and captivating shots. Overall, the morning time at the fisheries provides a beautiful and dynamic backdrop for photographing this important aspect of our economy and daily lives.', NULL, NULL, '20240127081729a76d25dc1ff7755466640f95338da881.png', 'The place not only boasts of its natural beauty but also houses old vintage buildings and creative graffiti on walls, making it a perfect spot for clicking architectural photos. The vintage buildings exude a sense of nostalgia and add character to the place. The colorful and artistic graffiti on the walls further enhance the visual appeal, providing a unique backdrop for photography enthusiasts. Whether one is interested in capturing the intricate details of the vintage buildings or the vibrant street art, this place offers endless opportunities for creative and aesthetically pleasing photographs. The fusion of old and new elements in this location makes it a must-visit for anyone looking to capture stunning architectural shots.\r\nIn the bustling fishing village, there are some good colorful boats that catch the eye of both locals and tourists alike. These boats are not just your ordinary fishing vessels, they are works of art painted by the skilled hands of the fishermen themselves. The bright hues and intricate designs adorning each boat are a reflection of the vibrant culture and livelihood of the community. From shades of blue to yellow, red, and green, these boats create a beautiful contrast against the sparkling waters and sunny skies. As one strolls along the harbor, they can\'t help but admire the dedication and pride put into each stroke of paint. These boats not only serve as a means of income for the fishermen, but also as a source of pride and identity for their community. It is a true testament to their hard work and passion for their craft. These colorful boats are not just vessels for fishing, they are a symbol of the rich history and traditions that continue to thrive in this quaint village by the sea.', 'If you are interested in capturing a good portrait shot of fisheries, having a 30 to 50 mm fixed lens will definitely come in handy. This type of lens is perfect for capturing clear and detailed images of the subject while maintaining a natural and realistic perspective. Whether you are photographing a single fisherman or an entire fishing community, this lens can provide a versatile range of focal lengths to capture the perfect shot. Its compact size also makes it convenient to carry around, making it an ideal choice for on-the-go photography. With its ability to capture sharp and vibrant images, a 30 to 50 mm fixed lens is a must-have for any photographer looking to create stunning portraits of fisheries. So, if you want to elevate your photography skills and capture the essence of the fishing industry, be sure to add this lens to your camera gear. \r\n\r\n A 1-hour photowalk from the main street of Colaba to the inside market offers a unique and enriching experience. As you make your way through the bustling streets of Colaba, you will pass by a plethora of creative buildings that are a testament to the rich history and culture of this vibrant city. These buildings serve as the perfect subjects for any photography enthusiast, with their intricate designs and vibrant colors. The walk also takes you through the colorful and lively inside market, where you can capture the essence of local life through your lens. Along the way, you will also witness the hustle and bustle of the main street, full of street vendors and busy shoppers. This 1-hour photowalk is not only a great way to capture stunning images but also an opportunity to immerse yourself in the local culture and experience the true essence of Colaba. It is an experience that is sure to leave a lasting impression on any photographer or traveler.', '202401270817299e06d576554faca607193daca8aa4bff.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d235.89861922938687!2d72.82403808552775!3d18.91465969049806!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7d14862e10e9f%3A0x7bb05d2c5fd4e192!2sPizza%20Hut!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1706343293131!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Sassoon docks', 'Mumbai, Sassoon, docks, colaba, photowalkmumbai', '2024-01-27 15:17:30', '2024-01-27 15:21:15', NULL),
(28, 'Pune University', 'pune-university', '20240128063302cb84dbd5f9a166deae286197c1fd817e.jpg', 'Chatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Statue', 3, '2024-02-17 07:30:00', 'Pune University, also known as Savitribai Phule Pune University, is one of the premier educational institutions in India. Established in 1948, it is located in the bustling city of Pune in the state of Maharashtra. The university offers a wide range of courses in various disciplines including science, arts, commerce, law, and management. It is home to over 700 affiliated colleges and institutes, making it one of the largest universities in the country.', '20240128070330b6898fd37bab3593a9d851ec291d97c3.png', 'Pune University, also known as Savitribai Phule Pune University, is one of the premier educational institutions in India. Established in 1948, it is located in the bustling city of Pune in the state of Maharashtra. The university offers a wide range of courses in various disciplines including science, arts, commerce, law, and management. It is home to over 700 affiliated colleges and institutes, making it one of the largest universities in the country. Pune University has a strong reputation for its academic excellence and research facilities. The university has produced many notable alumni who have excelled in various fields such as politics, literature, sports, and business.', 'With its sprawling campus and state-of-the-art facilities, Pune University provides a vibrant and conducive environment for students to pursue their academic goals. Its focus on holistic education and all-round development has made it a preferred choice for students from all over India and abroad. Pune University continues to strive towards excellence and remains a hub of knowledge and innovation, making it a pride of Maharashtra and the nation as a whole.', '2024012806330235c0727b1906bd4cbc732c332c94d602.jpg', 'The building stands tall and proud, a masterpiece of architecture in its own right. It exudes a sense of grandeur and magnificence, beckoning all those with an eye for beauty to come closer. For those who have a passion for capturing the essence of buildings and monuments through photography, this is the perfect spot.', NULL, NULL, 'The intricate details of the building\'s design and the way it reflects the play of light and shadows make for an excellent subject to capture. Every angle and perspective presents a new and unique view, making it a photographer\'s paradise. Whether it is the towering spires or the intricate carvings, every element of this building is a work of art, standing out in its own splendor. To truly appreciate the beauty of this architecture, one must see it through the lens of a camera, capturing its essence and preserving it for eternity.', '202401280633023ae59f1dad17088a7b5d4567e6ef34e4.png', 'In this place, photography and architecture come together in perfect harmony, creating an experience that is both visually stunning and intellectually stimulating. It is a must-visit location for anyone with a passion for photography or an appreciation for exceptional architecture.\r\n\r\n Participants of events held at the University are not only able to engage in educational and informative activities, but they also have the opportunity to take in the beautiful scenery that surrounds the campus.', 'The lawns and gardens that surround the University provide a perfect backdrop for capturing photos through a wide angle lens. With its well-maintained greenery and vibrant flowers, these areas offer a peaceful and picturesque setting for participants to explore and capture stunning photos. Whether it\'s for personal use or for promotional purposes, the lawns and gardens of the University serve as a great location for capturing memorable moments and showcasing the beauty of the campus. This adds an extra dimension to the overall experience for participants, making the University not only a place for learning but also a place for appreciating nature\'s beauty.\r\n\r\nJoin in for our Photowalk and get up close to this amazing place.', '20240128063303ee843368a9aa7a5bef15a5b1c81de599.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d15130.627896885379!2d73.8284589!3d18.5443971!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2bf6f34438adb%3A0xad2575e535ae16e1!2sChatrapati%20Shivaji%20Maharaj%20Statue!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1706424845050!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Pune University Photowalk', 'Photowalk at Pune University', '2024-01-28 13:33:03', '2024-01-28 14:06:08', NULL),
(29, 'Charminar', 'charminar', '20240129110228586d7b029b94e4dfdb0a5e3e5d6a4827.jpg', 'Nimrah Cafe & Bakery', 6, '2025-03-22 07:30:00', 'Char Minar is an iconic monument situated in Hyderabad, India. It is a significant historical and cultural landmark that attracts tourists from all over the world. The name Char Minar translates to \"Four Towers\" in English, and it stands tall as a symbol of the city\'s rich heritage and architectural beauty. This impressive structure was built in 1591 by Muhammad Quli Qutb Shah, the fifth ruler of the Qutb Shahi dynasty. Each of the four minarets is adorned with intricate carvings and Islamic architectural elements, making it a sight to behold. The central structure of Char Minar is a mosque that offers stunning views of the city from its top.', '20240129112239d990f38bc7d5854033d6268b83dff463.png', 'Char Minar is an iconic monument situated in Hyderabad, India. It is a significant historical and cultural landmark that attracts tourists from all over the world. The name Char Minar translates to \"Four Towers\" in English, and it stands tall as a symbol of the city\'s rich heritage and architectural beauty. This impressive structure was built in 1591 by Muhammad Quli Qutb Shah, the fifth ruler of the Qutb Shahi dynasty. Each of the four minarets is adorned with intricate carvings and Islamic architectural elements, making it a sight to behold. The central structure of Char Minar is a mosque that offers stunning views of the city from its top.', 'The monument also has a rich history, as it was initially built to commemorate the end of a deadly plague that ravaged the city. Today, Char Minar stands as a proud testament to Hyderabad\'s past and continues to be a popular tourist destination for its grandeur and historical significance.', '20240129110228310e8f65ad9e6fea59eb6316b7dbc992.jpg', 'Char Minar, the iconic monument of Hyderabad, is not only a popular tourist spot but also an excellent place for street photography. The majestic structure with its intricate architecture, bustling streets, and diverse crowd make it a perfect setting for capturing the essence of city life. The vibrant markets surrounding the monument, filled with colorful fabrics, aromatic spices, and mouth-watering delicacies, provide a sensory overload for any photographer. The narrow lanes leading up to Char Minar are lined with old buildings adorned with vibrant street art and graffiti, adding to the charm of this place. The diverse mix of people, from locals going about their daily lives to tourists soaking in the culture, offers endless opportunities to capture candid shots that tell a story.', NULL, NULL, 'The play of light and shadows in the narrow alleys and under the arches of Char Minar provides a dramatic backdrop for creative shots. With its rich history and cultural significance, combined with its dynamic atmosphere, Char Minar truly is an excellent place for any street photographer looking to capture the beauty and essence of Hyderabad through their lens. \r\n\r\n The old streets are a treasure trove of history and charm, and what better way to capture their essence than with some black and white shots? The monochromatic tones add a timeless quality to the photographs, making them look like they could have been taken decades ago.', '2024012911022860071bedeb88ca0c6bd07b48a5a70ead.jpg', 'The stark contrast between light and shadow highlights the intricate details of the buildings and cobblestone streets, creating a nostalgic and atmospheric feel. The lack of color also allows the viewer to focus on the textures and patterns within the frame, giving a more intimate view of these historic streets. Whether it\'s a bustling market square or a quiet alleyway, black and white photography is excellent for capturing the character and stories of these old streets. It brings out the beauty in simplicity and evokes a sense of nostalgia, making it the perfect medium for preserving the charm of these timeless locations. So next time you find yourself wandering through the winding alleys and hidden corners of an old city, don\'t forget to snap a few black and white shots to truly capture the essence of its past.', 'In addition to capturing the beauty of landscapes and scenery, photography also allows us to take good portrait shots of people and vendors. These portraits serve as a way to document and preserve the unique characteristics and personalities of individuals and the stories that they have to tell. By clicking these portraits, we are able to capture a glimpse of their lives, cultures, and communities. Furthermore, these portraits also serve as a way to connect with the people we photograph, creating a sense of empathy and understanding between different cultures and backgrounds. Whether it be the wrinkles on an elderly vendor\'s face or the dazzling smile of a street performer, portrait photography allows us to appreciate the diversity and beauty of humanity through the lens of a camera.', '202401291102283babdc2c8a4ab39830b6b3d101993479.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d952.0142198549629!2d78.47386975730227!3d17.36099582283857!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bcb97f9e7db9ed5%3A0x395a5f3f033aa8ff!2sNimrah%20Cafe%20%26%20Bakery!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1706526648666!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Charminar Photowalk', 'Charminar Photowalk, Hyderabad, PhotowalksIndia, Learnphotography', '2024-01-29 18:02:28', '2025-03-07 10:59:15', NULL);
