(30, 'Koyambedu Market', 'koyambedu-market', '20240206055322d9a21720fb90537aedc8aaebb2cd8d50.jpg', 'Indian Oil Petrol Station', 7, '2024-02-18 07:30:00', 'Koyambedu market, located in the bustling city of Chennai, is one of the largest wholesale markets in South India. Spanning over an area of 295 acres, this market is home to a vibrant and diverse range of products ranging from fruits and vegetables to textiles and electronic goods.The market is known for its competitive prices and variety, attracting customers from all walks of life. It is a prime source for fresh produce for both local businesses and household consumers. The market also plays a crucial role in the economy, providing employment opportunities to a large number of people.', '20240206055322f0843a92d61c517ca320ce263e64167e.jpg', 'Koyambedu market, located in the bustling city of Chennai, is one of the largest wholesale markets in South India. Spanning over an area of 295 acres, this market is home to a vibrant and diverse range of products ranging from fruits and vegetables to textiles and electronic goods. The market is a hub of activity, with thousands of buyers and sellers flocking in every day to strike deals and make purchases.', '. The market is known for its competitive prices and variety, attracting customers from all walks of life. It is a prime source for fresh produce for both local businesses and household consumers. The market also plays a crucial role in the economy, providing employment opportunities to a large number of people.', '202402060621013ab41414724c9798edb505a5e9dd55d8.png', 'However, with the recent developments in e-commerce and online shopping, the market is facing stiff competition. Despite this, Koyambedu market continues to thrive and remains an integral part of Chennai\'s commercial landscape.\r\n\r\nThis location is truly a photographer\'s dream, as it offers a plethora of unique and captivating opportunities for street photography. The bustling streets are filled with lively vendors, each with their own story to tell through their daily work. From the colorful fruits and vegetables on display to the intricate details of handmade items, every corner of this place is a potential subject for stunning portraits.', NULL, NULL, 'As a photographer, one can capture the hustle and bustle of the market while also getting up close and personal with the vendors, capturing their expressions and emotions as they go about their daily routines. The vibrant energy of the vendors and their surroundings make this an excellent spot for street photography, allowing for a glimpse into the daily lives of the hardworking individuals who make this place come alive. With varied lighting and backgrounds, this location offers endless possibilities for stunning and unique street photography captures. Whether you\'re a professional or amateur photographer, this is an excellent place to explore and capture the essence of daily life through your lens.', '20240206055322b32e17a6ed2d3659a792eede0ea9ec5e.png', 'If you plan on visiting a vegetable market in the early morning, you are in for a treat as the light during this time is ideal for capturing stunning photographs. The soft glow of the rising sun combined with the warm yellow bulbs used to light up the market creates a beautiful and unique atmosphere. The contrast between the natural light and artificial light creates a captivating effect for photos. The vibrant colors of the vegetables and fruits, coupled with the hustle and bustle of the market, make for a perfect subject to capture. Whether you are a professional photographer or just someone looking to take some memorable snapshots, visiting a vegetable market in the early morning is sure to provide you with excellent lighting conditions for your photos.', 'So, grab your camera and head to the market for an unforgettable photography experience. \r\n\r\n The market is an enchanting place filled with a variety of sights, sounds, and smells. However, the smells of the spices and fruits are what truly make it a must-visit destination. As you walk through the bustling lanes of the market, you are greeted by the aroma of various spices such as cinnamon, cardamom, and turmeric. The sweet scent of ripe fruits like mangoes, pineapples, and bananas fills the air, tempting your taste buds and luring you towards the colorful stalls. The amalgamation of these scents creates a truly intoxicating experience that is unique to the market. And of course, one cannot miss capturing this vibrant atmosphere through photography. From the vibrant displays of fruits and spices to the animated vendors and curious shoppers, every corner of the market is a perfect subject for photography. So, if you want to immerse yourself in a sensory delight and capture it for eternity, the market is definitely the place to be.', '20240206060521bb7605235e68bc6574ab629eb3045db8.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1943.2375047407384!2d80.19749992030879!3d13.069054081602513!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a5266a56bd2b441%3A0x77a06d7d606bad5c!2sIndianOil!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1707199448132!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"550\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 0, NULL, 'Chennai Photowalk,Koyambedu, fujifilmindia', 'Koyambedu Photowalk, Photowalks, Photowalkindia, fujifilmindia', '2024-02-06 12:53:23', '2024-02-09 00:19:22', NULL),
(31, 'Besant Nagar Beach', 'besant-nagar-beach', '202402090406482d40315ec398d6cc3c6a28140ef6ed4b.jpg', 'Opposite KFC', 7, '2024-12-28 07:00:00', 'Beseant Nagar Beach, also known as \"Bessie\" by the locals, is a popular beach located in the southern part of Chennai, India. It is named after the neighbourhood of Besant Nagar which surrounds the beach. The beach is a major attraction for tourists and locals alike, offering a serene and peaceful atmosphere with its soft sandy shores and gentle waves. It is a perfect spot for relaxation, as one can lounge on the beach chairs and soak up the sun or take a dip in the refreshing waters. With stunning sunsets and a vibrant atmosphere, Beseant Nagar Beach is a must-visit destination for anyone looking to unwind and rejuvenate in Chennai.', '202402081745237345c48e5619067a61d9b24dd7fd0e55.jpg', 'The morning beach is a photographer\'s paradise, offering endless opportunities for stunning and unique shots. As the sun rises and casts a golden glow over the tranquil waters and sandy shores, it creates a magical ambiance that is perfect for capturing beautiful images. The soft light of the early morning creates a gentle contrast between the dark blue waters and the bright sky, providing a perfect backdrop for photography. The sound of the waves crashing against the shore and the gentle breeze rustling through the palm trees add an extra element of serenity to the scene, making it an ideal setting for capturing peaceful and tranquil images.', 'The morning beach also offers a variety of subjects to photograph, from seashells and sand patterns to wildlife and people enjoying the peacefulness of the early hours. With the combination of natural lighting, serene atmosphere, and diverse subjects, the morning beach is undoubtedly a photographer\'s dream come true.', '20240208174523fa04ec246e22bb4b0752f56784806dcf.png', 'The beach was not only a beautiful and relaxing spot, but it was also filled with interesting food stalls and vendors. These stalls offered a variety of delicious food options for visitors to enjoy while taking in the stunning views of the ocean. What made it even more exciting was the opportunity to capture some great photos with the colorful food and vibrant atmosphere as the backdrop', NULL, NULL, 'From local delicacies to international cuisines, there was something for everyone to try and savor. The bustling energy of the food stalls added to the overall charm of the beach, making it a must-visit destination for both foodies and photography enthusiasts. So, not only could one satisfy their taste buds, but also capture some amazing memories at the beach with these food stalls and vendors.', '20240208174523c446bfda58a86ed41443f2b1ce19700d.png', 'If you happen to have some free time, a visit to Shri Ashta Lakshmi Temple for photography is highly recommended. The temple boasts of a brilliant architecture that will leave you in awe. Located in the heart of the city, this temple is a popular spot among photographers and tourists alike. The intricate carvings and detailed designs on the walls and pillars of the temple make for a perfect subject for photography.', 'The temple is dedicated to Goddess Lakshmi, the Hindu goddess of wealth and prosperity, and is adorned with beautiful idols and decorations. Whether you are a professional photographer or just love to capture beautiful moments, this temple is a must-visit for its stunning architecture and peaceful ambiance. So, if you have some spare time on your hands, don\'t miss the opportunity to visit Shri Ashta Lakshmi Temple and capture its beauty through your lens.', '20240208174524c7300d647410d861e64c06fad2c012ae.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d15550.207431701327!2d80.2707691!3d13.0004901!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a526765abba5849%3A0xf0dd16f576609f2d!2sKFC!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1707414149420!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"550\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 0, NULL, 'Besant Nagar Beach Photowalk', 'Besant Nagar Beach Photowalk, Fujifilm, photowalk, photowalksindia', '2024-02-09 00:45:25', '2024-12-16 00:24:18', NULL),
(32, 'Mattancherry', 'mattancherry', '2024021115551019c2728253dfd9b92e444d63e7fea628.jpg', 'Church of Our Lady of Life', 10, '2024-02-24 07:30:00', 'Mattancherry is a vibrant neighborhood located in the city of Kochi, Kerala, India. It is known for its rich history and cultural diversity, with influences from various communities such as Jewish, Portuguese, Dutch, and British. The streets of Mattancherry are lined with colorful buildings and bustling markets, offering a unique blend of traditional and modern experiences. The iconic Mattancherry Palace, also known as the Dutch Palace, is a must-visit attraction that showcases the region\'s architectural beauty and heritage.', '202402111555108fc67df175bc12eee16b18a9332f51fe.jpg', 'Mattancherry is a vibrant neighborhood located in the city of Kochi, Kerala, India. It is known for its rich history and cultural diversity, with influences from various communities such as Jewish, Portuguese, Dutch, and British. The streets of Mattancherry are lined with colorful buildings and bustling markets, offering a unique blend of traditional and modern experiences.', 'The iconic Mattancherry Palace, also known as the Dutch Palace, is a must-visit attraction that showcases the region\'s architectural beauty and heritage.', '20240211160001583af3a6a80da41c56e4471d148877c0.png', 'The area is also renowned for its spice market, where one can find an array of aromatic spices such as pepper, cardamom, and turmeric. Additionally, Mattancherry is home to the oldest synagogue in the Commonwealth of Nations, the Paradesi Synagogue, which is a testament to the Jewish community\'s long-standing presence in the area. This vibrant neighborhood is a melting pot of cultures and a must-visit destination for anyone looking to immerse themselves in the rich history and flavors of Kochi.', NULL, NULL, 'The Mattancherry location is a hidden gem for street photography enthusiasts, with its vibrant vintage architecture that exudes a charm of the bygone era. Walking through the narrow lanes of this area, one can find stunning examples of traditional architecture that have stood the test of time. From grand old mansions to quaint little homes, every structure has a story to tell. The intricate details and unique designs make it a photographer\'s paradise, offering endless opportunities to capture the essence of this place. The bustling streets and colorful markets add to the overall ambiance, making it an excellent spot for capturing candid shots of the locals going about their daily lives. The fusion of different cultures and traditions can also be seen in the architecture, making it a truly diverse and enriching experience for any photographer. Overall, the Mattancherry location is a must-visit for anyone interested in vintage architecture and street photography.', '202402111555101d0597a946f1cafbaa9a4d489ea34a30.png', 'The narrow streets of Mattancherry are lined with numerous vendors selling an array of aromatic and colorful spices, making it a paradise for food lovers and tourists alike. The vendors, mostly local women, can be seen sitting on the ground with their wares displayed in front of them. They sell everything from the traditional Indian spices like cumin, turmeric, and cardamom to rare and exotic spices like saffron and vanilla. The air is filled with a heady mix of scents, drawing you in to explore further. These vendors take great pride in their products and are always happy to educate customers on the various uses and benefits of the spices. The bustling market is a true reflection of the rich culture and heritage of Mattancherry. A visit to this spice market is a must for anyone looking to experience the true essence of Kerala cuisine.', 'Mattancherry Palace is a historical monument that depicts the rich cultural heritage of the state. Also known as the Dutch Palace, it was built by Portuguese traders in the 16th century and later renovated by the Dutch in the 17th century. The palace showcases a blend of Portuguese, Dutch and traditional Kerala style of architecture, making it a unique attraction. It is adorned with intricate wooden carvings, colorful murals and beautiful courtyards, giving visitors a glimpse into the lavish lifestyle of the royal family who once resided here. The palace also houses a museum which displays a wide collection of artifacts, weapons, and portraits from the past. A visit to Mattancherry Palace is a must for anyone interested in history and architecture, as it offers a fascinating insight into the bygone era of Kerala.', '20240211155511e2afe4bc56c1e23fe9721ef727778f29.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3929.6703602896855!2d76.2582198!3d9.961359899999998!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3b086d455f8871d1%3A0x4644b972f84d4ae4!2sChurch%20of%20Our%20Lady%20of%20Life%2C%20Bazaar%20Rd%2C%20Mattancherry%2C%20Kochi%2C%20Kerala%20682002!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1707666687373!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"550\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Mattancherry  Photowalk', 'Mattancherry, photowalksindia, photowalking, photowalk, kochiphotowalk', '2024-02-11 22:55:11', '2024-02-11 23:00:01', NULL),
(33, 'Marine Drive', 'marine-drive', '20240820120749d40918196a5108a8427e3d38facfa82c.jpg', 'Tanishq Jewellery', 1, '2025-04-12 07:30:00', 'Marine Drive, located in South Mumbai, is a popular destination not only for its scenic beauty and lively atmosphere but also for its potential for street photography. This iconic stretch of road along the Arabian Sea offers a diverse range of subjects for photographers, making it an excellent place for capturing captivating images. The bustling street is lined with majestic colonial buildings, modern skyscrapers, and colorful street vendors, providing a beautiful contrast of old and new architectural styles', '20240821150644d3ae732fbc42ec9829afb7b88e62bda8.png', 'Moreover, the wide promenade and the constant flow of people, including locals and tourists, add to the lively ambiance and offer endless opportunities for candid shots. The changing light and shadows throughout the day also make Marine Drive a photographer\'s paradise. With its vibrant energy and dynamic setting, Marine Drive is undoubtedly an excellent place for street photography that promises to capture the essence of Mumbai\'s charm and diversity in every frame', 'Early morning marine gives us a glimpse into the bustling streets, with people running and going about their daily routines. The serene morning air is filled with the sounds of footsteps hitting the pavement and the occasional honking of cars. The soft hues of the sunrise reflect off the calm waters, creating a picturesque view.', '20240820123400600f66a47b1bd14f8905d3cfe66690bd.png', 'As we watch from a distance, we can see the determination on the faces of those rushing to make it to work or school on time. The early morning marine scene reminds us of the hustle and bustle of city life, and how everyone is constantly on the move. It also serves as a reminder to appreciate the little moments of peace and tranquility amid the chaos of everyday life. Whether it\'s for exercise or to catch the early train, seeing people running on the streets in the morning is a common sight that shows us that life is always in motion, and we must keep moving forward. As we take in this brief glimpse of the morning marine, we are reminded to start our day with vigor and determination, just like those runners on the streets.', 'Walking from Marine Drive to Chowpatty is an exhilarating experience that is sure to leave anyone in awe. The picturesque view of the Arabian sea on one side and the bustling city on the other creates the perfect backdrop for capturing stunning photos. As we step onto the promenade, the cool breeze and the sound of waves crashing against the shore instantly relaxes our senses.', 'With each step, we are mesmerized by the beautiful sunset that paints the sky with vibrant hues of orange and pink. The pathway is adorned with statues and street performers, adding to the lively atmosphere.', 'As we reach Chowpatty, the aroma of street food entices us, making it the perfect spot to take a break and capture some amazing photos. The golden sand, colorful beach umbrellas, and people enjoying themselves create a lively and vibrant scene that is perfect for capturing memories. It\'s truly a walk that not only captivates our senses but also provides endless opportunities for taking breathtaking photos that we can cherish forever.', '20240820123121f8e178fc5b05a7adc653f55dbd749355.png', 'As we reach Chowpatty, the famous beach in Mumbai, a sense of excitement and anticipation fills us. The inviting sound of the crashing waves and the warm sun on our skin make us eager to step onto the sandy shore. As we take our first steps onto the beach, we can feel the soft grains of sand under our feet, and the cool breeze caresses our face.', 'We are surrounded by the vibrant energy of the bustling beach, with families playing in the water and vendors selling their delicious street food. We cannot help but take out our cameras and capture this picturesque scene - the clear blue sky meeting the endless expanse of sea, with the iconic skyline of Mumbai in the background. As we click photos to preserve these memories, we are reminded of how special this place is, and how lucky we are to experience its beauty and charm.', '2024082115085276fc1c97d59b17d49e54bb2a5c02f73c.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d787.4695480865169!2d72.8236702013705!3d18.933296341270207!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7d1e64b0e1045%3A0x25897329ce2debe6!2sTanishq%20Jewellery%20-%20Mumbai%20-%20Churchgate!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1744088148969!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'marinedrivephotowalks, photowalkmumbai, photowalk, streetphotography', 'marinedrivephotowalks, photowalkmumbai, photowalk, streetphotography', '2024-08-20 19:07:51', '2025-04-08 11:57:21', NULL),
(34, 'Qutub Shahi Tombs', 'qutub-shahi-tombs', '20240930063653b0b5bc444d6b7e36b34b6c7f30be5808.jpg', 'Gate', 6, '2024-10-20 15:00:00', 'A photowalk at Qutub Shahi Tombs is a unique and enriching experience for any photography enthusiast. The tombs, located in the city of Hyderabad, are a significant historical site dating back to the 16th century. The tombs, built by the Qutub Shahi dynasty, are a perfect blend of Persian and Indian architectural styles and are known for their grandeur and intricate designs. As one explores the complex, the beautiful gardens, fountains, and the majestic structures provide a picturesque backdrop for capturing stunning photographs.', '2024093007570435417329ae4a7ca0ecb09529f03783ef.jpg', 'Qutub Shahi Tombs, located in Hyderabad, India, is a stunning architectural masterpiece that holds great historical and cultural significance. The tombs were built by the Qutub Shahi dynasty in the 16th century and serve as a final resting place for the rulers of the dynasty. As a popular tourist destination, the tombs are not only admired for their intricate architectural design but also for their serene and picturesque surroundings.', 'This makes Qutub Shahi Tombs a perfect subject for architecture photography. The tombs showcase a unique blend of Indo-Islamic architecture with influences from Persian, Pashtun, and Hindu styles. The grand arches, intricately carved stone work, and domes of the tombs make for stunning photographs, especially during sunrise and sunset when the light creates a magical ambiance. Moreover, the symmetrical layout of the tombs and the lush green gardens add to the visual appeal of the place, making it a favorite spot for photographers. Capturing the beauty of Qutub Shahi Tombs through photography not only showcases its architectural brilliance but also preserves its legacy for future generations to admire and appreciate.', '20240930065008e6f93feef7d3be19021667190ca113dd.png', 'The photowalk allows one to not only capture the beauty of the tombs but also delve into the rich history and culture of the region. It is an opportunity to witness the fusion of art, culture, and architecture in one place and create timeless memories through photographs. The photowalk at Qutub Shahi Tombs is a must-do for anyone seeking to capture the essence of Hyderabad\'s heritage and showcase it through their lens.', 'The afternoon time at Qutub Shahi Tombs is a perfect time for photography enthusiasts as there are relatively fewer people around, providing a peaceful and uninterrupted environment to capture stunning shots.', 'The warm sunlight adds a beautiful glow to the ancient tombs and the surrounding landscape, making it an ideal setting for photography.', 'With fewer crowds, one can easily explore and experiment with different angles and compositions without any distractions. The quiet and serene ambiance of the tombs during this time also allows for a more personal and intimate experience, giving photographers a chance to truly connect with the history and architecture of this magnificent site. Overall, the afternoon time at Qutub Shahi Tombs is not only a good time for photography but also a time to appreciate and admire the beauty and grandeur of this historical monument in its true essence.', '20240930065008c256ef57ed26c36bbdd1320026b396ae.png', 'Spending more time at this photowalk, we can also capture silhouette photos of the tombs. As the sun sets behind the ancient structures, the shadows cast by the tombs create a stunning and dramatic effect. The warm and golden hues of the sky provide a beautiful backdrop to capture the intricate details of these ancient tombs in silhouette. With the soft light filtering through the pillars and arches, we can capture the stillness and grandeur of these structures in a unique and artistic way.', 'The contrast between light and dark, as well as the play of shadows, adds an element of mystery and intrigue to the photos. By spending more time at this photowalk, we are able to fully appreciate the beauty and history of these tombs while also capturing stunning and memorable images. These silhouette photos will serve as a reminder of our time spent at this photowalk, capturing not only the physical structures but also the emotions and feelings evoked by being in such a historic and enchanting place.', '202409300650091c557c71f83832bdb6836458e53c4f63.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participants will bear the Fee for entering the Qutub Shahi Tombs, its a very basic fee . Fee for entry with camera is bit additional.\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d3807.3631628784165!2d78.39654975026242!3d17.39435086750045!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bcb9697426fa711%3A0x804ba10ecbcdd1f5!2sQutub%20Shahi%20Tombs!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1727678822930!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'photowalk, hyderbadphotowalk, qutubshahitombs, fujifilmphotowalk, photowalksindia, groupphotographers', 'Photowalk at qutub Shahi tomb, Streetphotography, photowalksindia,', '2024-09-30 13:36:53', '2024-09-30 14:57:04', NULL),
(35, 'Kasimedu Beach', 'kasimedu-beach', '202410010519368cb9eaf652fdeba39b9f2788ae8fc478.jpg', 'N4 Kasimedu Fish', 7, '2024-10-27 07:00:00', 'Kasimedu beach is a picturesque stretch of coastline located in the northern part of Chennai, Tamil Nadu. It is a popular destination among locals and tourists alike, known for its serene atmosphere and beautiful views. The beach is lined with palm trees and offers a stunning view of the Bay of Bengal. The golden sandy shores and crystal-clear blue waters make it an ideal spot for relaxing and indulging in water activities such as swimming, boating, and fishing. The beach also has several shacks and stalls selling delicious seafood dishes, making it a food lover\'s paradise.', '202410011057120564d17fb95921f32e16bd904c26fea6.jpg', 'Kasimedu beach is a picturesque stretch of coastline located in the northern part of Chennai, Tamil Nadu. It is a popular destination among locals and tourists alike, known for its serene atmosphere and beautiful views. The beach is lined with palm trees and offers a stunning view of the Bay of Bengal. The golden sandy shores and crystal-clear blue waters make it an ideal spot for relaxing and indulging in water activities such as swimming, boating, and fishing. The beach also has several shacks and stalls selling delicious seafood dishes, making it a food lover\'s paradise. Additionally, Kasimedu beach is home to a thriving fishing community, and visitors can witness the traditional techniques used by the fishermen to catch their daily haul. The beach also has a lighthouse that offers a panoramic view of the surrounding area. With its tranquil ambiance and various activities, Kasimedu beach is a must-visit for anyone looking to escape the hustle and bustle of the city and enjoy a day by the sea.', NULL, '20241001051936039ce5f4f3c2fd74bd7e99f75525d866.png', 'Kasimedu Beach, located in Chennai, India, is a bustling fishing harbour that offers visitors a glimpse into the daily lives of fishermen and their families. This picturesque beach is a hub of activity, with colorful fishing boats bobbing in the water and the aroma of freshly caught seafood wafting through the air. The beach is lined with numerous shops selling all kinds of fish and seafood, making it the perfect spot for seafood lovers to indulge in some of the freshest and most delicious delicacies.', NULL, 'The fishing community here is deeply rooted in tradition and it is not uncommon to see fishermen using age-old techniques to catch fish. Visitors can also witness the busy auctions at the harbor as fishermen bring in their catch of the day. The vibrant atmosphere at Kasimedu Beach makes it a popular spot for tourists looking to experience a slice of local life and indulge in some delectable seafood dishes. Whether it\'s watching the sunrise over the sparkling waters or strolling along the bustling harbor, Kasimedu Beach is a must-visit destination for anyone seeking an authentic fishing experience in India.', NULL, '20241001051936b71ef36552640b3c5ecc791abd7be50b.png', 'The early morning hours are the perfect time to take a photowalk at Kasimedu beach, where the atmosphere is filled with the bustling routines of the fisheries. As the sun rises over the horizon, the fishermen can be seen setting up their boats and nets, preparing for a day\'s work. The air is filled with the smell of fresh fish and the sound of seagulls flying overhead. The light at this time of day is soft and golden, creating the perfect lighting for capturing stunning photographs.', 'Walking along the shore, one can witness the fishermen bringing in their catch of the day, while others are busy repairing their nets. The sight of boats dotting the sea against the backdrop of a beautiful sunrise is truly a sight to behold and capture. The energy and liveliness of the fisheries at Kasimedu beach in the morning make it an ideal spot for photographers to capture unique and captivating shots. Whether it\'s the colorful boats, bustling market, or picturesque views, a photowalk at Kasimedu beach in the morning is an unforgettable experience for any photography enthusiast.', '2024100105193715afed5ce6c976943975825f2cd09566.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"2\":\"Like to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\",\"5\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31083.83897801032!2d80.28117446137689!3d13.132102680666513!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a526fa102de599d%3A0xdcb5dae091d45331!2sN4%20Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1727779681121!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Kasimeduphotowalk, chennaiphotowalk, photowalkindia, photogroup, photographersgroup', 'Kasimedu beach photography', '2024-10-01 12:19:38', '2024-10-01 17:57:13', NULL),
(36, 'Shivaji Nagar', 'shivaji-nagar', '202410030505402c711504d78856c0de9068789d594c97.jpg', 'St Mary\'s Basilica', 2, '2025-03-29 07:00:00', 'Welcome to another exciting photowalk at Shivaji Nagar, Bangalore! This bustling neighborhood is known for its vibrant street markets, diverse culture, and historical landmarks. As we embark on this photowalk, get ready to capture the essence of this lively area through your lens. From the colorful bazaars selling everything from fabrics to spices, to the stunning architecture of the Shivaji Nagar Mosque, there is no shortage of picturesque scenes waiting to be captured. But it\'s not just about taking perfect photographs, it\'s about immersing ourselves in the sights, sounds, and smells of this bustling area. So let\'s wander through the narrow lanes, interact with the friendly locals, and discover the hidden gems of Shivaji Nagar. Whether you\'re a professional photographer or just a hobbyist, this photowalk promises to be an exciting and enriching experience. So grab your camera and let\'s begin our journey through the vibrant streets of Shivaji Nagar!', '202410030505405d259bc7dc1f850c38a33a2710f2377f.jpg', 'Welcome to another exciting photowalk at Shivaji Nagar, Bangalore! This bustling neighborhood is known for its vibrant street markets, diverse culture, and historical landmarks. As we embark on this photowalk, get ready to capture the essence of this lively area through your lens. From the colorful bazaars selling everything from fabrics to spices, to the stunning architecture of the Shivaji Nagar Mosque, there is no shortage of picturesque scenes waiting to be captured.', 'But it\'s not just about taking perfect photographs, it\'s about immersing ourselves in the sights, sounds, and smells of this bustling area. So let\'s wander through the narrow lanes, interact with the friendly locals, and discover the hidden gems of Shivaji Nagar. Whether you\'re a professional photographer or just a hobbyist, this photowalk promises to be an exciting and enriching experience.', '20241003051907984df016d34dd457595f393b16814c2b.png', 'As a hobbyist photographer, I have found that a market place early morning is the best time to click photos. The hustle and bustle of vendors setting up their stalls, the vibrant colors of fresh produce, and the interactions between locals all make for interesting and dynamic shots. The soft morning light adds a beautiful touch to the photos, casting a warm glow over the scene', 'In addition, the absence of crowds and noise allows for a more peaceful and uninterrupted photo-taking experience. The market place also provides an opportunity to capture authentic moments and candid expressions, which add a unique and personal touch to the photos. Overall, the market place early morning is a perfect setting for any photographer looking to capture the essence of a local community and its daily activities in a beautiful and natural way.', NULL, 'At Shivaji Nagar Market in Bangalore, visitors can experience a bustling and diverse shopping scene. The market is home to a plethora of shops, each offering their own unique products and services. From traditional Indian clothing stores to modern electronic outlets, there is something for everyone at this market. The vibrant colors and busy streets create an energetic atmosphere that draws in locals and tourists alike. As you wander through the alleys, you will find yourself surrounded by the sights and sounds of vendors promoting their goods and bargaining with customers. This market truly captures the essence of Bangalore\'s lively and multicultural community, making it a must-visit for any traveler looking to immerse themselves in the local culture and find some great bargains.', '20241003051907c9898d97472bd4f4fbe2c1d28881dbb8.png', 'The market area is always bustling with activity, and as you navigate through the crowded streets, you will see a myriad of faces from different walks of life. It is a melting pot of diversity, with people of all ages, backgrounds, and cultures coming together. Amidst this hustle and bustle, you will also notice people clicking portraits of these diverse faces. With the advancement of technology, portrait photography has become more accessible and possible even in the busy market area. Whether it\'s a professional photographer capturing the essence of a street vendor, or a tourist trying to capture the beauty of a local in their camera lens, portrait photography has become a popular trend in the market area. It not only captures the individuality and uniqueness of each face but also serves as a way to preserve memories and document the diversity of the market area. So next time you find yourself strolling through the lively market area, keep an eye out for the many faces being clicked in portrait photography – it\'s a beautiful way to capture the essence of this vibrant space.', 'In this photowalk, you will have the opportunity to capture stunning images using both your mobile phone and DSLR camera. As we explore the bustling markets, you will learn the art of street photography and how to capture the essence of everyday life in these vibrant spaces. With your mobile phone, you can easily capture candid shots while blending in with the crowd, while your DSLR will allow you to experiment with different settings and techniques to create professional-quality photographs. Together, we will navigate through the busy streets, capturing moments that tell a story and showcase the unique culture of the market. This photowalk promises to be an exciting and enriching experience for both novice and experienced photographers alike. So grab your cameras and join us as we embark on a journey of discovery through the lens of street photography.', '20241003051908a9df818e0c5818f3af01636b936ce78e.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"3\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\",\"4\":\"Please carry your Adhar Card if you are looking to share a camera\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3887.803875837269!2d77.6044189!3d12.9843925!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bae1663d65f53f1%3A0xc492b89e9704c3c2!2sSt.%20Mary&#39;s%20Basilica%2C%20Bengaluru!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1727931434956!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'shivajinagarphotowalk, photowalkbangalore', 'Shivaji Nagar Photowalk, Learnphotography, groupphotography', '2024-10-03 12:05:40', '2025-03-21 14:54:23', NULL),
(37, 'Kasba Peth', 'kasba-peth', '20241008052434c5265148bf01b829c4d1b0f11737531f.jpg', 'Shaniwar Wada - Bike Parking', 3, '2026-01-24 07:30:00', 'A photowalk at Kasbapeth is a unique and enriching experience that immerses one in the vibrant culture and bustling streets of this quaint neighborhood in Pune, India. From the intricate architecture of the old buildings to the lively street markets selling fresh produce and trinkets, Kasbapeth offers a plethora of subjects for photographers to capture. The friendly locals, going about their daily lives, add to the charm of this place and make for perfect candid shots.  Whether you are a professional photographer or just a hobbyist, a photowalk at Kasbapeth is an opportunity to capture the essence of this vibrant neighborhood and create stunning visual stories.', '20241008052434a36db4baad5a5f0fb1dcfe8176260fb1.jpg', 'Kasbapeth is a unique and enriching experience that immerses one in the vibrant culture and bustling streets of this quaint neighborhood in Pune, India. As one wanders through the narrow lanes and alleys, they are greeted with a burst of colors, sights, and sounds that are sure to capture the heart and soul of any photographer. From the intricate architecture of the old buildings to the lively street markets selling fresh produce and trinkets, Kasbapeth offers a plethora of subjects for photographers to capture. The friendly locals, going about their daily lives, add to the charm of this place and make for perfect candid shots. With every step, one can discover something new and intriguing, making the photowalk a truly memorable experience.', 'Whether you are a professional photographer or just a hobbyist, a photowalk at Kasbapeth is an opportunity to capture the essence of this vibrant neighborhood and create stunning visual stories.', '202410080524347b04e17d8cd8d9d83fd3de0d92e0f393.png', 'It is home to a vibrant community with a rich history and culture. The buildings in Kasbapeth reflect this diversity and offer a glimpse into the past as well as the present. One of the most striking features of this area is the mix of old and new buildings that coexist harmoniously. On one hand, there are traditional Maharashtrian houses with intricate wooden carvings and ornate balconies, showcasing the skillful craftsmanship of the region. On the other hand, there are modern high-rise apartments with sleek glass facades and state-of-the-art amenities. The streets are lined with small businesses, shops, and restaurants housed in charming colonial-style buildings', 'Some of these buildings have been standing for centuries, while others have been recently renovated to cater to the changing needs of the community. The architecture in Kasbapeth is a blend of traditional and contemporary styles, creating a unique character that sets it apart from other neighborhoods in Pune. Whether you are a history enthusiast or simply an admirer of architecture, a walk through the streets of Kasbapeth is sure to leave you mesmerized by its beautiful buildings.', 'As you stroll through the charming streets of Kasbapeth in the early morning, you will be greeted by a plethora of old buildings that exude a distinct sense of history and character. The quiet and peaceful atmosphere of this neighborhood is the perfect setting for photography enthusiasts to capture the stunning architecture and intricate details of these structures. With the soft morning light illuminating the facades and alleyways, every step you take around Kasbapeth presents a new and captivating composition waiting to be captured through the lens. The worn-out doors, ancient windows, and intricate carvings on these buildings tell stories of a bygone era, adding a unique charm to every photograph.', NULL, '20241013055712965003f112f906fa40aea50d9ae71db2.png', 'Whether you are a professional photographer or just someone with a passion for capturing architectural beauty, Kasbapeth offers an ideal opportunity to hone your skills and create mesmerizing images that truly capture the essence of this old yet vibrant neighborhood. As you wander the streets of this vibrant area, you can notice the unique and intricate buildings that lined the roads. The contrast between the old and new structures was striking, and I was captivated by the details of each building.', 'Each click of my camera captured the essence of the buildings in a more powerful and artistic way, showcasing the beauty and character of Kasba Peth. Try out to click in black and white photos enhanced my experience in this vibrant neighborhood and you will be able to see it in a whole new light.\r\n\r\nPhotos clicked by@sarveshrajpathak', '202410080531065c3f91e7ac40da0180a9fe989565efa5.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participants will bear the Fee for entering the Qutub Shahi Tombs, its a very basic fee . Fee for entry with camera is bit additional.\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3783.2115227547074!2d73.8512160576654!3d18.51934112309068!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2c10cfdf66d79%3A0xcf9bcb02a9694225!2sBike%20parking!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1728798103694!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/heritage-photo-walk-at-kasba-peth/6970a1f38e49376b447ace22', 'punephotowalk, kasbapethphotowalk, punephotography, fujifilmphotowalk', 'photowalk at kasbapeth pune', '2024-10-08 12:24:35', '2026-01-21 20:22:30', NULL);
