(38, 'North Kolkata', 'north-kolkata', '202410130709151d0b321cabd1699c30e1972af3cb7710.jpg', 'National Economic Restaurant - Shyambazar 5 Point', 4, '2025-06-29 07:30:00', 'The streets of north Kolkata are a photographer\'s dream, with their bustling activity and vibrant colors creating a rich texture that is hard to resist capturing. Every narrow lane and crowded marketplace is a visual treat, with a plethora of subjects waiting to be immortalized through the lens. The old colonial buildings, adorned with intricate balconies and crumbling facades, provide a striking backdrop to the chaotic street life. The vibrant saris of the women, the vibrant fruit and vegetable carts, and the colorful street art all add to the sensory overload that is characteristic of this part of the city. The play of light and shadow on the peeling walls and the textures of the decaying architecture make for striking photographs', '202410130709158192011bdf7224d36d94ecabba9d78e0.jpg', 'The streets of north Kolkata are a photographer\'s dream, with their bustling activity and vibrant colors creating a rich texture that is hard to resist capturing. Every narrow lane and crowded marketplace is a visual treat, with a plethora of subjects waiting to be immortalized through the lens. The old colonial buildings, adorned with intricate balconies and crumbling facades, provide a striking backdrop to the chaotic street life. The vibrant saris of the women, the vibrant fruit and vegetable carts, and the colorful street art all add to the sensory overload that is characteristic of this part of the city. The play of light and shadow on the peeling walls and the textures of the decaying architecture make for striking photographs.', NULL, '20241013070915599c32c26dd1a0000a9e686f3720ae4b.png', 'The streets are alive with activity, and every step reveals a new frame-worthy scene. Whether it is the rickshaws darting through the alleys or the tea stalls with their steaming cups, there is never a dull moment on these streets. In short, the streets of north Kolkata are a photographer\'s paradise, offering endless opportunities for capturing color, texture, and life in all its raw and unfiltered glory.', 'North Kolkata, with its rich cultural heritage and vibrant street life, has become a hub for wall paintings and graffitis. These artworks not only add a touch of color and creativity to the otherwise dull walls, but also serve as a means of expressing social and political issues. From the famous Kalighat paintings to modern-day street art, North Kolkata is a melting pot of traditional and contemporary art forms.', 'The walls of the narrow lanes of Kumartuli are adorned with intricate murals depicting scenes from Hindu mythology, while the bustling streets of Shyambazar are filled with thought-provoking graffiti on societal issues. These wall paintings and graffitis not only beautify the city but also act as a platform for local artists to showcase their talent and spread important messages.', 'They attract tourists from all over the world, making North Kolkata a must-visit destination for art lovers. In recent years, many initiatives have been taken by the government and local organizations to encourage and promote this form of street art, making North Kolkata a vibrant canvas for artistic expression.', '202410130709153730f76d9bdcb092219f74b27f28655b.png', 'North Kolkata, also known as the cultural hub of the city, is home to some of the most beautiful and iconic red-colored buildings. These grand structures are a testament to the city\'s rich history and architectural heritage. The vibrant red hue, commonly known as the \"Kolkata Red\", is a prominent feature of these buildings, adding a dash of color to the city\'s landscape. Each building has its own unique story and design, showcasing a blend of British, European, and indigenous influences. The red-colored buildings in North Kolkata are not only visually appealing but also hold great cultural significance. They serve as a reminder of the city\'s colonial past and continue to be an integral part of its present-day charm. From majestic mansions to iconic institutions like the Calcutta High Court and St. Paul\'s Cathedral, these buildings stand tall as a reflection of Kolkata\'s glorious past. The red-colored buildings in North Kolkata are truly a sight to behold and must-visit for anyone wanting to experience the city\'s timeless elegance and charm.', 'It is undoubtedly one of the most vibrant and picturesque locations for street photography. With its rich history, bustling streets, and diverse culture, this part of the city offers endless opportunities for capturing stunning shots. From the colorful markets to the narrow alleyways lined with old buildings, every corner of North Kolkata is brimming with photographic potential. The old trams and hand-pulled rickshaws add a touch of nostalgia to the streets, making them a photographer\'s paradise. The vibrant street food scene also provides plenty of opportunities to capture candid moments of locals indulging in their favorite snacks. For those looking to improve their photography skills or simply explore this fascinating part of the city through their camera lens, joining a photowalk in North Kolkata is a must. It promises to be an unforgettable experience filled with unique sights, sounds, and stories waiting to be captured. So pack your camera and join a photowalk through the lively streets of North Kolkata to capture its true essence through your lens.', '20241013070916f3ec68e805d5d7859d1f3d197d75238f.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"3\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\",\"4\":\"Please carry your Adhar Card if you are looking to share a camera\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d460.4240546656538!2d88.3736976324304!3d22.60181605117109!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a0277e1c479bfed%3A0xe0701950756845f0!2sNational%20Economic%20Restaurant!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1728801267658!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'kolkataphotowalk, photowalkindia, photowalks, travelphotography', 'North Kolkata Photowalk', '2024-10-13 14:09:17', '2025-06-24 12:28:15', NULL),
(39, 'Crawford Market', 'crawford-market', '2024101312300587cb16684ce681f4b71082757a6a5b81.jpg', 'CSMT Viewing Stage', 1, '2024-11-23 07:30:00', 'Crawford Market, also known as Mahatma Jyotiba Phule Mandai, is a popular wholesale and retail market located in Mumbai, India. Built in the late 19th century, the market is a bustling hub of activity and is one of the oldest markets in the city. It offers a wide variety of goods, ranging from fresh fruits and vegetables to clothing, household items, and electronics. The market is famous for its vibrant atmosphere and the unique architecture of its building, which has a blend of Gothic and Victorian styles. It is also a major tourist attraction, drawing in crowds of locals as well as tourists looking for a taste of authentic Mumbai shopping experience. The market is home to hundreds of vendors and shop owners, making it a one-stop-shop for all kinds of products. With its rich history, diverse offerings, and bustling energy, Crawford Market truly captures the essence of Mumbai\'s vibrant and diverse culture.', '20241013123006c4244bc6673a3a0e7775b945c65e88fd.jpg', 'Crawford Market, also known as Mahatma Jyotiba Phule Mandai, is a popular wholesale and retail market located in Mumbai, India. Built in the late 19th century, the market is a bustling hub of activity and is one of the oldest markets in the city. It offers a wide variety of goods, ranging from fresh fruits and vegetables to clothing, household items, and electronics. The market is famous for its vibrant atmosphere and the unique architecture of its building, which has a blend of Gothic and Victorian styles. It is also a major tourist attraction, drawing in crowds of locals as well as tourists looking for a taste of authentic Mumbai shopping experience.', 'The market is home to hundreds of vendors and shop owners, making it a one-stop-shop for all kinds of products. With its rich history, diverse offerings, and bustling energy, Crawford Market truly captures the essence of Mumbai\'s vibrant and diverse culture.', '202410131230068d1476e1a09fe8ac8bf8c947c277c4ea.png', 'The market is a stunning blend of Victorian and Indo-Saracenic architecture. The building itself is a sight to behold, with its intricate designs, vibrant colors, and grand arches. The structure boasts a central clock tower that stands tall and acts as a focal point of the building. The market\'s design was influenced by the famous Norman Gothic style and features beautiful stained glass windows, ornate pillars, and intricate carvings.', 'The building\'s façade showcases an impressive mix of Indian and European styles, making it a unique architectural gem in the bustling city of Mumbai. The Crawford Market building is not just a place to shop; it is also a testament to the rich history and culture of Mumbai and is a must-visit for anyone interested in architecture and design.', 'Once inside the main structure you will come across narrow alleys filled with a multitude of colorful stalls selling everything from fresh produce to traditional Indian handicrafts. Photographers are drawn to this chaotic yet charming environment, with its unique blend of smells, sights, and sounds. They capture the energy of the market through their lenses, showcasing the diversity and culture of Mumbai.', 'From street vendors haggling with customers to shoppers bargaining for the best prices, Crawford Market offers endless opportunities for stunning photography. Its iconic clock tower, built in the colonial era, serves as a favorite backdrop for many photographers. The market\'s mix of old-world charm and modern chaos makes it a must-visit location for any photographer looking to capture the essence of Mumbai\'s dynamic city life.', '202410131230062a312dd00f0ab0801bc9dc54094a459e.png', 'As a photographer, there is a unique opportunity to capture the beauty and liveliness of a morning market place. With the wide angle lens, one can capture the vastness and bustle of the entire marketplace, showcasing the variety of goods and activities taking place. From colorful produce stands to busy shoppers, the market comes to life in these wide angle shots. However, it is also important to focus on the individuals and their interactions within the market. This is where portrait photos come in, capturing the expressions and personalities of the vendors and customers', 'These photos add a personal touch and give a glimpse into the human aspect of the market. By combining both wide angle shots and portrait photos, a photographer can truly capture the essence of the morning market place as it comes to life. It is a beautiful opportunity to showcase both the grand scale and intimate moments of this vibrant setting. As a photographer, one must be prepared to seize this moment and capture the magic of the morning market place. So join for the photowalk and experience to capture some amazing clicks from this historicalPhotowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years place.', '2024101312300617440bb947e0bc93c1fed669028e3943.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\",\"Please carry your Adhar Card if you are looking to share a camera\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d471.7251664635353!2d72.83447519576724!3d18.940185828182305!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7d1d927ca2fd7%3A0x1036952a958c6b79!2sCSMT%20Viewing%20Stage!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1728821892283!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'mumbaiphotowalk, mumbaiphotography, mumbaiphotographers', 'crawford market photowalk in Mumbai', '2024-10-13 19:30:07', '2024-10-13 19:30:07', NULL),
(40, 'Loop Road  Pattinapakkam', 'loop-road-pattinapakkam', '20241108092846cc0fb79f9964fa71e17748448ad31787.jpg', 'Foreshore Estate Bus Terminus', 7, '2024-11-23 07:00:00', 'Loop Road Chennai is a beautiful and bustling street that runs through the heart of the city. It is a popular destination for locals and tourists alike, offering a wide variety of experiences and attractions. The road is lined with shops, restaurants, and street vendors selling everything from traditional handicrafts to mouth-watering street food. As one walks along the road, they are surrounded by the vibrant energy of the city, with the sounds of honking horns, chatter of people, and aroma of spices filling the air. The road also houses several historical landmarks, such as the Kapaleeshwarar Temple and the Santhome Cathedral Basilica, adding to its cultural significance. One can also find modern malls and entertainment centers along the road, making it a perfect blend of old world charm and contemporary amenities.', '20241108092846936a831cf17197faf7c38aee95efa09d.jpg', 'Loop Road Chennai is a beautiful and bustling street that runs through the heart of the city. It is a popular destination for locals and tourists alike, offering a wide variety of experiences and attractions. The road is lined with shops, restaurants, and street vendors selling everything from traditional handicrafts to mouth-watering street food.', 'As one walks along the road, they are surrounded by the vibrant energy of the city, with the sounds of honking horns, chatter of people, and aroma of spices filling the air. The road also houses several historical landmarks, such as the Kapaleeshwarar Temple and the Santhome Cathedral Basilica, adding to its cultural significance.', '2024110809284673ea900016cf13e710404234403c726b.png', 'One can also find modern malls and entertainment centers along the road, making it a perfect blend of old world charm and contemporary amenities. Loop Road Chennai truly captures the essence of the city, making it a must-visit destination for anyone looking to experience the vibrant culture and lively atmosphere of Chennai.', 'Capturing photos that are a mix of the bustling market area and the tranquil beach side morning can offer a unique and diverse perspective. The contrast between the vibrant market stalls and the calm waves crashing onto the shore creates a captivating scene that tells a story of the fusion of city life and seaside relaxation. The vibrant colors of the market, with its array of fruits, vegetables, and handmade goods, combined with the serene blues of the ocean, can make for a stunning visual composition.', NULL, 'This type of photo captures the essence of a location, showcasing its local culture and natural beauty. It also provides a glimpse into the daily lives of those who inhabit the area, showcasing their routines and daily rituals. Capturing this mix of market area and beach side morning can offer a unique and memorable experience for both the photographer and the viewer. If you find yourself strolling through a bustling market area, camera in hand, you can expect to capture a plethora of portrait photos and candid shots of people going about their morning routines.', '20241108081737609e512498d6cf29d4d413d186e28db8.png', 'As the sun rises and the day begins, the market comes alive with vendors setting up their stalls, shoppers browsing for fresh produce and goods, and locals going about their daily tasks. The vibrant colors of the market, coupled with the energy and movement of the people, make for the perfect backdrop for capturing stunning portraits.', 'Whether it\'s a farmer carrying a basket of vegetables or a baker kneading dough, there will be no shortage of interesting subjects to photograph. With each click of your camera, you can freeze a moment in time and capture the essence of the market and its people, creating beautiful memories that will last a lifetime. So if you\'re an avid photographer or simply looking to document your travels, be sure to bring your camera and expect to click a lot of portrait photos and witness the morning hustle and bustle of the market area.', '20241108094127701183847c71dffab9eda4b741f406f8.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participants will bear the Fee for entering the Qutub Shahi Tombs, its a very basic fee . Fee for entry with camera is bit additional.\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3887.20891330807!2d80.27374907412123!3d13.022364213765202!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a5267d887071eeb%3A0x4c3a8549b46cd8ea!2sForeshore%20Estate%20Bus%20Terminus!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1731053268057!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'chennaiphotowalk, photowalkindia, looproad, indiaphotos, chennaiphotography', 'Photowalk at Loop Road Chennai Pattinapakkam beach', '2024-11-08 15:17:37', '2024-11-08 18:00:50', NULL),
(41, 'Pottery Town', 'pottery-town', '2024111005300632f02659596bd40dc8a78d2ae49d9465.jpg', 'Corporation School', 2, '2024-12-22 07:00:00', 'Pottery Town Bangalore is a historic and culturally rich neighborhood located in the heart of Bangalore city in India. Known for its traditional pottery making techniques, this small town has been a hub for pottery production for centuries. The streets of Pottery Town are lined with numerous shops and workshops where skilled artisans handcraft beautiful clay pots, vases, and other decorative items. The narrow lanes of this town are also filled with the aroma of freshly baked terracotta pots, giving visitors a glimpse into the age-old craft.', '2024111005300625302abd58826e146c308dd38a1cf237.jpg', 'Pottery Town Bangalore is a historic and culturally rich neighborhood located in the heart of Bangalore city in India. Known for its traditional pottery making techniques, this small town has been a hub for pottery production for centuries. The streets of Pottery Town are lined with numerous shops and workshops where skilled artisans handcraft beautiful clay pots, vases, and other decorative items. The narrow lanes of this town are also filled with the aroma of freshly baked terracotta pots, giving visitors a glimpse into the age-old craft.', NULL, '202411100542195a33cdc65422057abd8569f1f9e25ae9.png', 'Pottery making is an ancient art form that has been practiced for centuries, producing beautiful and functional pieces of art. One of the best ways to capture the intricate process of pottery making is through photography. By clicking great photos, you can immortalize the skilled craftsmanship and delicate techniques used by the potter to create their masterpieces.', 'The town is also home to the famous Pottery Town Lake, which not only serves as a source of water for the potters but also adds to the charm of the place with its serene surroundings. Despite modernization and industrialization, Pottery Town has managed to preserve its traditional roots, making it a popular tourist destination for those looking to experience authentic Indian culture and craftsmanship. The potters here take great pride in their work and continue to pass down their skills from generation to generation, making Pottery Town an integral part of Bangalore\'s heritage.', 'The vibrant colors, unique patterns, and the intense focus of the craftsman can all be captured in a single photograph. Each stage of the pottery making process, from molding the clay to firing it in a kiln, presents an opportunity to capture stunning shots. With the right angles and lighting, you can showcase the beauty and complexity of this traditional craft through your photographs.', 'Furthermore, by sharing these photos with others, you can help spread awareness and appreciation for this rich cultural heritage. So next time you come across a potter at work, grab your camera and start clicking away to capture the magic of pottery making and the dedication of the craftsman behind it.', '2024111005422002315d35144f98d99cb82a593be8b2b0.png', 'By sharing your photos of these pottery artisans, you are not only helping to showcase their beautiful and unique creations, but also promoting their work to a wider audience. Your photos can serve as a powerful marketing tool, reaching potential customers and increasing awareness of these talented artisans. In today\'s digital age, social media platforms have become an essential tool for promoting businesses, and your photos can contribute greatly to the success of these pottery artisans by showcasing their skills and products. By sharing your photos, you are not only supporting these artisans and their livelihood, but also helping to preserve the traditional art of pottery. Your photos have the potential to spark interest in others and inspire them to support these artisans, ultimately contributing to the sustainability and growth of their craft. So, not only are you capturing beautiful moments through your photos, but you are also playing a vital role in promoting and preserving the work of these pottery artisans', 'By joining this photowalk, you will have the opportunity to capture unique and authentic photos of pottery making and the people involved in this traditional craft. The art of pottery making has been passed down for generations and is an integral part of many cultures around the world. Through your lens, you can capture the intricate process of shaping the clay, the skilled hands of the potters at work, and the beautiful finished products. Not only will you be able to capture stunning images, but you will also have the chance to interact with and learn from the skilled artisans themselves. This photowalk offers a rare glimpse into a traditional craft and a community of people dedicated to preserving it. Your photos will not only be a visual representation of pottery making, but also a documentation of a rich cultural heritage. So come along on this photowalk and be ready to capture moments that will tell a unique story through your lens.', '20241110054220c3b043784ff58cbc157af3e1e339a1cc.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participants will bear the Fee for entering the Qutub Shahi Tombs, its a very basic fee . Fee for entry with camera is bit additional.\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d7775.016525934017!2d77.60328717230229!3d13.003272733312166!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bae16f793aaaaab%3A0xe2fbf8ca9b81bf01!2sCorporation%20School!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1733036587532!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Fujifilm Bangalore Photowalk - Pottery Town', 'Fujifilm Bangalore Photowalk - Pottery Town', '2024-11-10 12:30:07', '2024-12-01 14:10:08', NULL),
(42, 'Gudimalkapur Flower Market', 'gudimalkapur-flower-market', '20241129072408e127346393e46e4d7c8ba90fcac7f3e8.jpg', 'Outside King\'s Palace', 6, '2024-12-14 07:00:00', 'Gudimalkapur flower market, located in Hyderabad, India, is a bustling hub for all things floral. With over 200 shops selling a variety of flowers, this market is a paradise for flower enthusiasts. The market is known for its vibrant and colorful display of fresh flowers, ranging from traditional Indian marigolds to exotic imported orchids. The market is a popular destination for locals as well as tourists, who flock here to buy flowers for weddings, festivals, or even to decorate their homes. The market is open 24 hours a day and is always bustling with activity, with vendors shouting out their prices and customers bargaining for the best deals. The aroma of the fresh flowers fills the air and the sight of the colorful blooms is a treat for the senses.', '20241129072408c5e761849ce3236e472af57d328a6e01.jpg', 'The market also offers a wide range of accessories such as vases, ribbons, and other decorative items. The Gudimalkapur flower market is not just a place to buy flowers but also a cultural experience that showcases the beauty and diversity of Indian flora.', 'The flower market is a bustling and vibrant place, filled with an abundance of colors, scents, and textures. It is a haven for photographers, both amateur and professional, seeking to capture the beauty and essence of nature through their lens. The market is a perfect place to hone one\'s photography skills, as it offers a variety of subjects such as blooming flowers, intricate floral arrangements, and bustling vendors.', '20241129072408969cf14f78af6cbe2571ddceca7eecb2.png', 'The natural lighting that pours in through the open-air stalls creates a dreamy and ethereal atmosphere, making it an ideal setting for photography. With each passing moment, the scene changes, providing photographers with a never-ending array of opportunities to capture stunning shots. The flower market not only offers a visual feast but also provides a unique cultural experience, as it is a hub of activity and a gathering place for locals. Therefore, visiting the flower market is not only great for photography but also an enriching experience that allows one to immerse themselves in the beauty of nature and culture simultaneously.', NULL, 'In addition to purchasing beautiful blooms from flower vendors, you can also capture stunning photographs of them, particularly portrait photos. These vendors are often adorned with colorful flowers and their unique personalities make for captivating subjects. By taking the time to snap some photos, you not only immortalize the beauty of their craft, but also their stories and experiences.', 'It also allows you to appreciate the skill and dedication that goes into their work. So next time you pass by a flower vendor, don\'t forget to snap a few pictures to add to your collection of memories and to support these hardworking individuals.', '20241129072409800a393e42a98e2c7f068453afd3bc68.png', 'The bustling and colorful atmosphere of a flower market makes it an excellent choice for a photowalk. The vibrant hues and intricate details of the various blooms create a beautiful backdrop for any photography enthusiast. As one strolls through the market, the scent of fresh flowers fills the air and the bustling energy of vendors and customers alike adds to the overall charm.', 'The market is also a great place to capture candid shots of people interacting with the flowers, such as choosing their favorite bouquet or admiring the delicate petals. The variety of flowers available also allows for a wide range of photography styles, from close-up macro shots to sweeping landscapes. Overall, a flower market offers endless opportunities for stunning and unique photographs, making it a must-visit location for any photowalk.', '202411290724101dfde6c3e1c0085f8d4a43d7f418c3f9.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d951.8855939030722!2d78.43124294938006!3d17.385739962621855!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bcb97025bf2bc13%3A0xfda1ca8bb3d70d9!2sKing&#39;s%20Palace!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1732864991374!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Gudimalkapur Flower Market Photowalk', 'Gudimalkapur Flower Market, Fujifilmindia, streetphotography, photowalksindia, photowalking, hyderabadphotowalk', '2024-11-29 14:24:11', '2024-11-29 16:18:46', NULL),
(43, 'Yamuna Ghat', 'yamuna-ghat', '20241202092304a14693c82b62a9686f5ed5e910311d03.jpg', 'Yamuna Ghat Entrance', 5, '2025-12-20 07:00:00', 'Yamuna ghat is a prominent riverfront area located in the city of Delhi, India. It is situated on the banks of the holy Yamuna river, which has great spiritual significance in Hindu mythology. The ghat is a popular spot for locals and tourists alike, as it offers a serene and peaceful atmosphere away from the bustling city life. It is the site of various religious ceremonies and rituals, making it a significant pilgrimage destination for Hindus. The ghat is also home to several ancient temples and shrines, including the famous Chhath Ghat and Keshav Dev Temple. This area holds immense historical significance, as it has witnessed the rise and fall of several empires throughout the years.', '20241202092304b778d7a3161ae4173a71cf00a238fb9c.jpg', 'Yamuna ghat is a prominent riverfront area located in the city of Delhi, India. It is situated on the banks of the holy Yamuna river, which has great spiritual significance in Hindu mythology. The ghat is a popular spot for locals and tourists alike, as it offers a serene and peaceful atmosphere away from the bustling city life. It is the site of various religious ceremonies and rituals, making it a significant pilgrimage destination for Hindus. The ghat is also home to several ancient temples and shrines, including the famous Chhath Ghat and Keshav Dev Temple. This area holds immense historical significance, as it has witnessed the rise and fall of several empires throughout the years.', NULL, '20241202092304cd93c769dcddad9ae90b0b191d0e8ef3.png', 'Despite facing pollution and encroachment issues, Yamuna ghat continues to attract visitors with its picturesque views and cultural richness. Whether one wants to take a dip in the holy river, seek blessings at the temples, or simply enjoy a leisurely stroll along the ghats, this place offers something for everyone. Overall, Yamuna ghat is a must-visit destination for anyone seeking a glimpse into India\'s rich cultural heritage and spirituality.', NULL, 'Yamuna Ghat is a serene escape from the chaos of daily life. As the first rays of sunlight peek through the trees, the ghat comes alive with the sounds of morning prayers and chants. The gentle breeze carries the fragrance of incense and flowers, creating a peaceful atmosphere. Devotees clad in traditional attire can be seen taking a holy dip in the river, offering prayers and performing rituals.', 'The calm waters of the Yamuna reflect the colorful sky, creating a picturesque view. As the sun rises higher, the ghat becomes a hub of activity with vendors setting up their stalls, selling flowers, candles, and other items for religious offerings. The ghat also becomes a popular spot for yoga enthusiasts, practicing their asanas against the backdrop of the tranquil river. The early morning at Yamuna Ghat is a time of spiritual rejuvenation and a perfect start to the day for many residents of Delhi.', '202412020923048274e8f78281e3ec54e816906b66aff2.png', 'The Yamuna Ghat in India is a popular spot for Russian seagulls to migrate during the winter months. These beautiful birds make their long journey from the Arctic region to seek refuge in the warm waters of the Yamuna River. The sight of these graceful creatures flocking in large numbers is a spectacle to behold. They are known for their striking white plumage and distinctive red beaks, which make them stand out against the dark blue waters of the river. The locals have grown fond of these visitors and take great pride in hosting them every year. The ghat becomes a hub of activity as tourists and bird enthusiasts flock to catch a glimpse of these unique birds. The seagulls also play an important role in maintaining the ecological balance of the river, as they feed on small fish and insects, thus keeping the water clean. The presence of these seagulls has become synonymous with the Yamuna Ghat and adds to its charm and beauty. It is a true testament to the peaceful coexistence between humans and nature.', 'The early sunrise, with its soft golden hues peeking through the thick blanket of fog, creates a breathtaking scene that is truly a photographer\'s dream. As the sun slowly rises above the horizon, the fog adds an ethereal quality to the landscape, shrouding everything in a mystical mist. This creates a sense of mystery and intrigue, making it the perfect setting for capturing stunning and unique photographs. The diffused sunlight filtering through the fog adds a soft and dreamy quality to the scenery, highlighting every intricate detail and creating a magical atmosphere. It is during these early hours that photographers can capture some of the most beautiful and captivating images, showcasing the beauty of nature and its ever-changing elements. The early sunrise, combined with the fog, offers a truly enchanting and picturesque setting for any photography enthusiast.', '20241202092305874fd6e7f55ff1f0d813e27646935696.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2921.925678216288!2d77.23888269999999!3d28.6644866!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390cfd026cad8d3f%3A0x2a69554f86764538!2sYamuna%20Ghat!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1765859126463!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/misty-morning-at-yamuna/6936af9a05c494016b85af7c', 'Yamuna Ghat Photowalk - Fujifilm', 'Yamuna Ghat Photowalk - Fujifilm', '2024-12-02 16:23:06', '2025-12-16 11:26:22', NULL),
(44, 'Girgaon Chowpatty', 'girgaon-chowpatty', '202412041147558f862092400a3e624a5eaef42e6f8de0.jpg', 'Chowpatty Viewing Deck', 1, '2024-12-14 07:30:00', 'Located in the bustling city of Mumbai, Girgaon Chowpatty is a popular beach that draws in crowds of locals and tourists alike. It is situated in the Girgaon neighborhood and is considered to be one of the most iconic beaches in the city. The beach is known for its vibrant atmosphere, with colorful street vendors, food stalls, and entertainment options lining the shore. Visitors can enjoy a variety of activities such as horseback riding, camel rides, and games like ring toss and balloon shooting. The beach also serves as a popular spot for evening strolls and picnics, offering a stunning view of the Arabian sea and the famous Marine Drive skyline.', '2024120412231329a96e248897ed115cdbd075cc348142.jpg', 'Located in the bustling city of Mumbai, Girgaon Chowpatty is a popular beach that draws in crowds of locals and tourists alike. It is situated in the Girgaon neighborhood and is considered to be one of the most iconic beaches in the city. The beach is known for its vibrant atmosphere, with colorful street vendors, food stalls, and entertainment options lining the shore.', NULL, '202412041218420858c1c5ce9afeac1aff470d8c42858f.png', 'We met early in the morning at the beach viewing deck, where we were greeted with a breathtaking view of the marine drive. The sound of the waves crashing against the shore and the gentle sea breeze filled our senses, creating a serene atmosphere. As we stood there on the deck, we could see the bustling marine drive below us, with cars and people starting to fill the streets. It was a perfect spot to take in the beauty of both the ocean and the city. We sat on the wooden benches, sipping our coffee and watching as the sky changed colors with each passing minute.', 'Visitors can enjoy a variety of activities such as horseback riding, camel rides, and games like ring toss and balloon shooting. The beach also serves as a popular spot for evening strolls and picnics, offering a stunning view of the Arabian sea and the famous Marine Drive skyline', 'The early morning calmness was a refreshing break from the daily hustle and bustle of life. We stayed there for a while, taking in the peacefulness of the moment before starting our day. It was a simple yet memorable experience, one that reminded us to slow down and appreciate the beauty that surrounds us every day.', 'While walking along the sandy shore of Girgaon Beach, one cannot help but notice the grand and magnificent Wilson College. Located in the bustling city of Mumbai, this prestigious institution stands tall with its striking colonial architecture and lush green gardens', '20241204121843cadf7fe35d0afc7371955437842533d8.png', 'Early morning at the beach is a sight to behold. The gentle waves crashing against the shore, the golden sun rising in the sky and the fresh salty breeze filling the air. But what truly adds to the beauty of this scene is the sight of children playing cricket on the soft sandy beach. The sound of their laughter and cheers echoes through the peaceful surroundings, bringing a sense of joy and innocence to the morning. As they run around barefoot, chasing after the ball, their carefree spirits are evident in every movement. They are completely immersed in their game, with no worries or responsibilities to hold them back. As I watch them play, I am reminded of my own childhood days spent playing with friends on the beach, creating memories that I still cherish. These children may not realize it now, but they are creating memories that they will look back on with fondness in years to come. The beach may be a place of relaxation for many, but for these children, it is a playground where they can let their imaginations run wild and enjoy the simple pleasures of life. Seeing them play cricket together fills my heart with warmth and reminds me to appreciate the little joys in life.', 'Walking along the sandy shore of the beach, one can\'t help but notice the bustling activity of the small boats gliding through the sparkling blue waters. However, amidst all the commotion, one can also spot a group of pigeons perched on the shore or flying gracefully above. These feathered creatures seem to have made the beach their home, with their cooing and fluttering adding to the serene atmosphere. With their shiny feathers and curious gazes, they add a touch of charm to the already picturesque scene. It\'s fascinating to see how these birds coexist with the humans and boats in perfect harmony, creating a unique blend of nature and civilization on the beach. As I continue my stroll, I can\'t help but admire the simple beauty of these pigeons and their presence on the beach.', '2024120412291892648ba21348de00c0b546cd1ccbea1f.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3773.4704854355646!2d72.80553647520232!3d18.954818082224982!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7cf22fb44ca23%3A0xd9de59061eebb2a6!2sGirgaon%20Chowpatty%20Viewing%20Deck!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1733312461791!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Girgaon Chowpatty photowalk Fujifilm', 'Girgaon Chowpatty photowalk Fujifilm, photowwalk, photowalksindia, photowalksmumbai', '2024-12-04 18:47:55', '2024-12-04 19:29:20', NULL),
(45, 'Alandi Ghat', 'alandi-ghat', '202412091349277577c9c1d5358921a10500b446a57091.jpg', 'Jay Ganesh Temple', 3, '2024-12-28 07:30:00', 'Alandi Ghat is a popular pilgrimage site located on the banks of the Indrayani River in the Pune district of Maharashtra, India. It is a holy place for devotees of the 13th-century Hindu saint, Sant Dnyaneshwar. The ghat is known for its serene and spiritual atmosphere, making it a popular destination for religious and cultural tourists. The main attraction of Alandi Ghat is the temple of Sant Dnyaneshwar, which is believed to be the site where he attained Samadhi at the young age of 21. The temple architecture boasts of intricate carvings and beautiful paintings, attracting art lovers as well.', '20241209134927aaa8e6adf9e364072f1ac97ea032dffd.jpg', 'Alandi Ghat is a popular pilgrimage site located on the banks of the Indrayani River in the Pune district of Maharashtra, India. It is a holy place for devotees of the 13th-century Hindu saint, Sant Dnyaneshwar. The ghat is known for its serene and spiritual atmosphere, making it a popular destination for religious and cultural tourists. The main attraction of Alandi Ghat is the temple of Sant Dnyaneshwar, which is believed to be the site where he attained Samadhi at the young age of 21. The temple architecture boasts of intricate carvings and beautiful paintings, attracting art lovers as well.', NULL, '2024120913492703dbe576b5770ec7027f202cdbc186eb.png', 'The ghat also hosts several festivals throughout the year, with the most famous being Sant Dnyaneshwar Palkhi, a grand procession that takes place during the Hindu month of Ashadh. Alandi Ghat is not only a significant religious site but also a picturesque location with lush greenery and stunning views of the river, making it a must-visit for anyone seeking spiritual solace and tranquility.', 'Alandi Ghat monuments are a collection of historical and cultural sites that hold great significance in the region. These monuments showcase the rich heritage and architectural style of the Maratha Empire and have been well-preserved over the years.', 'The most prominent among these is the Sant Dnyaneshwar Samadhi, which is the final resting place of the revered 13th-century saint, Sant Dnyaneshwar. Other notable monuments include the beautiful Alandi Devachi and the Siddheshwar Temple, both dedicated to Lord Shiva, and the picturesque Indrayani River that flows through the ghat.', 'The entire area is surrounded by lush greenery and offers a serene and tranquil environment for visitors to explore these ancient structures. These monuments not only attract tourists but also hold religious importance for devotees who come to seek blessings and pay their respects. Alandi Ghat monuments stand as a testimony to the rich history and cultural heritage of India and are definitely a must-visit for anyone interested in exploring the country\'s past.', '20241209134928245045ab0a0f4263f5be3bda32dd942a.png', 'Located on the banks of the holy river Indrayani, this small town is renowned for its significance in the life of Sant Dnyaneshwar, a revered saint and poet. The town attracts thousands of devotees every year, who come to pay their respects to the Samadhi (tomb) of Sant Dnyaneshwar. The Bhodi Ghat is also known for its annual festival, held in the month of Ashadha (June-July), which commemorates the birth anniversary of Sant Dnyaneshwar. The festival is a grand affair, with colorful processions, devotional music, and cultural performances. The town is also home to various other temples and religious sites, making it a popular destination for pilgrims. Apart from its religious significance, Alandi Bhodi Ghat also offers picturesque views of the river and surrounding hills, making it a peaceful and serene location for spiritual contemplation. Overall, Alandi Bhodi Ghat holds a special place in the hearts of devotees and visitors alike, who are drawn to its spiritual aura and tranquil ambiance.', 'It is is a great place for photography enthusiasts as it offers a picturesque setting with a blend of natural beauty and historical significance.  It is known for its peaceful and serene atmosphere, making it an ideal location for capturing stunning shots. The ghat is surrounded by lush greenery and offers a stunning view of the river, making it a popular spot for nature photography. Overall, Alandi Ghat is a must-visit destination for photography enthusiasts, providing them with endless opportunities to capture the beauty of nature and culture in one frame.', '2024120914170488ba0030f29cd2c0a2c54f3948f3a45e.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d788.6726219385032!2d73.894758!3d18.6764325!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2c9223b498839%3A0xc8b03a8d7d3a68fa!2sJay%20Ganesh%20Temple!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1733753777499!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Alandi ghat photowalk in pune', 'Alandi ghat photowalk in pune', '2024-12-09 20:49:28', '2024-12-09 21:17:05', NULL);
