(46, 'Maidan', 'maidan', '202412300419495d9f7c845f0f1fa6ac84a6a166fecd03.png', 'Maidan Metro Station', 4, '2025-12-13 06:00:00', 'Kolkata Maidan, also known as the Brigade Parade Ground, is a sprawling urban park located in the heart of Kolkata, West Bengal. It covers an area of over 400 acres and is one of the largest urban parks in India. The Maidan has a rich history and serves as a popular recreational spot for the people of Kolkata. The lush greenery, coupled with the presence of several monuments and statues, makes it a picturesque location for picnics and leisurely walks.', '20241230041949e92de50319829a9aa9120e5a03cbdcd7.png', 'Kolkata Maidan, also known as the Brigade Parade Ground, is a sprawling urban park located in the heart of Kolkata, West Bengal. It covers an area of over 400 acres and is one of the largest urban parks in India. The Maidan has a rich history and serves as a popular recreational spot for the people of Kolkata. The lush greenery, coupled with the presence of several monuments and statues, makes it a picturesque location for picnics and leisurely walks.', 'he Maidan is also a hub for various sports activities with numerous sports clubs and fields, including cricket, football, and hockey. It has also witnessed several historical events, including political rallies and protests, making it a significant landmark in the city. The Maidan is not only a symbol of Kolkata\'s cultural heritage but also a reflection of its vibrant and diverse community that gathers here to celebrate and engage in various activities. With its serene atmosphere and vibrant energy, Kolkata Maidan continues to be an integral part of the city\'s identity and a must-visit destination for tourists.', '202412300419497372b8bc301f3af53a64288b9744fcc2.png', 'The early hours in Kolkata\'s Maidan are a photographer\'s paradise. As the sun rises over the city, the Maidan is enveloped in a warm, golden hue, creating the perfect setting for capturing stunning photographs. The soft morning light casts a beautiful glow on the numerous monuments and structures scattered throughout the Maidan, adding a touch of magic to the already picturesque landscape.', 'The calm and stillness of the morning also make it an ideal time for capturing candid shots of the locals as they go about their daily activities, whether it be exercising, playing sports, or simply enjoying a morning stroll. The lack of crowds during this time allows for unobstructed views and the opportunity to capture unique perspectives of the famous landmarks such as Victoria Memorial and Shahid Minar.', 'The early hours in Kolkata\'s Maidan not only provide ideal lighting conditions but also offer a peaceful and tranquil atmosphere, making it a must-visit for photographers looking to capture the beauty and charm of this iconic location.', 'The Victoria Memorial, a grand and iconic structure located in the heart of Kolkata\'s Maidan, has long been a symbol of the city\'s rich history and colonial legacy. As one of the most popular tourist attractions in Kolkata, capturing good shots of the Victoria Memorial from the Maidan has become a must-do for visitors and locals alike. The sprawling green lawns of the Maidan provide the perfect vantage point for photographers to capture the majestic white marble monument against a clear blue sky.', '20241230041950a2673440d62cc7df83140feffba9e792.png', 'The early morning light casts a warm glow on the Memorial, making it a prime time for photographers to capture stunning shots. As the day progresses, the changing light and shadows create new and interesting perspectives, making every shot unique. Whether it\'s a wide-angle shot encompassing the entire structure or a close-up of its intricate details, the Victoria Memorial offers endless possibilities for photographers to capture its beauty and grandeur. With its strategic location and timeless charm, the Maidan continues to be a favorite spot for photographers to capture good shots of the Victoria Memorial and preserve its magnificence for generations to come.', 'We are thrilled to invite you to join us for the photowalk at Maidan in Kolkata. This event promises to be a unique and exciting opportunity for photography enthusiasts to explore the iconic Maiden area of Kolkata through  camera lenses.', '2024123004195073b9c0fc9a1cfb70ff0108c7d1ec349d.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\",\"6\":\"There is a basic government fee to enter the Victoria Memorial Hall to be paid by the participants\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3075.462575221901!2d88.34600022529978!3d22.549253679508368!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a0277119a280595%3A0xc28c3c651dc79de9!2sMaidan!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1765274857320!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/to-the-undiscovered-meadows-of-kolkata/6936ab3905c494016b858d2b', 'kolkata photowalk at Maidan at Victoria Memorial Hall', 'kolkata photowalk at Maidan at Victoria Memorial Hall Fujifilm', '2024-12-30 11:19:51', '2025-12-10 11:58:18', NULL),
(47, 'KR Market', 'kr-market', '202501070517551ceb07129738634f8255cc3f2c892663.jpg', 'Jamia Masjid', 2, '2025-04-26 07:00:00', 'KR Market, also known as Krishna Rajendra Market, is a bustling wholesale market in the heart of Bangalore city in India. Spread over 7 acres, this market has been a hub for traders and farmers since the 1920s. The market is named after the former ruler of Mysore, Krishnaraja Wadiyar IV, who played a significant role in developing this area. KR Market is not only known for its variety of fresh produce such as fruits, vegetables, and flowers, but it is also popular for its traditional bazaars selling items like silk sarees, spices, and handicrafts.', '2025010705175574028366b6d4cbb621535f5e8088bf53.jpg', 'KR Market, also known as Krishna Rajendra Market, is a bustling wholesale market in the heart of Bangalore city in India. Spread over 7 acres, this market has been a hub for traders and farmers since the 1920s. The market is named after the former ruler of Mysore, Krishnaraja Wadiyar IV, who played a significant role in developing this area. KR Market is not only known for its variety of fresh produce such as fruits, vegetables, and flowers, but it is also popular for its traditional bazaars selling items like silk sarees, spices, and handicrafts.', 'The market attracts a huge crowd every day, with vendors shouting out their prices and customers bargaining for the best deals. The vibrant and chaotic atmosphere of KR Market truly captures the essence of Bangalore\'s culture and heritage. Despite being a wholesale market, it is also a major tourist attraction, offering a glimpse into the daily lives and business activities of the locals. With its rich history and diverse offerings, KR Market is undoubtedly a must-visit destination for anyone wanting to experience the true colors of Bangalore.', '20250107051755999b20ac4759da8e73253546fb520e91.png', 'The KR Market in Bangalore, India is a bustling hub for street photography. This vibrant market is known for its colorful produce, bustling crowds, and lively atmosphere, making it the perfect place for photographers to capture candid shots. The narrow streets are filled with vendors selling a variety of goods, from fresh fruits and vegetables to traditional Indian handicrafts.', 'The mix of people from different backgrounds and cultures adds to the diversity of subjects for street photographers. The chaos and energy of the market create a unique backdrop for capturing raw and authentic moments. Photographers can also take advantage of the natural light that streams in through the market\'s open roofs, creating stunning compositions. With its cultural richness and dynamic environment, the KR market is a popular destination for photographers seeking to capture the essence of street life in India.', 'It is also a great place to capture photos of portraits. As people go about their daily routines, bargaining for goods or simply enjoying the lively atmosphere, there is ample opportunity to observe and capture their unique expressions and personalities. Whether it\'s the wrinkled face of an elderly vendor, the infectious smile of a child, or the intense gaze of a street performer, the market area offers a diverse range of subjects for portraits.', 'With its dynamic and ever-changing environment, one can expect to capture candid and authentic shots that truly reflect the essence of the local culture and daily life in the market area.', '20250107051756faf34b7999b668aa96145e00db908fae.png', 'These photos not only serve as beautiful mementos of one\'s travels but also provide a glimpse into the human side of a bustling market. From the colorful characters to the vibrant energy, capturing portraits in the market area is an experience that offers both visual and cultural richness.\r\n\r\n The morning time is often considered the best time to take photos, especially at markets. As the sun rises and the city awakens, the market comes alive with a bustling energy. Vendors set up their colorful displays, locals gather to start their day of shopping, and the smell of fresh produce and cooked food fills the air. The vibrant atmosphere and natural lighting during this time create the perfect setting for capturing stunning photos.', 'The soft morning light enhances colors and adds a warm glow to the surroundings, making everything appear more alive and vibrant. This is also a prime time to capture candid moments of people going about their daily routines, providing a glimpse into the culture and lifestyle of the market. The morning time truly offers a unique and dynamic atmosphere for photography, making it the ideal time to capture the essence of a bustling market.', '20250107051757bdb69a445323d501f6a1334f58d2165b.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1622.5832208810148!2d77.57758291535865!3d12.963882018689654!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bae15e22ee69199%3A0x481e7de6b140f0e9!2sJamia%20Masjid%20Bengaluru%20City!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1736227115911!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'KR market photowalk Fujifjifm', 'KR market photowalk Fujifjifm, bengaluru', '2025-01-07 12:17:58', '2025-04-22 13:39:29', NULL),
(48, 'Rabindra Sarani', 'rabindra-sarani', '2025011110545425954bd21dec07d6d74ec0200b327a34.jpg', 'Nakhoda Masjid Gate', 4, '2025-01-25 07:30:00', 'Rabindra Sarani, also known as Chitpur Road, is a bustling street located in the heart of Kolkata, the capital city of West Bengal.  It is lined with numerous shops, market stalls, and iconic buildings that showcase the rich cultural heritage of Kolkata. The street is known for its vibrant atmosphere and is always bustling with people, honking vehicles, and street vendors selling a variety of items. It is also home to many historical landmarks such as the famous Kali Temple, Nakhoda Mosque, and the iconic Marble Palace', '202501111054547a33622080ba9dbb105409d320c978b8.jpg', 'Rabindra Sarani, also known as Chitpur Road, is a bustling street located in the heart of Kolkata, the capital city of West Bengal. Named after the renowned poet and Nobel Laureate Rabindranath Tagore, this road is one of the oldest and busiest thoroughfares in the city. It runs parallel to the Hooghly River and connects important areas like Burrabazar, Bagbazar, and Maniktala. The street is lined with numerous shops, restaurants, and markets selling a variety of goods ranging from traditional Bengali handicrafts to modern clothing and electronics.', 'It is also home to several historical buildings and landmarks, such as the iconic Marble Palace and Nakhoda Masjid, which adds to its charm and character. The vibrant atmosphere of Rabindra Sarani reflects the rich cultural heritage of Kolkata and makes it a popular destination for both locals and tourists alike. From street food to high-end shopping, this bustling road has something for everyone, making it an integral part of the city\'s identity.', '202501111054541ebc20b671f4c9a4e6cd454ff25c9c1f.png', 'It is lined with numerous shops, market stalls, and iconic buildings that showcase the rich cultural heritage of Kolkata. The street is known for its vibrant atmosphere and is always bustling with people, honking vehicles, and street vendors selling a variety of items. It is also home to many historical landmarks such as the famous Kali Temple, Nakhoda Mosque, and the iconic Marble Palace.', 'The street is a shopper\'s paradise with a wide range of goods available at affordable prices. From traditional Bengali sarees to spices, electronics, and household items, Rabindra Sarani offers something for everyone. Despite being crowded and chaotic at times, this road holds a special place in the hearts of Kolkatans and continues to be a popular destination for tourists seeking a glimpse of the city\'s vibrant culture and heritage.', 'The old buildings and narrow lanes add a touch of nostalgia to the atmosphere, making it a perfect location for capturing the essence of Kolkata\'s rich history and heritage. The constant movement and energy on this road creates a dynamic backdrop for street photography, with something new and interesting to capture at every turn. From the beautiful architecture to the vibrant street art and the warm smiles of the locals, Rabindra Sarani Road is truly a treasure trove for any photographer looking to capture the soul of Kolkata through their lens.', 'The market area is an ideal spot for photography in the morning as it offers a diverse range of subjects and elements to capture. With the hustle and bustle of vendors setting up their stalls and shoppers browsing through the colorful displays, there is a lively and vibrant atmosphere that can add depth and interest to photographs. The soft morning light also adds a warm and inviting glow to the surroundings, making it perfect for capturing stunning portraits. The market area is also a melting pot of different cultures, with people from various backgrounds coming together, providing an excellent opportunity for street photography. Additionally, the variety of products and produce on display creates a dynamic and ever-changing backdrop for photos.', '2025011110545475da92569aa8ad5b4a84d3884d7c53f1.png', 'From fresh fruits and vegetables to intricate hand-made crafts, there is no shortage of inspiration for photographers in the market area in the morning. Overall, the market area is a photographer\'s paradise in the morning, offering a perfect blend of people, culture, and products to capture beautiful and unique shots.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe are thrilled to invite you to join us for the upcoming photowalk! We cannot wait to have you be a part of this exciting event where we will explore and capture the beauty of our surroundings.', 'We believe that photography is not just about taking pictures, but it\'s also about creating memories and sharing experiences with others. That\'s why we are eagerly looking forward to having you join us and be a part of our photography community. This photowalk will not only be a great opportunity for you to improve your photography skills, but it will also be a chance to meet new people who share the same passion as you. So come and join us, and let\'s capture some amazing moments together! We promise it will be an unforgettable experience. See you at the photowalk!', '20250111105455c737a3be3d909bbb6ebf46250c6320d5.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"5\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3074.8335026509812!2d88.35368387435337!3d22.57746193279398!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a0277b1b0c0b993%3A0x2d436551231224e9!2sNakhoda%20Masjid%20(Mosque)!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1736592673379!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Kolkata Photowalk at Rabindra Sarani', 'Kolkata Photowalk at Rabindra Sarani with Fujifilm India Photowalk', '2025-01-11 17:54:56', '2025-01-21 12:11:17', NULL),
(49, 'College Street Book Market', 'college-street-book-market', '20250112120643031f97722127681a3ea86a794b9d7c6d.jpg', 'Indian Coffee House', 4, '2025-01-18 08:00:00', 'College Street Book Market in Kolkata, also known as Boi Para (book town), is a paradise for book lovers. It is located in the heart of the city and is one of the largest second-hand book markets in the world. The market stretches over a kilometer and is home to over 2,000 small and large book shops, making it a haven for both students and scholars. The market has a rich history and dates back to the 19th century when it was primarily known for its printing press and publishing houses. Today, it is a bustling hub of activity with vendors selling a wide variety of books, ranging from textbooks and academic books to rare and out-of-print books.', '20250112120643fe522b57967b65f0acc5ac59b1d2c964.jpg', 'College Street Book Market in Kolkata, also known as Boi Para (book town), is a paradise for book lovers. It is located in the heart of the city and is one of the largest second-hand book markets in the world. The market stretches over a kilometer and is home to over 2,000 small and large book shops, making it a haven for both students and scholars. The market has a rich history and dates back to the 19th century when it was primarily known for its printing press and publishing houses. T', 'Today, it is a bustling hub of activity with vendors selling a wide variety of books, ranging from textbooks and academic books to rare and out-of-print books. The vibrant atmosphere, with constant bargaining and haggling, adds to the charm of this iconic market. It is not only a book lover\'s paradise but also a cultural hub, with several events and book launches taking place here throughout the year. A visit to College Street Book Market is a must for anyone looking to immerse themselves in the rich literary culture of Kolkata.', '202501121206430a7a2bc8dc5577de9cacd8f78dc82bc9.png', 'Kolkata\'s College Road Book Market is a treasure trove for book lovers and photographers alike. This bustling hub of booksellers and literary enthusiasts is a haven for anyone seeking to capture the essence of the city through their lens. The vibrant atmosphere, with its maze of book stalls, old architecture, and bustling crowds, provides the perfect backdrop for stunning photographs. From the colorful book covers to the animated conversations between buyers and sellers, every aspect of this market is a feast for the eyes.', 'The narrow lanes and winding alleys are a photographer\'s dream, with endless opportunities to capture the essence of Kolkata\'s literary culture. With its unique charm and bustling energy, the College Road Book Market is a must-visit for anyone looking for a truly authentic photography experience in Kolkata.', 'The old book shops in Kolkata hold a special charm that reflects the tradition of reading books, a practice that seems to be fading away in today\'s digital era. These quaint shops, with their dusty shelves and creaky floors, are a testament to the love for books that has been ingrained in the culture of Kolkata for centuries', 'The narrow alleys of College Street, lined with numerous bookstores, evoke a sense of nostalgia and take us back to a time when people would spend hours browsing through the pages of their favorite books. However, with the rise of e-books and online reading platforms, the allure of physical bookstores has diminished. The traditional culture of reading books, where one could hold a book in their hands and immerse themselves in its pages, is slowly disappearing.', '2025011212064383d586080b93f89e773c73e2ab48af32.png', 'The old bookshops in Kolkata serve as a reminder of this lost tradition and remind us to hold on to the joy and magic of reading books in its purest form. They stand as a symbol of resistance against the increasing dominance of technology and remind us to cherish the simple pleasure of flipping through the pages of a good book. \r\n\r\n Kolkata, has always been a hub for education and learning. It is home to a large population of highly educated and knowledgeable citizens, who are avid book readers. From a young age, the people of Kolkata are exposed to a rich literary culture, with the city being home to renowned book fairs and publishing houses.', 'This has cultivated a love for reading among its citizens, who actively seek out books and literature to broaden their knowledge and understanding of the world. It is not uncommon to see people walking around with a book in hand, or spending hours in bookstores and libraries. The passion for reading is deeply embedded in the city\'s culture, and it is evident in the vast number of book clubs and literary events that take place regularly. It is this love for books and thirst for knowledge that sets Kolkata apart and makes it a city of well-educated and well-read individuals.', '202501121206445b9b98e9f4311e6a6e31404758f6f363.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"Get to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d49197.83174751686!2d88.2919049263!3d22.576073469831815!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a02764d5e20e8df%3A0xdc64330f0f594a5c!2sIndian%20Coffee%20House!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1736683445392!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 0, NULL, 'College Street Book Market Photowalk Fujifilm India', 'College Street Book Market Photowalk Fujifilm India', '2025-01-12 19:06:45', '2025-01-21 12:10:51', NULL),
(50, 'Pashan Lake', 'pashan-lake', '20250210191632300a6344958bc9689925665f26b9137d.jpg', 'Main Entrance Gate', 3, '2025-02-15 07:30:00', 'Pashan Lake photowalk is a scenic and memorable experience for photography enthusiasts and nature lovers alike. Located in Pune, India, Pashan Lake is a tranquil and serene water body surrounded by lush greenery and diverse flora and fauna. The photowalk offers a unique opportunity to capture stunning images of the beautiful lake, its surroundings, and the wildlife that calls it home.', '202502101916322c817bcd9962ec6302b95c33de2cb363.jpg', 'The walk also includes a guided tour by expert photographers who provide valuable tips and techniques for capturing the perfect shot. As the light changes throughout the day, the scenery transforms, making every moment of the photowalk a new and exciting adventure. From migratory birds to colorful flowers, Pashan Lake photowalk offers endless possibilities for capturing breathtaking photos and creating lasting memories.', 'Located in Pune, India, this lake is surrounded by lush greenery and towering mountains, making it a paradise for nature enthusiasts. The serene waters of the lake reflect the surrounding landscapes, creating a picturesque view that is perfect for photography. The lake is also home to a variety of bird species, making it an ideal spot for bird photography.', '202502101916325a954d8e7697dfb26388bd381ae83ffc.png', 'The changing colors of the sky during sunrise and sunset add to the charm of this place, providing ample opportunities for capturing breathtaking photos. Whether you are a professional photographer or an amateur looking to capture some stunning shots, Pashan Lake is definitely a must-visit destination.', 'he lake and its surrounding areas serve as a crucial habitat for various species of birds, insects, fishes, and plants, making it a hub of local biodiversity. The lake is surrounded by lush greenery and serves as an important breeding and nesting ground for many migratory birds such as flamingos, pelicans, and storks.', 'The lake also supports a variety of aquatic plants and fishes, making it a hotspot for aquatic biodiversity. The local community plays an essential role in the conservation of Pashan Lake\'s biodiversity by regularly conducting clean-up drives and raising awareness about the importance of preserving this natural treasure', 'Efforts are also being made to introduce sustainable practices in the surrounding areas to further protect the lake\'s ecological balance. Pashan Lake is not only a beautiful recreational spot but also a vital contributor to the local bio diversity, making it a significant part of Pune\'s ecological heritage.', '20250210191632ffbfa6632a623921fa31124eb91ce943.png', 'Whether you are a professional photographer or just starting out, Pashan Lake photowalk is an enriching experience that will leave you with a newfound appreciation for nature\'s beauty.', 'Whether you are a professional photographer or just starting out, Pashan Lake photowalk is an enriching experience that will leave you with a newfound appreciation for nature\'s beauty.', '202502101916338304c7ebb9600ee672807f5f13ebc47e.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"You can also click from Mobile Phones\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6314.675526709334!2d73.7758622398694!3d18.533667099143273!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2beef95427c25%3A0x4b2496024f6b9d80!2sPashan%20Lake!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1739214943330!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Pashan Lake Photowalk', 'Pashan Lake', '2025-02-11 02:16:34', '2025-02-11 02:16:34', NULL),
(51, 'Rabindra Sarobar Lake', 'rabindra-sarobar-lake', '20250211151540d4b15de1fb1d0d5019a4ce2f6195a936.jpg', 'Rabindra Sarobar Lake Main Entrance', 4, '2026-01-04 07:00:00', 'Rabindra Sarobar Lake, also known as Dhakuria Lake, is a prominent landmark and popular recreational spot in Kolkata, India. This beautiful lake was named after the famous Indian poet Rabindranath Tagore, who used to frequent the area for inspiration. The lake is spread over an area of 73 acres and is surrounded by lush greenery and scenic beauty. It is a man-made lake, built in the early 1920s to serve as a water reservoir for the city. However, over the years, it has evolved into a popular tourist destination, attracting people from all walks of life. The tranquil atmosphere and picturesque surroundings make it a perfect place for a leisurely stroll or a peaceful picnic with family and friends.', '20250211153948db40f42709a6bedfb03084b3b2dfa342.jpg', 'Rabindra Sarobar Lake, also known as Dhakuria Lake, is a prominent landmark and popular recreational spot in Kolkata, India. This beautiful lake was named after the famous Indian poet Rabindranath Tagore, who used to frequent the area for inspiration. The lake is spread over an area of 73 acres and is surrounded by lush greenery and scenic beauty. It is a man-made lake, built in the early 1920s to serve as a water reservoir for the city. However, over the years, it has evolved into a popular tourist destination, attracting people from all walks of life. The tranquil atmosphere and picturesque surroundings make it a perfect place for a leisurely stroll or a peaceful picnic with family and friends.', 'The lake is also home to a variety of flora and fauna, making it a paradise for nature enthusiasts. Apart from its natural beauty, Rabindra Sarobar Lake also offers various recreational activities like boating, fishing, and bird watching. It is truly a gem in the heart of the bustling city of Kolkata, providing a much-needed respite from the chaos of urban life.', '20250211151540bf654521644f2f287ea50f74930e007c.png', 'Nestled in the heart of Kolkata, Rabindra Sarobar Lake is a haven for bird photographers. This beautiful lake, also known as Dhakuria Lake, is a popular spot for nature lovers and bird enthusiasts alike. The serene surroundings and lush greenery make it an ideal location for capturing stunning photographs of various bird species. The lake is home to a diverse range of birds, including migratory birds that arrive during the winter season.', 'From majestic herons and egrets to colorful kingfishers and parakeets, one can find a plethora of bird species here. The calm and quiet atmosphere of the lake provides a perfect setting for photographers to patiently wait for the right moment to capture the perfect shot.', 'With its picturesque views and abundance of birds, Rabindra Sarobar Lake truly offers an excellent opportunity for bird photography.\r\n\r\nThe lake is not only known for its scenic beauty and serene atmosphere but also for its rich biodiversity. One of the most iconic attractions of this lake is the lotus flower that blooms in abundance during the monsoon season.', 'The lotus flower, or \'Padma\' as it is commonly known in India, holds great cultural significance in Hinduism and Buddhism. The vibrant pink and white lotus flowers that cover the lake\'s surface create a picturesque view that is a photographer\'s delight. Not only are these flowers aesthetically pleasing, but they also have medicinal properties and are used in traditional medicine.', '20250211151540577a7f144fe012ac672ae06fa4a37fbd.png', 'The blooming of lotus flowers in Rabindra Sarobar Lake is eagerly awaited by locals and visitors alike, as it signifies the arrival of monsoon and the renewal of life. The lake serves as a natural habitat for various species of birds, insects, and aquatic animals, making it a must-visit for nature enthusiasts. The lotus flowers add to the lake\'s charm and make it a tranquil spot for people to relax, unwind, and connect with nature. \r\n\r\n Rabindra Sarobar Lake walking is an experience that is unforgettable and rejuvenating for both the mind and body. Located in the heart of Kolkata, this man-made lake is spread over an area of 192 acres and is surrounded by lush greenery, making it a perfect spot for a peaceful walk.', 'As one walks along the perimeter of the lake, they are greeted with the soothing sound of birds chirping and the gentle breeze rustling through the trees. The serene atmosphere and picturesque views make it a popular spot for morning and evening walks, where people of all ages can be seen strolling or jogging along the well-maintained pathway. The lake also boasts of a diverse range of flora and fauna, adding to the overall charm of the place. Walking around Rabindra Sarobar Lake not only provides physical exercise but also offers a chance to connect with nature and escape from the hustle and bustle of city life. It is a must-visit destination for anyone looking to unwind and relax in the midst of nature.', '202502111515414627021e8fa9e7532e4f05cbbb4b6de8.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Duration of the photowalk is of 90 Mins ( 1.5 Hrs)\",\"2\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"3\":\"You can also click through your mobile phones\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3076.2973679780434!2d88.35446979999999!3d22.511768999999997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a0276d53e5adf49%3A0x7c7f33a4a7c9790d!2sCalcutta%20Rowing%20Club%20(CRC)!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1767185624319!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/rabindra-sarobar-lake-photowalk/6954efb700239d190669f3cd', 'Rabindra Sarobar Lake photowalk', 'Rabindra Sarobar Lake photowalk, rabindra Sarobar, Photowalk Kolkata , Fujifilm India', '2025-02-11 22:15:42', '2026-01-01 16:29:13', NULL),
(52, 'Flower Maket Yard', 'flower-maket-yard', '202503010547099fc21d1fe5e2aa5cd61dd62ee7eaa784.jpg', 'Gultekadi Parking Lot', 3, '2025-03-29 07:30:00', 'Located in the bustling city of Pune, India, Gultekdi flower market is a vibrant and colorful hub for all things floral. Spread across a sprawling area, this market is a popular destination for locals as well as visitors looking to buy fresh and fragrant flowers. The market is a bustling hive of activity with vendors selling a wide variety of flowers, from traditional Indian blooms like marigolds and jasmine to imported exotic flowers like lilies and orchids.', '202503010547096cf856278bf6557bf6a1c1d27dabae2f.png', 'Located in the bustling city of Pune, India, Gultekdi flower market is a vibrant and colorful hub for all things floral. Spread across a sprawling area, this market is a popular destination for locals as well as visitors looking to buy fresh and fragrant flowers. The market is a bustling hive of activity with vendors selling a wide variety of flowers, from traditional Indian blooms like marigolds and jasmine to imported exotic flowers like lilies and orchids.', 'The market is open every day, starting from early morning till late evening, making it convenient for people to stop by and purchase their favorite flowers. Apart from being a major source of flowers for special occasions like weddings and festivals, the Gultekdi flower market also has a significant impact on the local economy, providing employment opportunities to many. With its vibrant atmosphere, diverse range of flowers, and cultural significance, the Gultekdi flower market is truly a sight to behold and an essential part of Pune\'s charm.', '20250301054709202e2bf3f970e00f5d528665495f0ffb.png', 'The flower market is an excellent place for photography enthusiasts to capture the vibrant colors and textures of beautiful blooms. From the bustling crowds to the aromatic scents, there is no shortage of inspiration in a flower market. The variety of flowers on display, from delicate roses to exotic orchids, provides endless opportunities for creative shots.', 'Photographers can also capture the interactions between vendors and customers, adding a human element to their images. Furthermore, the natural lighting in a flower market is ideal for taking stunning photos, especially during golden hour. The colorful backdrop of the market also adds a charming and whimsical touch to any photograph.', 'Overall, the flower market offers a dynamic and vibrant setting for photographers to capture stunning images that are sure to impress. Whether it\'s for a professional photoshoot or simply for personal enjoyment, the flower market is an excellent place to hone one\'s photography skills and capture beautiful moments.', 'The early morning flower market is a bustling and vibrant place, filled with the intoxicating scent of fresh blooms and the cheerful chatter of vendors and customers. As the first rays of sunlight peek through the streets, the market comes alive with an array of colors and fragrances. Rows upon rows of beautiful flowers, from delicate roses to cheerful daisies, are neatly displayed in wooden crates and buckets.', '202503010547090f9cc8e0daeb984475c3b5a53f8dc9a0.png', 'Customers eagerly browse the selection, carefully selecting the perfect bouquet for their loved ones or home. The market is a feast for the senses - the vivid hues of the flowers, the sweet aroma of the blooms, and the lively atmosphere all combine to create a truly enchanting experience. It is a place where one can escape the chaos of city life and immerse themselves in the simple beauty of nature. The early morning flower market is a true delight for anyone who appreciates the wonders of a fresh and vibrant floral display.', 'As we wander through the rows of stalls, you will be captivated by the sight of vendors carefully arranging their bouquets and potted plants. What makes this market truly special, however, is the opportunity to take portrait photos of the vendors themselves. Each vendor has their own unique character and story to tell, and capturing their expressions and interactions with customers adds a personal touch to the photographs. The market is a perfect blend of nature\'s beauty and human connection, and being able to freeze these moments through my camera lens is a true delight. Whether it\'s a smiling vendor holding up a bouquet or an intense negotiation between a customer and seller, each photo captures a different aspect of the flower market experience.', '202503010547118b4e8a16d029562430c923478ef7f488.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Duration of the photowalk is approx 1.5 Hrs\",\"2\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1579.082415389601!2d73.86361062204104!3d18.488846024711027!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2c01f5d9e9ce5%3A0x282e44883fb81e34!2sMarketyard%20Parking!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1740807860054!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'flower market photowalk pune', 'flower market photowalk pune', '2025-03-01 12:47:11', '2025-03-03 11:08:45', NULL),
(53, 'Purana Quila', 'purana-quila', '20250313055958c581405c2929f40c50c2643552f491e4.jpg', 'Entrance gate', 5, '2025-08-19 07:00:00', 'Purana Quila, also known as the Old Fort, is a majestic historic monument located in the heart of Delhi, India. It is considered to be the oldest existing fort in Delhi, with its origins dating back to the 16th century. The fort was built by the Mughal emperor Humayun and later completed by Sher Shah Suri. It is an architectural masterpiece that showcases the fusion of Mughal, Hindu and Afghan styles of architecture.', '202503130559586fba6b4bd16a8ff324ccd831ae0f1af8.jpg', 'Purana Qila, also known as the Old Fort, is a majestic historic monument located in the heart of Delhi, India. It is considered to be the oldest existing fort in Delhi, with its origins dating back to the 16th century. The fort was built by the Mughal emperor Humayun and later completed by Sher Shah Suri. It is an architectural masterpiece that showcases the fusion of Mughal, Hindu and Afghan styles of architecture.', 'The fort is spread over an area of 1.5 kilometers and is surrounded by a moat, giving it a grand and imposing appearance. The main entrance of the fort, known as Bara Darwaza, is adorned with intricate designs and carvings. The fort also houses several other structures including a mosque, a stepwell, and a royal bath.', '2025031305595805ca71082da2144473c6cbc9e98c8157.png', 'The impressive red sandstone walls and ornate gates of Purana Qila have stood the test of time and continue to mesmerize visitors with their grandeur and historical significance. Today, it serves as a popular tourist destination and a perfect spot for history enthusiasts to explore and learn about the rich cultural heritage of India.', 'This magnificent structure is not only a popular tourist spot but also a paradise for photographers. The majestic walls, intricately designed gates, and sprawling gardens make it a perfect backdrop for photography enthusiasts.', 'The fort provides a diverse range of photography opportunities, from capturing the grandeur of its architecture to the vibrant colors of the markets within its premises.', 'The Qila\'s strategic location also offers breathtaking views of the surrounding cityscape, making it an ideal spot for capturing panoramic shots. With its rich history and stunning aesthetics, Purana Qila is undoubtedly a photographer\'s paradise. It is a place that not only captures the eye but also the heart, making it a must-visit destination for any photography lover. Whether you are an amateur or a professional photographer, Purana Qila has something for everyone to capture and cherish forever.', '20250313055958d4c5a7a25ae90c2ebc2c1de6e2995314.png', 'Early morning is the perfect time for photography at this fort. The soft golden light of the rising sun casts a warm glow over the ancient walls and structures, creating a picturesque scene that is every photographer\'s dream. The quietness of the early hours adds to the charm, allowing one to capture the beauty of the fort without any distractions. The morning dew on the grass and the mist in the air add a mystical element to the photographs, transforming them into works of art. With fewer tourists around, it\'s also easier to get that perfect shot without any obstructions. The contrast of light and shadows at this time of day creates a dramatic effect, highlighting the architectural details and giving a sense of depth to the images. Whether it\'s capturing the majestic entrance or the intricate designs on the walls, early morning is truly a magical time for photography at this old fort.', 'This is a wonderful opportunity to explore the beauty of our surroundings and capture stunning photographs. Whether you are a professional photographer or simply enjoy taking photos as a hobby, this photowalk is open to all and promises to be a fun and enriching experience. So bring your camera, gather with fellow photography enthusiasts and join us for this morning photowalk and creating lasting memories together. See you there!', '202503130559593c528c41dbe9467b9b4ad444a43ca158.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Please not there is a government entry fee of 20Rs to enter the fort to be paid by the participant\",\"2\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"3\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2923.4551080635483!2d77.24116217457188!3d28.609579085124352!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390ce3214b3b6771%3A0x139279610ab2ccb3!2sPurana%20Quila!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1741845525075!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'old fort delhi photowalk', 'old fort delhi photowalk purana quila', '2025-03-13 13:00:00', '2025-08-18 15:35:47', NULL);
