(54, 'Vetal Hill', 'vetal-hill', '20250504064700879aeb93129d499cbfaef60736c2af52.jpg', 'Hanuman Tekdi', 3, '2025-05-10 07:30:00', 'Vetal Hill, also known as the Pashan Hill, is a prominent hill located in Pune, India. It is situated at an elevation of 2600 feet above sea level and offers breathtaking views of the surrounding cityscape. The name \"Vetal\" is derived from the Marathi word \"vetala\" which means demon or ghost, and it is believed that the hill is inhabited by a mythical creature named Vetal. Legend says that the hill was once the kingdom of a demon king named Vetal, who was overthrown by a sage named Agastya.', '202505040647008fbf6d63e3c3c1e17ceb722e806b3c93.jpg', 'Vetal Hill, also known as the Pashan Hill, is a prominent hill located in Pune, India. It is situated at an elevation of 2600 feet above sea level and offers breathtaking views of the surrounding cityscape. The name \"Vetal\" is derived from the Marathi word \"vetala\" which means demon or ghost, and it is believed that the hill is inhabited by a mythical creature named Vetal. Legend says that the hill was once the kingdom of a demon king named Vetal, who was overthrown by a sage named Agastya.', 'Today, Vetal Hill is a popular spot for recreational activities such as trekking, picnics, and birdwatching. It is also home to the famous Vetal Tekdi Ganesh Temple, which attracts hordes of devotees during the Hindu festival of Ganesh Chaturthi. The hill is also a protected area for biodiversity conservation, with over 350 species of flora and fauna found in its vicinity. Overall, Vetal Hill is a must-visit destination for nature lovers and history enthusiasts alike, offering a unique blend of mythology, spirituality, and natural beauty.', '2025050407280521380a13e7ca6313dfd7cfe91d779b10.png', 'Photography is a form of art that allows us to capture the beauty of our surroundings and preserve it for eternity. One of the most breathtaking subjects to capture through photography is the hills and greenery. The rolling hills and lush green landscapes provide a perfect canvas for photographers to showcase their skills and bring out the best in every shot.', 'The hills offer a sense of serenity and tranquility, while the greenery adds a vibrant touch to the pictures. With the right equipment and techniques, one can capture the stunning views, changing colors, and intricate details of the hills and greenery. Whether it\'s the mist-covered mountains or the sun-kissed forests, each frame tells a unique story that can leave a lasting impression on viewers.', NULL, 'The hills and greenery offer an endless opportunity for photographers to explore and capture the beauty of nature in all its glory. So grab your camera, head out to the hills, and let your creativity flow as you capture the mesmerizing scenery through your lens.', '20250504065812ba51d2a34ae3c302ffe74f514aa5d7ce.png', 'If you are a lover of nature and photography, then you should definitely join our photo walk on the hills region. This picturesque location offers stunning views of the surrounding landscape, making it the perfect setting for capturing beautiful photos. Our expert guides will lead you through the winding paths, pointing out unique spots and teaching you how to capture the best shots.', 'Not only will you get to improve your photography skills, but you will also get to explore the natural beauty of this region. So come and join us on this photo walk, and create memories that you can cherish forever. Don\'t miss this opportunity to capture the beauty of nature in all its glory!', '202505040658132a9361e5d960b8f824cc28ae7d9dcad4.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3157.578771622206!2d73.821871!3d18.520616999999998!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2bf00066c37b5%3A0x37da2b34b4a84ce8!2sHanuman%20tekdi!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1746341391019!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'pune photowalk, vetal hill, fujifjilmphotowalk', 'Vetal hill photowalk', '2025-05-04 13:47:01', '2025-05-04 14:28:05', NULL),
(55, 'Tank Bund', 'tank-bund', '202505180820552756f75fb453495f74ca7f788e452c2a.jpg', 'Dr. B.R Ambedkar Statue', 6, '2025-05-24 17:00:00', 'Tank Bund is a popular landmark and tourist attraction in Hyderabad, located on the banks of Hussain Sagar Lake. This 2.8 km long bund was constructed in the late 19th century to prevent the overflowing of the lake during monsoon season. It is adorned with beautiful landscaped gardens, statues, and fountains, making it a picturesque spot for a leisurely walk or picnic. The iconic Buddha statue installed in the middle of the lake can be seen from the bund, adding to its charm. The tank bund is also a major hub for recreational activities such as boating, jet skiing, and parasailing.', '20250518122354aff1d4ae9c4c868a84763da242dfb784.jpg', 'Tank Bund is a popular landmark and tourist attraction in Hyderabad, located on the banks of Hussain Sagar Lake. This 2.8 km long bund was constructed in the late 19th century to prevent the overflowing of the lake during monsoon season. It is adorned with beautiful landscaped gardens, statues, and fountains, making it a picturesque spot for a leisurely walk or picnic. The iconic Buddha statue installed in the middle of the lake can be seen from the bund, adding to its charm. The tank bund is also a major hub for recreational activities such as boating, jet skiing, and parasailing.', 'The surrounding area is dotted with restaurants and food stalls, offering a variety of local delicacies for visitors to indulge in. The bund truly comes alive during festivals like Bonalu and Ganesh Chaturthi when it is beautifully illuminated with thousands of lights, creating a dazzling sight. Tank Bund is not just a structural marvel but also an integral part of Hyderabad\'s culture and heritage, making it a must-visit for anyone exploring the city.', '2025051808205530f6f9a197d79b72f26030368a33b928.png', 'Hussain Sagar Lake, also known as Hussain Lake, is a prominent waterbody located in the heart of Hyderabad, India. Spanning across an area of 5.7 square kilometers, the lake is a popular tourist destination and a major source of drinking water for the city. Built in 1562 by Ibrahim Quli Qutub Shah, the founder of Hyderabad, the lake is named after Hussain Shah Wali, who helped in constructing it.', 'The lake boasts of a unique feature, a large monolithic statue of Gautama Buddha situated right in the middle of the lake on a small island called Buddha Purnima.', 'This stunning statue was installed in 1992 to commemorate the 2000th birth anniversary of Buddha. The lake is surrounded by a beautiful promenade, known as Tank Bund, which offers breathtaking views of the city and is a popular spot for evening walks.', 'Hussain Sagar Lake is not only an attraction for tourists but also an important part of the city\'s heritage and culture, making it a must-visit destination for anyone in Hyderabad.', '202505180820558faeba5e84c135e92fcaa5f5e9929d67.png', 'The Tank Bund also houses the magnificent NTR Gardens, a memorial park dedicated to the former Chief Minister of Andhra Pradesh. Other notable monuments include the striking Telangana Martyrs Memorial, paying homage to those who sacrificed their lives for the formation of the state, and the impressive Victory at Sea Memorial, commemorating the Indian Navy\'s victory in the 1971 Indo-Pak war.\r\n\r\nThese monuments not only add to the charm of Tank Bund but also provide a glimpse into the rich cultural and historical heritage of the city. With its beautiful surroundings and magnificent monuments, Tank Bund is truly a must-visit destination for anyone looking to capture the essence of Hyderabad.', 'We are excited to announce that we have organized an evening photowalk for photography enthusiasts. This is a wonderful opportunity for you to capture stunning silhouettes of the Buddha statue and other majestic mountains in the background. The peaceful and serene ambience of the evening will provide the perfect setting for capturing breathtaking photographs. The soft golden hues of the setting sun against the backdrop of the mountains will create a ethereal effect, making it a photographer\'s dream come true. So, get your cameras ready and join us on this photowalk to capture some truly mesmerizing shots. We look forward to seeing your artistic interpretation of the Buddha statue and the surrounding mountains through your lens. Don\'t miss out on this unique and unforgettable experience!', '20250518082056b63aebd9ec1d3b8fb49bfc1562eda39b.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Note : If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\",\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"Like to meet and interact with photography enthusiast and would love to join our photowalk community\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\",\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d25417.93627898898!2d78.453916905814!3d17.424145388801424!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bcb99e1e13dfe59%3A0x8d17efe23489e306!2sDr.%20B.%20R.%20Ambedkar%20Statue!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1747556402018!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"550\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Tankbund Photowalk', 'Hyderabad Photowalk, Tankbund', '2025-05-18 15:20:57', '2025-05-18 23:03:16', NULL),
(56, 'Sunder Nursery', 'sunder-nursery', '202505261727230fd8e7e81cab107b375fb8c9f6e76ba1.jpg', 'Entrance Gate Sunder Nursery', 5, '2025-05-31 06:30:00', 'Sunder Nursery is a historic oasis located in the heart of New Delhi, India. It covers a sprawling 90 acres of green space, filled with vibrant flora and fauna. Originally built in the 16th century by the Mughal Emperor, Humayun, as a charbagh (four-part) garden, it was later used as a nursery by the British in the early 20th century. After years of neglect, it was revitalized and opened to the public in 2018 as a heritage park, showcasing a beautiful blend of Mughal and British architecture.', '20250527025815d256bd840244bb7f4a9b13bfb3f69841.jpg', 'The nursery is home to over 300 species of trees, including many rare and endangered species. It also houses several historic monuments, such as the Sunderwala Mahal, which was once used as a hunting lodge by the Mughals. With its serene atmosphere, stunning landscapes, and rich cultural history, Sunder Nursery has become a popular destination for both locals and tourists alike.', 'Visitors can enjoy leisurely walks, picnics, and even yoga classes amidst the lush greenery and tranquil surroundings. It is not just a park but a cultural hub that also hosts various events and workshops related to art, music, and nature conservation. Sunder Nursery is truly a hidden gem in the bustling city of Delhi and a must-visit for anyone looking to escape the chaos and immerse themselves in nature\'s beauty and history.', '2025052617272434f66551536036ab4639eeed245236af.png', 'Sunder Nursery is an incredible place for nature photography enthusiasts. Located in the heart of Delhi, this historic park offers a diverse range of flora and fauna that makes it a perfect spot for capturing stunning photographs. The park boasts of over 300 different species of trees, making it a paradise for nature lovers. The well-maintained gardens, water bodies, and walkways provide a picturesque backdrop for photographers to capture the beauty of nature in all its glory.', 'The park also houses several Mughal-era structures, such as tombs, pavilions, and gates, which add a touch of history and architecture to the photographs. The abundance of birds and butterflies in the park adds to the charm and allows photographers to capture some mesmerizing shots. With its serene atmosphere and breathtaking views, Sunder Nursery is undoubtedly a great place to photograph nature and capture its essence in all its glory.', 'Sunder Nursery in Delhi is a popular spot for nature lovers, thanks to its diverse population of bees and butterflies. The nursery houses over 80 species of butterflies, making it a paradise for butterfly enthusiasts.', 'With its wide variety of flowering plants and trees, the nursery provides a perfect habitat for these pollinators to thrive. The buzzing of bees can be heard all around the nursery, as they flit from flower to flower collecting nectar and pollinating the plants. The presence of these important insects also helps in maintaining a balance in the ecosystem of the nursery.', '2025052702562002c308e341fce85077b6df8b3149410a.png', 'Visiting Sunder Nursery is not only a treat for the eyes but also a learning experience about the vital role that bees and butterflies play in our environment. The conservation efforts at Sunder Nursery have resulted in an increase in the population of these pollinators, which is a positive sign for the overall health of our planet. It is heartening to see such initiatives being taken to protect and promote the diversity of bees and butterflies, reminding us of our responsibility to preserve the natural world for future generations.', 'he site also boasts of a variety of flora and fauna with over 300 tree species and numerous bird species. It is a popular destination for nature lovers, history enthusiasts, and photographers alike. The restoration work done on the site has brought back its former grandeur and has made it a must-visit for tourists from all over the world. Sunder Nursery is not just a garden but a living heritage that tells the story of Delhi\'s rich cultural and architectural past. Its inclusion in the list of World Heritage Sites is a testament to its significance and value to the world.', '2025052702562155a311cf67ec1fc6bc1ea0a76a5b98ae.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"There is a basic government entry fee to be paid by the participant to enter the premise\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2923.842762832796!2d77.2451691!3d28.595646700000003!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390ce31c00aad2d5%3A0x5c0ec58c756cec82!2sSunder%20Nursery!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1748280394191!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Sunder Nursery Photowalk Fujifilm', 'Sunder Nursery Photowalk Fujifilm Delhi', '2025-05-27 00:27:26', '2025-05-27 09:58:15', NULL),
(57, 'Swami Narayan Temple', 'swami-narayan-temple', '2025061706142487f972e6269a5cecd94aba651171e626.jpg', 'Entrance Gate', 3, '2025-06-28 08:00:00', 'Swami Narayan Temple Pune is a popular and revered Hindu temple located in the city of Pune, Maharashtra. It is dedicated to Lord Swaminarayan, a form of the Hindu deity Vishnu, and is a significant pilgrimage site for followers of the Swaminarayan Sampradaya. The temple complex is spread over a vast area and includes several shrines, prayer halls, and other structures.', '2025061706142415cee51a4b9bd04537cefb872d9329ad.jpg', 'Swami Narayan Temple Pune is a popular and revered Hindu temple located in the city of Pune, Maharashtra. It is dedicated to Lord Swaminarayan, a form of the Hindu deity Vishnu, and is a significant pilgrimage site for followers of the Swaminarayan Sampradaya. The temple complex is spread over a vast area and includes several shrines, prayer halls, and other structures.', 'The main temple is adorned with intricate carvings and beautiful architecture, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region. The temple also houses a museum showcasing the life and teachings of Lord Swaminarayan. The tranquil atmosphere of the temple, along with its serene surroundings, make it a peaceful place for devotees to offer their prayers and seek blessings.', '20250617061425e391f5d85530ad5f7991a8deb56195c0.png', 'The temple also holds various festivals and celebrations throughout the year, attracting a large number of devotees and visitors. Swami Narayan Temple Pune is not only a religious center but also serves as a hub for social and cultural activities, promoting unity and harmony among people of different backgrounds.', 'It continues to be a source of spiritual guidance and inspiration for its followers, making it an important landmark in the city of Pune.', 'The Swami Narayan Temple in Pune stands as a majestic representation of temple architecture. The temple embodies the traditional Hindu style of architecture, with intricate carvings, vibrant colors, and grand pillars. The temple is dedicated to Lord Swaminarayan, an important deity of the Hindu religion, and is a place of worship and spiritual activities for many devotees.', 'The main entrance of the temple is adorned with a magnificent archway, leading to a spacious courtyard surrounded by smaller shrines dedicated to different gods and goddesses. The highlight of this temple is the beautifully carved central dome, which is a testament to the skilled craftsmanship of the temple\'s architects.', '2025061706225825666b9d91e7faf2cb41fce1f87ea55f.png', 'The temple\'s interior is equally stunning, with intricately carved walls and ceilings, and a grand altar where prayers and offerings are made. The Swami Narayan Temple in Pune not only serves as a place of worship but also as a cultural and architectural marvel, attracting visitors from all over the world. Its unique blend of traditional Hindu architecture and modern amenities makes it a must-visit for anyone interested in history, culture, and spirituality.', 'This Photowalk is for limited participants only. Here you can click some awesome architutre photos', '2025061706142686314091e3688460cab61914aa785d97.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk.\",\"Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d50544.411138370524!2d73.7644178216797!3d18.442081699999992!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc295da5a174d1b%3A0x2445eee2ace04bb3!2sBAPS%20Shri%20Swaminarayan%20Temple!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1750140745482!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'Photowalkspune, Swami Narayan temple photowalk', 'Swami Narayan temple photowalk fujifilm', '2025-06-17 13:14:26', '2025-06-18 12:40:11', NULL),
(58, 'Humayun\'s Tomb', 'humayuns-tomb', '202508150702392f5c874ef55b543c15c55c62ae06744a.jpg', 'Entrance Gate', 5, '2025-08-19 07:00:00', 'Humayun\'s Tomb is a magnificent Mughal-era structure located in the heart of Delhi, India. Built in the 16th century, it is the final resting place of the Mughal Emperor Humayun. The tomb is a perfect blend of Persian and Indian architecture, with its red sandstone and white marble facade adorned with intricate carvings and calligraphy. The tomb stands in the center of a large garden complex, surrounded by pavilions, water channels, and other smaller tombs. It is considered to be the first garden-tomb in the Indian subcontinent and is a UNESCO World Heritage Site.', '202508150702390a159ca184250b2fc8127e41e6ee8473.jpg', 'The grandeur and beauty of Humayun\'s Tomb have influenced the design of many other Mughal structures, including the iconic Taj Mahal. The tomb also holds historical significance as it marked the beginning of a new architectural era in India, which later flourished during the reign of Emperor Shah Jahan. Today, Humayun\'s Tomb stands as a symbol of India\'s rich cultural heritage and continues to attract visitors from all over the world with its grandeur and architectural marvel.', 'located in Delhi, India, is an architectural masterpiece and a popular tourist destination. But it is not just its historical significance that draws in visitors, it is also renowned for being an excellent spot for photography. The grandeur of the Mughal-era structure, with its intricate details and sprawling gardens, makes for a stunning backdrop for photographers.', '202508150702390169ebfc00f87efafa4321323ef3bb10.png', 'The symmetrical layout, towering dome, and intricate carvings provide endless opportunities for creative shots. The play of light and shadow adds to the charm of this magnificent monument, making it a favorite among both amateur and professional photographers. Moreover, the surrounding gardens provide ample space for capturing different angles and perspectives of the tomb.', 'Whether it\'s capturing the grand entrance or the tranquil reflecting pool, there is no shortage of picturesque spots at the Humayun Tomb. With its blend of history, beauty, and photogenic elements, it is no wonder that the Humayun Tomb is considered an excellent location for photography.', 'Photowalk architecture photowalk is a unique and exciting way to explore and photograph the diverse architecture of a city. It is a guided tour where photographers of all levels can come together to capture the beauty and intricacies of buildings, monuments, and urban landscapes.', 'The experience allows participants to not only improve their photography skills but also gain a deeper understanding and appreciation for the architectural history and design of a place. It is a great opportunity to learn from each other and share different perspectives on capturing the perfect shot.', '202508150708456927c052a83d1a09573951839497f664.png', 'The photowalk also encourages creativity and experimentation as participants are encouraged to think outside the box and capture unique angles and compositions. It is a wonderful way to connect with fellow photographers, discover hidden gems within a city, and create stunning visual stories through the lens of a camera.', 'Whether you are a beginner or an experienced photographer, a photowalk architecture photowalk is an enriching experience that combines art, history, and community in one enjoyable outing.', '202508150702398340f0869cd37bf0538eacf59be35a26.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"3\":\"If you are sharing a camera please get your SD we do not give photos back since they are demo products and photos will be formatted once the photowalk is over\",\"4\":\"Please carry your Adhar Card if you are looking to share a camera\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2923.908463891223!2d77.2481742754994!3d28.59328477568623!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x390ce31ce8460ba7%3A0xb9f1ba2d3bdfa80d!2sHumayun%E2%80%99s%20Tomb!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1755241198843!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 0, NULL, 'delhiphotowalk', 'delhiphotowalk, photowalk', '2025-08-15 14:02:40', '2025-08-18 15:36:23', NULL),
(59, 'Ganpati Pandal Photowalk', 'ganpati-pandal-photowalk', '20250825055006f79ec9594f4a8fb9aa12fc93ba8651e6.png', 'Digital Fantasy Store', 3, '2025-08-31 08:00:00', 'Pune’s Ganpati culture is one of the richest and most vibrant aspects of the city’s identity.The tradition began in the late 19th century when Lokmanya Bal Gangadhar Tilak transformed Ganesh Chaturthi from a private family festival into a public celebration. His goal was to unite people against British rule, and Pune became the birthplace of this cultural movement.\r\n\r\nToday, Pune is famous for its “Manache Ganpati” – the five most respected Ganesh idols in the city:\r\nKasba Ganpati\r\nTambdi Jogeshwari\r\nGuruji Talim\r\nTulshibaug Ganpati\r\nKesariwada Ganpati', '20250825055006856c97c5d71041e8a75e429bd444b516.png', 'Pune’s Ganpati culture is one of the richest and most vibrant aspects of the city’s identity.The tradition began in the late 19th century when Lokmanya Bal Gangadhar Tilak transformed Ganesh Chaturthi from a private family festival into a public celebration. His goal was to unite people against British rule, and Pune became the birthplace of this cultural movement.', 'Today, Pune is famous for its “Manache Ganpati” – the five most respected Ganesh idols in the city:\r\nKasba Ganpati\r\nTambdi Jogeshwari\r\nGuruji Talim\r\nTulshibaug Ganpati\r\nKesariwada Ganpati', '2025082505500772777c37be942eb8ce7f01eb6142272b.png', 'The festive season of Ganesh Chaturthi brings with it a flurry of vibrant colors, joyful celebrations and a sense of community spirit. And there couldn\'t be a better time to capture the essence of this festival than during the darshan of Ganpati pandals, filled with people and adorned with beautiful flowers.', 'The energy and enthusiasm of devotees, the intricate decorations, and the bustling atmosphere all come together to create a perfect setting for capturing some stunning photos. The bright and colorful flowers used in the pandals add an extra touch of beauty and charm to the entire scene.', 'As people gather in large numbers to seek blessings from Lord Ganesha, the pandals become a hub of activity, making it an ideal time to capture candid shots of people immersed in prayer and celebration.', 'This is truly a moment worth preserving through photography, as it not only captures the visual aspect but also the emotions and spirit of this auspicious occasion. So grab your camera and head out to capture some memorable moments at the Ganpati pandals filled with people and flowers.', '20250825055007d6de3d82156a6ba1818a23060c2dc308.png', 'As a photographer, one has the unique ability to capture not just the physical aspects of a religious festival, but also the emotions that are deeply intertwined with it. The sights and sounds of a religious festival are often awe-inspiring and mesmerizing, but it is the emotions evoked in people that truly make it a memorable experienceThrough the lens of a camera, one can freeze moments of pure joy, devotion, and spirituality that are characteristic of such festivals. Whether it is the expressions of devotion on the faces of pilgrims or the pure elation of participants in religious processions, a photographer has the power to immortalize these emotions in a single click. This adds a whole new dimension to documenting the essence of a religious festival and allows viewers to connect with it on a deeper level. By capturing people\'s emotions during these festivals, photographers not only preserve memories but also provide a window into the spiritual and cultural significance of these events.', 'During this photowalk, we will be embarking on a journey to explore and capture the beauty of the five different pandals. These pandals hold great significance in the Hindu culture, as they are intricately designed and decorated to honor and worship various deities. As we make our way through the bustling streets, we will witness the vibrant colors, intricate patterns, and detailed artwork that adorn each pandal. With our cameras in hand, we will document the unique themes and cultural elements depicted in each pandal. . Through this photowalk, we will not only showcase the beauty of these pandals but also gain a deeper understanding and appreciation for the rich cultural heritage of India. So, let\'s get ready to immerse ourselves in this visual feast and capture memories that will last a lifetime.', '202508250550083058552a91411dfd8c699d859ff4b9eb.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\",\"2\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"3\":\"Anyone interested in Photography and would like to spend morning weekends clicking and walking around the city\",\"4\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"5\":\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3157.7277110553437!2d73.8542365!3d18.5125478!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2c06d5f9aa37d%3A0x389ab6d4834c4c98!2sGoPro%20official%20Store%20(Digital%20Fantasy)!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1756100938595!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, NULL, 'ganpatipandalphotowalk', 'ganpatipandalphotowalk', '2025-08-25 12:50:09', '2025-08-25 12:59:51', NULL),
(60, 'Kumartuli Ghat', 'kumartuli-ghat', '20250831042550bc3acb63e9a08815d535609eb84bee58.png', 'Kumar Tuli 2 No Railgate', 4, '2025-09-06 07:30:00', 'Kumartuli is a vibrant and bustling neighborhood in the northern part of Kolkata, India. It is known as the hub of the traditional clay idol-making industry, making it an integral part of the city\'s cultural heritage. The narrow lanes and quaint alleys of Kumartuli are lined with small workshops and studios where skilled artisans mold and sculpt beautiful clay idols of various deities for festivals like Durga Puja, Kali Puja, and Saraswati Puja.', '20250831042550e78a153b7e6437c2ac18b21e4df8fe9f.png', 'Kumartuli is a vibrant and bustling neighborhood in the northern part of Kolkata, India. It is known as the hub of the traditional clay idol-making industry, making it an integral part of the city\'s cultural heritage. The narrow lanes and quaint alleys of Kumartuli are lined with small workshops and studios where skilled artisans mold and sculpt beautiful clay idols of various deities for festivals like Durga Puja, Kali Puja, and Saraswati Puja.', 'The artists here have been practicing this craft for generations, passing down their skills and techniques from father to son. The bustling atmosphere during the festive season, with the constant sound of hammers and chisels, is a testament to the dedication and hard work that goes into creating these intricate masterpieces.', '20250831042550fe3af9e510efdb0755558ae31ecdd413.png', 'Apart from idol-making, Kumartuli is also home to many other artisans who specialize in making clay masks, pottery, and other handicrafts. The neighborhood attracts tourists from all over the world who come to witness this unique form of art and experience the rich cultural heritage of Kolkata. Kumartuli is not just a place but a living heritage that continues to thrive and evolve, making it a must-visit destination for anyone looking to explore the traditional art and culture of India.', 'The narrow alleys of Kumartuli are lined with small workshops where skilled artisans can be seen creating beautiful idols of deities with their bare hands. These artisans, belonging to different castes and communities, work together in perfect harmony, creating a unique blend of culture and craftsmanship.', 'The sight of these artisans working with devotion and precision is a treat for any photography enthusiast. The vibrant colors and detailed workmanship of the idols make for stunning photographs, and the energy and enthusiasm of the artisans are evident in each frame', 'Kumartuli is not only a great place for photography but also a cultural hub that showcases the rich heritage and traditions of Bengal through its art.\r\n\r\nDuring this photowalk, we will embark on a journey through the narrow lanes of Kumartuli, a bustling and vibrant neighborhood in Kolkata.', '20250831042551dfa611b248f1a14aeea283a8fd0c0a89.png', 'As we make our way through this historic area, we will be surrounded by the sights and sounds of artisans at work, creating beautiful idols of gods and goddesses for various festivals. The streets will be lined with small workshops and studios, each specializing in a different aspect of idol-making. We will get a glimpse into the intricate process of crafting these idols, from the initial clay modeling to the final embellishments.', 'The air will be filled with the aroma of incense and freshly made paints, adding to the sensory experience of this photowalk. Along the way, we will also encounter local residents going about their daily lives, adding to the authentic charm of this neighborhood. This photowalk through Kumartuli will not only allow us to capture stunning photographs but also give us a deeper understanding and appreciation for the rich cultural heritage of Kolkata and its people.', '202508310425520a0e8dcee6c508cadd7c45a33d311627.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3074.289320898604!2d88.35883347530134!3d22.601836679470864!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3a0277a895ee793f%3A0xb61047fcd753b73d!2sKumar%20tuli%202%20no%20railgate!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1756614281596!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://www.google.com/', 'photowalkskolkata', 'Photowalks at Kumartuli Ghat in Kolkata', '2025-08-31 11:25:52', '2025-11-20 17:30:45', NULL),
(61, 'Malleshwaram', 'malleshwaram', '202512030804528f9b5026350ccb12dc868233cccf3f5f.jpg', 'Organic Mandya', 2, '2025-12-06 06:30:00', 'Malleshwaram is a vibrant and bustling locality in the heart of Bangalore, often referred to as the cultural hub of the city. Located in the north-western part of Bangalore, Malleshwaram is known for its rich heritage, diverse culture, and vibrant markets.', '20251203080452bd9f77b56de2dab7e19bd0d930e89920.png', 'Malleshwaram is a vibrant and bustling locality in the heart of Bangalore, often referred to as the cultural hub of the city. Located in the north-western part of Bangalore, Malleshwaram is known for its rich heritage, diverse culture, and vibrant markets. The main street of Malleshwaram, 8th Cross, is lined with traditional stores selling everything from silk sarees to spices to authentic South Indian snacks. The area also boasts of some of the oldest and most well-known temples in Bangalore, such as the Kadu Malleshwara Temple and the Kaadu Mallikarjunaswamy Temple.', 'he streets are adorned with colorful flower vendors and street food stalls, making it a delight for the senses. Apart from its cultural significance, Malleshwaram is also a popular residential area, with a mix of old-world charm and modern lifestyle. It has a strong sense of community and is known for its friendly residents. With its bustling markets, cultural significance, and warm community feel, Malleshwaram truly captures the essence of Bangalore and is a must-visit for anyone looking to experience the true spirit of the city.', '20251203080453a51e7beda4919ca4219b58f1bb78e2f4.jpg', 'Located in the heart of the city, this market is a hub for all things floral. As soon as you enter, you are greeted by a riot of colors and fragrances from different varieties of flowers like roses, lilies, jasmine, and many more. The market is a popular spot for locals and tourists alike to buy fresh flowers for various occasions like weddings, pujas, and festivals. It is a sight to behold as vendors display their flowers in aesthetically pleasing arrangements, creating a picturesque scene.', 'The market is also known for its affordable prices, making it a favorite among the budget-conscious shoppers. The bustling atmosphere and the hustle-bustle of vendors and customers add to the charm of this place. Overall, Malleshwaram Bangalore flower market is a must-visit for anyone looking to experience the local culture and indulge in some colorful floral shopping.', 'The name Malleshwaram itself is derived from the famous Kaadu Malleshwara Temple, which is believed to be one of the oldest temples in the city. The area is dotted with temples of various deities, each having its own unique history and significance. Some of the notable temples in Malleshwaram include the Gangamma Devi Temple, Kadu Malleshwara Temple, Sri Guru Raghavendra Swamy Temple, and the Someshwara Temple. These temples not only serve as places of worship but also act as cultural hubs, attracting devotees and tourists alike', 'The architecture of these temples is a perfect blend of traditional and modern elements, making them a visual treat for visitors. The annual festivals celebrated at these temples bring the entire community together, creating a sense of unity and harmony. The serene atmosphere and peaceful vibes of these temples make them ideal places to seek spiritual solace in the midst of the bustling city life. Overall, Malleshwaram is a must-visit destination for those looking to explore the rich culture and heritage of Bangalore through its magnificent temples.', '2025120308045414165414313e69c2d92373ffdc5042a2.png', 'The bustling streets of this locality are lined with old heritage buildings, colorful markets, and vibrant street vendors, making it a photographer\'s paradise. The blend of traditional and modern architecture creates a unique backdrop for capturing stunning shots. The narrow lanes and alleys are bustling with life, providing ample opportunities to capture authentic moments of daily life.', 'The vibrant colors, bustling crowds, and intricate details make Malleshwaram a perfect destination for capturing the essence of Bangalore\'s rich culture and heritage. Whether you are a professional photographer or just looking to capture some Instagram-worthy shots, Malleshwaram is the place to be. With its charming ambiance and photogenic settings, this neighborhood is truly excellent for street photography.', '202512030804553bda016e3994dc2fa2b34d5e1dd77c29.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3244.650316610095!2d77.568781675077!3d13.00340748731491!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bae170074deecb1%3A0x36dccea28932e293!2sOrganic%20Mandya%20Farmers%20Market%2C%20Malleshwaram!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1764746784589!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/malleswaram-dawn-walk/692ec6c401ae3232c7122498', 'malleshwaramphotowalks, photowalk, bangalorephotowalk,', 'Photowalk at Malleshwaram Fujifilm', '2025-12-03 15:04:56', '2025-12-03 15:04:56', NULL),
(62, 'Morning Life & Architectural Photowalk', 'morning-life-architectural-photowalk', '202512150526497c2139da4e37106c5d3d16b2d68c3138.jpg', 'New Gate - Bapu Bazar', 11, '2025-12-20 07:30:00', 'Come join us for an exciting photowalk in the beautiful streets of Jaipur, where we will capture the essence of this vibrant city and its lively people. Immerse yourself in the rich culture and architecture as we wander through the bustling markets, historic monuments, and colorful alleys. With your cameras in hand, you will have the opportunity to capture the true essence of Jaipur\'s streets and life, from the bustling daily activities to the charming portraits of locals. This photowalk is perfect for both amateur and professional photographers who are passionate about exploring new places and capturing their unique beauty through their lenses.', '2025121505264994779d2c5b2ee86d25922d3950f8bb12.jpg', 'Jaipur, also known as the Pink City, is a bustling and vibrant city in the state of Rajasthan, India. The mornings in Jaipur are a sight to behold, with the sun rising over the majestic forts and palaces, casting a warm pink glow over the entire city. The streets come alive with the sounds of vendors selling their wares, the aroma of freshly brewed chai, and the chirping of birds.', 'As the city wakes up, people can be seen going about their daily routine, dressed in colorful traditional attire, adding to the already picturesque landscape. The iconic Hawa Mahal, or Palace of Winds, is a popular spot for locals and tourists alike to catch a glimpse of the sunrise and soak in the beauty of the city. The bustling markets are also a must-visit in the morning, with vendors selling everything from traditional handicrafts to mouth-watering street food. Overall, mornings in Jaipur are a perfect blend of culture, tradition, and liveliness that truly captures the essence of this enchanting city.', '2025121505265059792417bd6219e6fddad3620c4d0245.jpg', 'Early morning in Jaipur is the prime time to capture the bustling market and its people as they start their day. The streets are filled with vibrant colors of the traditional attire and the sun glowing in the background adds a warm and inviting atmosphere to the scene.', 'The market is alive with the energy of shopkeepers setting up their stalls, vendors arranging their wares and customers beginning their daily shopping. It is a sight to behold as the market slowly comes to life, providing ample opportunities for photographers to capture the essence of Jaipur\'s culture and business in its most authentic form.', 'The soft morning light also adds a beautiful touch to the photographs, making them even more captivating. For those looking to capture the true essence of the Jaipur market and its people, there is no better time than early morning when everything is just starting, full of potential and excitement.', NULL, '20251215052650c775a2059c740bc7b244a6ac80e669c4.png', 'Come join us for an exciting photowalk in the beautiful streets of Jaipur, where we will capture the essence of this vibrant city and its lively people. Immerse yourself in the rich culture and architecture as we wander through the bustling markets, historic monuments, and colorful alleys. With your cameras in hand, you will have the opportunity to capture the true essence of Jaipur\'s streets and life, from the bustling daily activities to the charming portraits of locals.', 'This photowalk is perfect for both amateur and professional photographers who are passionate about exploring new places and capturing their unique beauty through their lenses. So, don\'t miss this chance to join us and capture the magic of Jaipur through your lens. See you there!', '20251215052651655d4364f5eb21e1d4c5e2492b6890c9.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2969.2936174228184!2d75.82074335!3d26.91639!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x396db6b2300c7a61%3A0xd47d1e2396380fdc!2sNew%20Gate%2C%20Bapu%20Bazar%2C%20Pink%20City%2C%20Jaipur%2C%20Rajasthan%20302003!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1765775826339!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/morning-life-architectural-details-photowalk/6937d69e591088ff4e84426d', 'photowalk jaipur, jaipur photography', 'Morning Life in street of jaipur', '2025-12-15 12:26:52', '2025-12-15 12:32:40', NULL);
