(63, 'Parvati Hill', 'parvati-hill', '20251215095925855f2d8832e5e42cca3e7ee34e8da759.jpg', 'Parvati Paytha', 3, '2025-12-20 07:30:00', 'Parvati Hill, located in the city of Pune, is a popular tourist destination known for its breathtaking views and religious significance. It is situated at a height of 2,100 feet above sea level and is one of the highest points in Pune. The hill is named after the Hindu goddess Parvati, who is believed to have resided here with her husband Lord Shiva. At the top of the hill, there is a temple dedicated to Parvati, which attracts thousands of devotees every year.', '202512150959258bba5c0fad8fb78600b251737cbb551b.jpg', 'Parvati Hill, located in the city of Pune, is a popular tourist destination known for its breathtaking views and religious significance. It is situated at a height of 2,100 feet above sea level and is one of the highest points in Pune. The hill is named after the Hindu goddess Parvati, who is believed to have resided here with her husband Lord Shiva. At the top of the hill, there is a temple dedicated to Parvati, which attracts thousands of devotees every year.', 'The temple is adorned with intricate carvings and colorful decorations, adding to its charm and beauty. Apart from its religious significance, Parvati Hill also offers stunning panoramic views of the city and its surroundings. Visitors can enjoy a peaceful walk or a hike to the top of the hill, surrounded by lush greenery and fresh air. The hill also has several other attractions such as Peshwa Museum, which showcases the history and culture of the Peshwa dynasty, and a small market selling local handicrafts and snacks. Parvati Hill is a must-visit for anyone traveling to Pune, offering a perfect blend of spirituality, nature, and history.', '20251215095926ec1e1dbc88fd819326decc3aff4da2d7.jpg', 'Photographers can capture the lush greenery, ancient temples, and historic structures that adorn the hill. The tranquil atmosphere and cool breeze make it an ideal location for capturing natural landscapes and portraits. Many photographers visit this spot to capture the beauty of the city in its purest form. The peaceful surroundings and serene ambiance provide the perfect setting for capturing stunning shots. With its scenic beauty and peaceful atmosphere, Parvati Hill in Pune is undoubtedly a haven for morning photography enthusiasts.', NULL, NULL, 'The hill holds great significance for the locals as it is home to several temples and a museum. As one makes their way up the hill, they are greeted by the beautiful architecture of the temples dedicated to various Hindu deities such as Lord Shiva, Lord Ganesh, and Goddess Parvati. The intricate carvings and vibrant colors of these temples showcase the rich cultural heritage of India. At the top of the hill, one can visit the Parvati Museum which houses a collection of ancient artifacts, sculptures, and paintings that depict the history and culture of Pune. The museum also offers a breathtaking view of the city below. Parvati Hill is not only a place of religious significance but also a hub for art and history enthusiasts. It is a must-visit for anyone looking to explore the vibrant culture and heritage of Pune.', '2025121509592686c44615150ad3877e2fbedb94d470be.png', 'Standing atop the Parvati Hill in Pune, one can witness the breathtaking view of the city during dawn. As the sun rises, it illuminates the urban landscape, revealing the development and changes that have occurred over the years. The once small and quaint city has transformed into a bustling metropolis, with skyscrapers and high-rise buildings dominating the skyline. The streets that were once filled with bicycles and bullock carts are now crowded with cars and motorcycles. The city has expanded its boundaries and developed rapidly, attracting people from all over the country.', 'However, while the city may have changed physically, its charm and rich cultural heritage remain intact. This view from Parvati Hill serves as a reminder of the city\'s progress and growth, while also showcasing its unique blend of traditional and modern elements. It is a testament to how a city can evolve and adapt while still retaining its essence.', '20251215095927fa95457bb8c13834b835c6654f5ef9f8.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d12632.780596293092!2d73.84548045!3d18.487201!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc2c007c7e37f75%3A0xf193a4fb3c63cc56!2sParvati%20Paytha%2C%20Pune%2C%20Maharashtra!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1765977780754!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/parvati-hill-photo-walk/694290e55da1dbd1ccc456ee', 'pune photowalk', 'pune photowalk parvati hill, photowalksindia', '2025-12-15 16:59:28', '2025-12-17 20:24:30', NULL),
(64, 'Bandra Fort', 'bandra-fort', '20251217083621962aba6da8c85fca3ffb672dcf77b114.jpg', 'Entrance Gate Bandra Fort', 1, '2025-12-20 07:00:00', 'Tarun Kumar <tarun8613@gmail.com>\r\n12:50 PM (1 hour ago)\r\nto me\r\n\r\nBandra Fort, also known as Castella de Aguada, is a historic fort located in the suburb of Bandra in Mumbai, India. The fort was built by the Portuguese in the 16th century as a watchtower to guard the coastline and defend against enemy attacks. It was later used as a strategic location for trading activities by the British. The fort is a blend of Portuguese and Indian architectural styles, with its distinctive stone structure and intricate carvings. It also has a unique shape, octagonal in nature, giving it a striking appearance.', '2025121708362147f0a62cda9e559732167bd82da3ceb2.jpg', 'Bandra Fort, also known as Castella de Aguada, is a historic fort located in the suburb of Bandra in Mumbai, India. The fort was built by the Portuguese in the 16th century as a watchtower to guard the coastline and defend against enemy attacks', '. It was later used as a strategic location for trading activities by the British. The fort is a blend of Portuguese and Indian architectural styles, with its distinctive stone structure and intricate carvings', '2025121708362224ab887bc0295d0334c80e77dd1d6876.png', 'is a popular spot for street photography due to its stunning views of the Arabian Sea and the ongoing construction of the iconic sea link. The bustling street is lined with colorful buildings and vibrant street art, making it a visual treat for photographers. As one strolls along the promenade, the sound of crashing waves and the salty sea breeze create a serene ambiance. The current construction of the sea link adds an interesting element to photographs, capturing the city\'s ever-evolving landscape. Whether it\'s capturing the golden hues of sunset reflecting off the sea or the hustle and bustle of the busy street below, Bandra Bandstand offers endless opportunities for photographers to capture unique and captivating images.', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025121708362205f824296aa104f8f437ee841a7cb463.png', 'It is no wonder that this spot has become a favorite among both amateur and professional photographers alike. However, one of the most iconic landmarks of Bandra is the sea link. As one drives down the Bandra Worli Sea Link, also known as the Rajiv Gandhi Sea Link, they are greeted with a breathtaking view of the Arabian Sea. The bridge, spanning over 5.6 kilometers, connects Bandra to Worli and has become an integral part of Mumbai\'s skyline. The sea link has not only reduced travel time between the two areas but has also become a popular spot for tourists and locals alike.', 'From the sea link, one can witness the hustle and bustle of the city on one side and the calm waters of the Arabian Sea on the other. The view is especially enchanting during sunset when the sky is painted in hues of orange and pink, making it a perfect spot for a romantic evening stroll. The sea link has not only become a symbol of modern architecture but also a source of pride for the residents of Bandra. It is truly a sight to behold and adds to the charm and beauty of this vibrant suburb.', '202512170841339dfa893e2027836e1b2c01b706bfa53e.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3147.8246809307248!2d72.81578447520455!3d19.041889182155735!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7c94fec37e32f%3A0xbd1c604e235425bc!2sBandra%20Fort!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1765960035306!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/heritage-walk-bandra-fort-photo-walk/69414c9f71580716eb75310d', 'Bandra fort photowalk', 'Photowalk at Bandra Fort', '2025-12-17 15:36:23', '2025-12-17 15:41:34', NULL),
(65, 'Phool Market', 'phool-market', '202601080510343783be63498eae2985f38500738ad469.jpg', 'Sitabuldi metro station Main Entrance Gate', 12, '2026-01-11 07:00:00', 'The Mahatma Phule Phool Market in Nagpur is a bustling hub of activity, known for its vibrant and colorful display of flowers, fruits, and vegetables. Located in the heart of the city, this market is named after the renowned social reformer, Mahatma Jyotirao Phule, who dedicated his life to empowering marginalized communities. It is a popular destination for locals and tourists alike, with vendors selling a variety of fresh produce and flowers at affordable prices. The fragrant aroma of different flowers fills the air, making it a delight for the senses.', '20260108051034e715bf222724f2ebd784c1721939f3e8.jpg', 'The Mahatma Phule Phool Market in Nagpur is a bustling hub of activity, known for its vibrant and colorful display of flowers, fruits, and vegetables. Located in the heart of the city, this market is named after the renowned social reformer, Mahatma Jyotirao Phule, who dedicated his life to empowering marginalized communities. It is a popular destination for locals and tourists alike, with vendors selling a variety of fresh produce and flowers at affordable prices. The fragrant aroma of different flowers fills the air, making it a delight for the senses.', NULL, '20260108051034e55cb714b5902104dbe97db424cb9878.png', 'The market is also home to small eateries and street food stalls, offering mouth-watering dishes that are a must-try for any food lover. With its lively atmosphere and cultural significance, the Mahatma Phule Phool Market in nagpur is a must-visit for anyone looking to experience the vibrant culture and traditions of this historic city.', 'Amid the incredible and vivid visuals of the market, the sunlight filtering through the petals and leaves of the flowers creates beautiful natural lighting for photographers to play with for capturing lively pictures. The colorful backdrop, vibrant energy, and most importantly, a varied range of subjects are nothing less than a dream venue for a photoshoot.', NULL, 'his is an exciting opportunity for photography enthusiasts to explore the bustling flower market in Nagpur. The market, named after social reformer Mahatma Jyotirao Phule, is a vibrant hub of activity where a wide variety of colorful flowers are bought and sold every day. This photowalk is a unique chance to capture the essence of the market, from the bright blooms to the busy vendors and customers.', '20260108051035ca3fa8a26dc58b16b307fef8ec6de3d7.png', 'Every flower blossoms with a beautiful significance. You can feel the warmth in the saffron-colored marigolds, a loving embrace among the red roses, camaraderie among the jasmines, a peaceful radiance in the white lilies, prosperity in the leaves of tulsi, and Indian festive energy in the vermillion hues of garlands. These aren’t just the colors of flowers lying around in the baskets but the colors that represent the cultural diversity that one gets to witness in this country.', 'Participants can stroll through the crowded lanes, interact with the locals, and capture stunning shots of the floral displays and traditional decorations. The photowalk also offers a chance to learn about the history and significance of the market, as well as the cultural traditions surrounding it. It is a perfect blend of photography, culture, and community, making it a must-do experience for anyone interested in exploring Nagpur’s rich heritage and capturing its beauty through their lens. Whether you are a professional photographer or an amateur looking to improve your skills, Mahatma Phule Phool Market Photowalk is an unforgettable experience that should not be missed.', '20260108051036ea0c5e572d9e16e7093b69838bacdf86.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3105.9051361131815!2d79.0802449752597!3d21.14158393053617!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bd4c094604e27ab%3A0xb210b10c6f1e24c7!2sSitabuldi%20Station!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1767848834878!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/phool-market-photowalk/695e304e228248674bf44583', 'Nagpurphotowalk, photowalk,', 'Phool Market Photowalk in Nagpur', '2026-01-08 12:10:38', '2026-01-08 12:10:38', NULL),
(66, 'Sukhna Lake', 'sukhna-lake', '2026011517402764a6d2dcf941b0227f74c884fca70c8a.jpg', '2 Wheeler Parking Area', 15, '2026-01-24 08:00:00', 'Sukhna Lake is a man-made reservoir located at the foothills of the Shivalik Range in Chandigarh, India. The lake, spread over an area of 3 square kilometers, was created in 1958 by damming the Sukhna Choe (a seasonal stream). It is a popular tourist destination and a beloved spot for locals as well. The picturesque lake is surrounded by lush greenery, making it a perfect place for a peaceful stroll or a serene picnic. Boating facilities are available, allowing visitors to take in the stunning views of the lake while gliding through its calm waters.', '20260115174027e3959864dac1b07713d3bcf65bb82ee9.jpg', 'Sukhna Lake is a man-made reservoir located at the foothills of the Shivalik Range in Chandigarh, India. The lake, spread over an area of 3 square kilometers, was created in 1958 by damming the Sukhna Choe (a seasonal stream). It is a popular tourist destination and a beloved spot for locals as well. The picturesque lake is surrounded by lush greenery, making it a perfect place for a peaceful stroll or a serene picnic. Boating facilities are available, allowing visitors to take in the stunning views of the lake while gliding through its calm waters.', 'The lake also hosts various water sports activities like water skiing, kayaking, and canoeing, attracting adventure enthusiasts. Sukhna Lake is not just a recreational spot; it also serves as a habitat for several migratory birds, making it a haven for bird watchers. The Lake Promenade has become a hub for cultural activities, with regular events like musical performances and art exhibitions taking place. Overall, Sukhna Lake is a charming and tranquil destination that offers something for everyone to enjoy and appreciate.', '202601151740275f7289e7979e031a8ea35cb9d5efb20e.png', 'Sukhna Lake, located in the city of Chandigarh, India, is considered one of the most picturesque lakes in the country and is a popular spot for photographers. The serene and tranquil surroundings of the lake make it an ideal location for capturing stunning photographs. The beautiful reflections of the Shivalik mountain range on its clear waters, combined with the lush greenery and vibrant flowers that surround the lake, create a perfect backdrop for photography.', NULL, NULL, 'The lake also offers a diverse variety of flora and fauna, making it a haven for nature photographers. From birds to butterflies, from boats to people, Sukhna Lake provides endless opportunities for photographers to capture breathtaking shots. The changing colors of the sky during sunrise and sunset add a touch of magic to the lake, making it a must-visit spot for both amateur and professional photographers. With its idyllic setting and natural beauty, Sukhna Lake truly is a paradise for photography enthusiasts.', '20260115174027c574985f787ab042ae497e60973c6363.png', 'The early morning golden hour at Sukhna Lake is a breathtaking experience for any photography enthusiast. As the first rays of sunlight gently kiss the calm waters of the lake, the entire landscape is transformed into a picturesque paradise. The golden hour, also known as the magic hour, is a short window of time right after sunrise when the light is soft, warm, and perfect for capturing stunning photographs.', 'The reflections of the surrounding trees and mountains on the shimmering lake create a mesmerizing sight that is truly a sight to behold. The gentle breeze adds an ethereal touch to the scenery, making it a perfect setting for a peaceful and serene photowalk. With the sun rising in the background and the vibrant colors of nature coming alive, Sukhna Lake during the golden hour is an ideal spot for photographers to capture some truly remarkable shots and create lasting memories.', '202601151740280a41d1208ae24de2f4ff88591ceb44d4.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<div class=\"mapouter\"><div class=\"gmap_canvas\"><iframe class=\"gmap_iframe\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?width=100%&amp;height=600&amp;hl=en&amp;q=sukhna lake bike parking&amp;t=&amp;z=14&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;iwloc=B&amp;output=embed\"></iframe><a href=\"https://embed-googlemap.com\">embed-googlemap.com</a></div><style>.mapouter{position:relative;text-align:right;width:600px;height:400px;}.gmap_canvas {overflow:hidden;background:none!important;width:600px;height:400px;}.gmap_iframe {width:600px!important;height:400px!important;}</style></div>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/sukhna-lake-photowalk/695e2e34228248674bf405b1', 'photowalk Sukhna Lake', 'Sukhna Lake photowalk', '2026-01-16 00:40:29', '2026-01-18 12:51:36', NULL),
(67, 'Jal Mahal', 'jal-mahal', '202601160520087098554cde321b957ecaa96d86d5655b.jpg', 'Selfie Point Jal Mahal', 11, '2026-01-25 07:30:00', 'Located in the heart of Jaipur, India, JAL MAHAL or \"Water Palace\" is a stunning architectural gem that stands amidst the tranquil waters of Man Sagar Lake. Built in the 18th century by Maharaja Jai Singh II, the palace is a perfect blend of Rajput and Mughal styles of architecture. The palace is a five-story structure, with four floors submerged in the lake. The top floor, made of red sandstone, showcases intricate carvings and designs, while the lower floors are adorned with delicate stone latticework and filigree.', '20260116052008a088f527698c10fdb3ccf7aa7b089a3b.jpg', 'Located in the heart of Jaipur, India, JAL MAHAL or \"Water Palace\" is a stunning architectural gem that stands amidst the tranquil waters of Man Sagar Lake. Built in the 18th century by Maharaja Jai Singh II, the palace is a perfect blend of Rajput and Mughal styles of architecture. The palace is a five-story structure, with four floors submerged in the lake. The top floor, made of red sandstone, showcases intricate carvings and designs, while the lower floors are adorned with delicate stone latticework and filigree.', NULL, '2026011605200831627c6e68d2a788224ba0d573963d7d.png', 'The palace served as a royal hunting lodge for the Maharajas and was also used for grand celebrations and festivities. Today, the stunning palace stands as a popular tourist attraction, offering a picturesque view of the lake and the surrounding Aravalli hills. Visitors can take a boat ride to get a closer look at this magnificent structure and admire its beauty from all angles. The JAL MAHAL is not only a testament to the rich history and culture of Jaipur but also a symbol of its enduring beauty and charm.', NULL, NULL, 'It is a five-story palace that appears to float on the serene Man Sagar Lake, making it a photographer\'s dream come true. The beautiful palace, built with red sandstone, showcases a blend of Rajput and Mughal architectural styles, creating a picturesque backdrop for photography. The reflections of the palace in the crystal clear waters of the lake make for truly breathtaking shots.', '20260116052008e2a0bec66f7775637157baa76aa03c9b.png', 'The intricate details and designs on the walls and balconies of the palace add to its charm and provide endless opportunities for creative photography. The surrounding Aravalli hills, lush greenery, and the resident bird population add to the natural beauty of this place. Whether capturing the sunrise or sunset, or experimenting with different angles and perspectives, JAL MAHAL offers endless possibilities for photographers to capture stunning shots. It is no wonder that JAL MAHAL is considered one of the most photogenic places in Jaipur, and a must-visit destination for any photography enthusiast.\r\n\r\nAs a photographer, it is not just about capturing the beauty of landscapes and monuments, but also about the people and the environment surrounding them. When it comes to the famous Jal Mahal in India, it is not just the stunning palace that needs to be photographed, but also the vibrant streets and the tourists bustling around. By capturing the locals going about their daily lives and tourists mesmerized by the grandeur of Jal Mahal, we can showcase the true essence of the location. These photographs can not only attract more visitors to the area but also serve as a marketing tool for promoting tourism.', 'The streets around Jal Mahal are filled with colorful shops, food stalls, and street performers that add to the charm of the place. As a photographer, it is our responsibility to capture these moments and bring them to life through our lens, showcasing the culture and diversity of the location. These photographs can also serve as a reminder for tourists of their memorable experience at Jal Mahal and entice them to return or recommend it to others. Overall, as a photographer, we have the power to capture not just a monument but also the lively atmosphere and people surrounding it, making our photographs truly captivating and impactful.\r\n\r\nSo register for  the Jal Mahal Photowalk and join the learning process on the field while we take you for the photowalk.', '2026011605201091d2b6fef5065f1d3ac3e90fd974c765.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2968.3398744895803!2d75.84177136372374!3d26.95261705280565!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x396db10b31f189cb%3A0xfca645985b9e7bde!2sSelfie%20Point%2C%20Jal%20Mahal!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1768540580935!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/jal-mahal-photo-walk/6960d0158540b0fc08bab0f4', 'Jal Mahal Photowalk', 'Jal Mahal Photowalk, Jaipur Photowalk, Photowalk India', '2026-01-16 12:20:12', '2026-01-16 12:20:12', NULL),
(68, 'Ambrai Ghat', 'ambrai-ghat', '20260119074100bccdb7999ad6307dfb71ee91e8346b7f.jpg', 'Ambrai Ghat', 14, '2026-01-24 07:30:00', 'Ambrai Ghat, located on the banks of Lake Pichola in Udaipur, is a popular tourist attraction known for its scenic beauty and serene atmosphere. This ghat offers breathtaking views of the lake and the surrounding Aravalli hills, making it a favorite spot for tourists to capture the perfect picture postcard of Udaipur. The ghat is also famous for its mesmerizing sunset views, with the sun setting behind the majestic City Palace, which is located just across the lake. The ghat is adorned with beautiful gardens, fountains, and traditional Rajasthani architecture, adding to its charm.', '202601190741008ca040227696501f1b693ae5c7b326f9.jpg', 'Ambrai Ghat, located on the banks of Lake Pichola in Udaipur, is a popular tourist attraction known for its scenic beauty and serene atmosphere. This ghat offers breathtaking views of the lake and the surrounding Aravalli hills, making it a favorite spot for tourists to capture the perfect picture postcard of Udaipur. The ghat is also famous for its mesmerizing sunset views, with the sun setting behind the majestic City Palace, which is located just across the lake. The ghat is adorned with beautiful gardens, fountains, and traditional Rajasthani architecture, adding to its charm.', NULL, '202601190741009f57b1c7efc383d9e632f8a46ea4a628.png', 'It is a perfect place to relax and unwind, away from the hustle and bustle of the city. Visitors can also take a boat ride on the lake from here and explore other popular attractions like Jag Mandir Island and Lake Palace. With its picturesque setting and tranquil ambience, Ambrai Ghat is a must-visit destination for anyone traveling to Udaipur.', NULL, NULL, 'Ambrai Ghat in Udaipur is a picturesque location that is perfect for photography enthusiasts. This stunning ghat, situated on the banks of Lake Pichola, offers a breathtaking view of the City Palace and the iconic Lake Palace in the background. The intricate architecture of the ghat, with its beautiful archways and steps, creates a perfect setting for capturing stunning shots. The ghat is also surrounded by vibrant markets, bustling streets, and traditional houses, making it an ideal spot for capturing the essence of Udaipur\'s culture and lifestyle.', '202601190741013400b1a921937bef5041f9cbb7020e36.png', 'The golden hues of the setting sun against the backdrop of majestic palaces and boats floating in the lake add a touch of magic to every photograph taken here. Whether it\'s candid street photography or landscape shots, Ambrai Ghat provides endless possibilities for photographers to hone their skills and capture stunning images. The lively atmosphere, stunning views, and rich cultural heritage make Ambrai Ghat a must-visit destination for any photography enthusiast visiting Udaipur.', 'The photowalk promises to be a perfect blend of culture, history, and scenic beauty, making it an ideal spot for photographers to unleash their creativity. Joining this photowalk will not only allow you to capture breathtaking shots but also give you a chance to interact and learn from fellow photographers. With the guidance of professional photographers, you can improve your skills and techniques while exploring one of the most picturesque locations in Udaipur. So, if you have a love for photography and want to capture the essence of Udaipur, don\'t miss out on this amazing opportunity. Come and be a part of the Ambrai Ghat photowalk and create memories that will last a lifetime.', '20260119074103d8d3cd7a63f68afc17a0985f314c85ec.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3028.338771866773!2d73.67990209999999!3d24.5775547!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3967e5671fa9507f%3A0x8093d8f0ccad209a!2sAmbrai%20Ghat!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1768808347366!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/udaipur-street-photowalk-at-ambari-ghat/69648c0b16d2f37636f05c8e', 'Ambrai Photowalk Udaipur Photowalk', 'Ambrai Photowalk Udaipur Photowalk', '2026-01-19 14:41:04', '2026-01-19 14:41:04', NULL),
(69, 'Street Photography', 'street-photography', '202601200415286a73494464af7656c893059af3bc8b26.jpg', 'Entrance Gate -  Kanakakkunnu Palace', 17, '2026-01-24 06:00:00', 'Trivandrum, the capital city of the Indian state of Kerala, is a bustling metropolis with a rich cultural heritage. It is a city that is steeped in history, with its ancient temples, colonial architecture, and vibrant markets. But amidst all this chaos and beauty lies a treasure trove for street photographers. Trivandrum\'s streets are a perfect blend of old and new, with its chaotic narrow lanes and modern high-rise buildings.', '20260120041528725a761565095eadfbac354b870a1b16.jpg', 'Welcome to the world of street photography photowalk, where the bustling streets and vibrant city life serve as the perfect backdrop for capturing captivating images. As we embark on this journey, we will explore the art of capturing candid moments and telling stories through our lenses. With the hustle and bustle of everyday life as our playground, we will learn to see things in a different light and notice the small details that make a big impact. This photowalk is not just about taking photos, but also about connecting with our surroundings and the people in it. So get ready to immerse yourself in the sights, sounds, and energy of the city as we embark on this exciting adventure together. Whether you\'re a beginner or an experienced photographer, this photowalk will offer you a unique and enriching experience that will enhance your skills and broaden your perspective. So let\'s grab our cameras and hit the streets, ready to capture the beauty and essence of street life. Welcome to street photography photowalk – a journey full of creativity, exploration, and inspiration.', NULL, '20260120041528de581d0a352abdd6bc399b44f120e437.png', 'Trivandrum, the capital city of the Indian state of Kerala, is a bustling metropolis with a rich cultural heritage. It is a city that is steeped in history, with its ancient temples, colonial architecture, and vibrant markets. But amidst all this chaos and beauty lies a treasure trove for street photographers.', 'Trivandrum\'s streets are a perfect blend of old and new, with its chaotic narrow lanes and modern high-rise buildings. This makes for a diverse and interesting backdrop for capturing street photography.', 'The city\'s people are equally captivating, with their unique quirks and cultural practices that make for great subjects. Whether it\'s the bustling Chalai market, the colorful temple festivals, or the serene backwaters, Trivandrum offers endless opportunities for capturing raw and authentic street photography.', 'With its vibrant culture and chaotic charm, Trivandrum is truly a street photographer\'s paradise waiting to be explored.', '202601200415289f257c9d44790326118170ad16130879.png', 'Kanakakunnu Palace is a magnificent and iconic structure located in the heart of Thiruvananthapuram, the capital city of Kerala in India. This beautiful palace was built during the reign of Travancore dynasty and was once the royal residence of the kings and queens of the state. However, today it serves as a major tourist attraction, showcasing the rich cultural heritage and architectural brilliance of Kerala.', 'The palace is a perfect blend of traditional Kerala style and British colonial influence, with its grandiose entrance arches, intricate carvings, and elegant pillars. The palace also boasts of extensive gardens, manicured lawns, and a stunning musical fountain that adds to its charm. Apart from being a popular tourist spot, the Kanakakunnu Palace is also a frequent venue for various cultural events, exhibitions, and fairs, making it a hub for art and entertainment in the city. Its historical significance, architectural beauty, and cultural significance make it a must-visit destination for anyone visiting Thiruvananthapuram.', '202601200415305183b4fac1f625c2eb28073e9d3a9a7c.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"1\":\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"2\":\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"3\":\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"4\":\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"}', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6586.711181913761!2d76.95786899999999!3d8.512845!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3b05bbcea240da8d%3A0xd845e7d158a2f1fd!2sKanakakkunnu%20Palace!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1768882270640!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/street-photo-walk-see-beyond-the-ordinary/6960cbdd8540b0fc08ba3ad9', 'Streets of Trivandrum Photowalk', 'Streets of Trivandrum Photowalk', '2026-01-20 11:15:31', '2026-01-20 11:20:11', NULL),
(70, 'Sula Wines', 'sula-wines', '202601281149499719be460a7152bca084da0d1bf32425.jpg', 'Sula wines Entrance Gate', 18, '2026-02-01 07:00:00', 'Sula Wines, located in the picturesque Nashik region of India, offers a perfect blend of stunning landscape and delicious wines, making it an ideal destination for photography enthusiasts. The sprawling vineyards, surrounded by lush greenery and rolling hills, provide a breathtaking backdrop for capturing the beauty of nature.', '20260128114949d7505d30f48b91eeb19f68bd59f77c58.jpg', 'The winery\'s architecture, with its white buildings and red roofs, adds a charming touch to the landscape and makes for stunning photographs. The changing colors of the sky during sunset, reflected in the calm waters of the lake, are a photographer\'s dream come true', 'Sula Wines also offers guided tours of their vineyards and winemaking process, providing an opportunity to capture unique shots and learn about wine production. With its serene setting and excellent lighting, Sula Wines is truly a paradise for landscape photography, making it a must-visit destination for both wine lovers and photography enthusiasts alike.', '20260128114950250c7f1e458580802cd9e1561f11de17.png', 'The winery boasts of state-of-the-art technology and a team of expert winemakers, resulting in award-winning wines that have gained recognition worldwide. Sula Wines offers a diverse range of wines, from the classic Sauvignon Blanc and Shiraz to unique blends like the Dindori Reserve Shiraz and Riesling. Apart from producing quality wines', NULL, NULL, 'Sula also promotes sustainable farming practices and has implemented various initiatives to reduce their carbon footprint. With a beautiful vineyard resort, wine tastings, and events like the annual Sula Fest, Sula Wines has become a popular destination for wine lovers and tourists alike. It is not just a winery but a lifestyle brand that celebrates the Indian wine culture and continues to push boundaries in the world of winemaking. Overall, Sula Wines has played a crucial role in promoting the Indian wine industry and continues to be a pioneer in producing world-class wines.', '202601281149509a44a44cb1a0b1d6b96ffeb11a281f4c.png', 'ula Fest, held annually in Nashik, India, is a two-day festival that celebrates music, food, and wine. The festival takes place in the scenic Sula Vineyards, known for its award-winning wines and beautiful surroundings. With a diverse lineup of local and international artists performing on multiple stages, Sula Fest attracts music lovers from all over the country. The festival also offers a wide variety of food options, ranging from local street food to gourmet dishes prepared by renowned chefs. Attendees can also indulge in wine tastings and vineyard tours, learning about the winemaking process while enjoying the picturesque views.', 'Sula Fest is not just about music and food, but it also promotes sustainability and eco-friendliness by incorporating eco-friendly practices into its operations. From using biodegradable cups to encouraging waste segregation, the festival aims to create a positive impact on the environment. Sula Fest has become a must-attend event for both locals and tourists, providing a unique and memorable experience that combines music, wine, and nature in one vibrant celebration.', '2026012811495197e55c8dca7179bea3978169b017dba4.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"Photowalk is open to all above the Age of 18 Years\",\"Participant can click photos from any camera or mobile phones\",\"If you do not have a camera we will provide you with a mirrorless camera that will be shared with other participants during the photowalk. Please carry a SD Card to so you can take your clicked photos back. We would require a photo ID with address proof to be submitted at the time of the photowalk.\",\"Please note that photo walks are done on foot, so expect lots of walking.\"]', '<iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1564.5552451765045!2d73.68641866691836!3d20.00538101110046!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bddedba795be8dd%3A0xb20dce447adb0a9d!2sSula%20Vineyards!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1769600204165!5m2!1sen!2sin\" width=\"100%\" height=\"650\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>', 1, 'https://fujifilmxacademy.com/activity/sula-fest-photo-walk/6979a3a28e49376b44b9c2c3', 'Sula Photowalk', 'Sula Photowalk', '2026-01-28 18:49:52', '2026-01-28 18:49:52', NULL);
